</li>
<li data-start="1172" data-end="1200">
<p data-start="1174" data-end="1200">State giỏ hàng đặt ở <code data-start="1195" data-end="1200">App</code></p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="1202" data-end="1205">
