   ↓ props
&lt;Cart /&gt;
   ↓ map()
Hiển </span><span><span class="hljs-selector-tag">th</span></span><span>ị danh sách già</span><span><span class="hljs-attribute">y</span></span><span>
</span></span></code></div></div></pre>
