<hr data-start="137" data-end="140">
<h1 data-start="142" data-end="190">🌐 CÁC TRANG WEB BỎ Ở ĐÂU? CÁI NÀO LÀ FE / BE?</h1>
<h2 data-start="192" data-end="244">1️⃣ <strong data-start="199" data-end="244">Các TRANG của website bỏ vào thư mục nào?</strong></h2>
<p data-start="245" data-end="280">👉 <strong data-start="248" data-end="280">BỎ TRONG <code data-start="259" data-end="267">pages/</code> (Frontend)</strong></p>
<h3 data-start="282" data-end="305">Ví dụ web bán giày:</h3>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="306" data-end="511"><div class="contain-inline-size rounded-2xl corner-superellipse/1.1 relative bg-token-sidebar-surface-primary"><div class="flex items-center text-token-text-secondary px-4 py-2 text-xs font-sans justify-between h-9 bg-token-sidebar-surface-primary select-none rounded-t-2xl corner-t-superellipse/1.1">css</div><div class="sticky top-[calc(var(--sticky-padding-top)+9*var(--spacing))]"><div class="absolute end-0 bottom-0 flex h-9 items-center pe-2"><div class="bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary text-token-text-secondary flex items-center gap-4 rounded-sm px-2 font-sans text-xs"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none py-1" aria-label="Sao chép"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-j9921kii.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg>Sao chép mã</button></div></div></div><div class="overflow-y-auto p-4" dir="ltr"><code class="whitespace-pre!"><span><span><span class="hljs-attribute">src</span></span><span>/pages/
 ├─ Home</span><span><span class="hljs-selector-class">.jsx</span></span><span>        → Trang chủ
 ├─ Product</span><span><span class="hljs-selector-class">.jsx</span></span><span>     → Trang chi tiết già</span><span><span class="hljs-attribute">y</span></span><span>
 ├─ Cart</span><span><span class="hljs-selector-class">.jsx</span></span><span>        → Trang giỏ hàng
 ├─ Login</span><span><span class="hljs-selector-class">.jsx</span></span><span>       → Trang đăng nhậ</span><span><span class="hljs-selector-tag">p</span></span><span>
 └─ Checkout</span><span><span class="hljs-selector-class">.jsx</span></span><span>   → Trang thanh </span><span><span class="hljs-selector-tag">to</span></span><span>án
</span></span></code></div></div></pre>
<p data-start="513" data-end="538">📌 <strong data-start="516" data-end="538">Mỗi file = 1 trang</strong></p>
<hr data-start="540" data-end="543">
<h2 data-start="545" data-end="572">2️⃣ <code data-start="552" data-end="565">components/</code> là gì?</h2>
<p data-start="573" data-end="609">👉 <strong data-start="576" data-end="609">Frontend – component dùng lại</strong></p>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="611" data-end="744"><div class="contain-inline-size rounded-2xl corner-superellipse/1.1 relative bg-token-sidebar-surface-primary"><div class="flex items-center text-token-text-secondary px-4 py-2 text-xs font-sans justify-between h-9 bg-token-sidebar-surface-primary select-none rounded-t-2xl corner-t-superellipse/1.1">css</div><div class="sticky top-[calc(var(--sticky-padding-top)+9*var(--spacing))]"><div class="absolute end-0 bottom-0 flex h-9 items-center pe-2"><div class="bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary text-token-text-secondary flex items-center gap-4 rounded-sm px-2 font-sans text-xs"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none py-1" aria-label="Sao chép"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-j9921kii.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg>Sao chép mã</button></div></div></div><div class="overflow-y-auto p-4" dir="ltr"><code class="whitespace-pre!"><span><span>components/
 ├─ </span><span><span class="hljs-selector-tag">Header</span></span><span><span class="hljs-selector-class">.jsx</span></span><span>      → Thanh </span><span><span class="hljs-selector-tag">menu</span></span><span>
 ├─ </span><span><span class="hljs-selector-tag">Footer</span></span><span><span class="hljs-selector-class">.jsx</span></span><span>      → Chân trang
 ├─ ProductCard</span><span><span class="hljs-selector-class">.jsx</span></span><span> → </span><span><span class="hljs-number">1</span></span><span> đô</span><span><span class="hljs-selector-tag">i</span></span><span> già</span><span><span class="hljs-attribute">y</span></span><span>
 └─ </span><span><span class="hljs-selector-tag">Button</span></span><span><span class="hljs-selector-class">.jsx</span></span><span>
</span></span></code></div></div></pre>
<p data-start="746" data-end="795">📌 ❗ Không phải trang<br data-start="767" data-end="770">
📌 ❗ Không có URL riêng</p>
<hr data-start="797" data-end="800">
<h2 data-start="802" data-end="823">3️⃣ <code data-start="809" data-end="816">data/</code> là gì?</h2>
<p data-start="824" data-end="865">👉 <strong data-start="827" data-end="865">Frontend – dữ liệu giả (fake data)</strong></p>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="867" data-end="893"><div class="contain-inline-size rounded-2xl corner-superellipse/1.1 relative bg-token-sidebar-surface-primary"><div class="flex items-center text-token-text-secondary px-4 py-2 text-xs font-sans justify-between h-9 bg-token-sidebar-surface-primary select-none rounded-t-2xl corner-t-superellipse/1.1">kotlin</div><div class="sticky top-[calc(var(--sticky-padding-top)+9*var(--spacing))]"><div class="absolute end-0 bottom-0 flex h-9 items-center pe-2"><div class="bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary text-token-text-secondary flex items-center gap-4 rounded-sm px-2 font-sans text-xs"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none py-1" aria-label="Sao chép"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-j9921kii.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg>Sao chép mã</button></div></div></div><div class="overflow-y-auto p-4" dir="ltr"><code class="whitespace-pre!"><span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">data</span></span><span>/
 └─ shoes.js
</span></span></code></div></div></pre>
<p data-start="895" data-end="907">📌 Dùng khi:</p>
<ul data-start="908" data-end="945">
<li data-start="908" data-end="925">
<p data-start="910" data-end="925">Chưa có backend</p>
</li>
<li data-start="926" data-end="945">
<p data-start="928" data-end="945">Demo, bài tập lớn</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="947" data-end="976">❌ <strong data-start="949" data-end="976">KHÔNG PHẢI backend thật</strong></p>
<hr data-start="978" data-end="981">
<h1 data-start="983" data-end="1012">🔥 CÁI NÀO LÀ BACKEND (BE)?</h1>
<p data-start="1013" data-end="1050">👉 <strong data-start="1016" data-end="1050">KHÔNG NẰM TRONG THƯ MỤC <code data-start="1042" data-end="1048">src/</code></strong></p>
<p data-start="1052" data-end="1080">Backend là <strong data-start="1063" data-end="1080">project riêng</strong></p>
<hr data-start="1082" data-end="1085">
<h2 data-start="1087" data-end="1115">4️⃣ Backend gồm những gì?</h2>
<p data-start="1116" data-end="1149">Ví dụ dùng <strong data-start="1127" data-end="1148">Node.js + Express</strong>:</p>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="1151" data-end="1236"><div class="contain-inline-size rounded-2xl corner-superellipse/1.1 relative bg-token-sidebar-surface-primary"><div class="flex items-center text-token-text-secondary px-4 py-2 text-xs font-sans justify-between h-9 bg-token-sidebar-surface-primary select-none rounded-t-2xl corner-t-superellipse/1.1">pgsql</div><div class="sticky top-[calc(var(--sticky-padding-top)+9*var(--spacing))]"><div class="absolute end-0 bottom-0 flex h-9 items-center pe-2"><div class="bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary text-token-text-secondary flex items-center gap-4 rounded-sm px-2 font-sans text-xs"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none py-1" aria-label="Sao chép"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-j9921kii.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg>Sao chép mã</button></div></div></div><div class="overflow-y-auto p-4" dir="ltr"><code class="whitespace-pre!"><span><span>backend/
 ├─ controllers/
 ├─ routes/
 ├─ models/
 ├─ </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">database</span></span><span>/
 ├─ </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">server</span></span><span>.js
</span></span></code></div></div></pre>
<p data-start="1238" data-end="1253">📌 Backend làm:</p>
<ul data-start="1254" data-end="1329">
<li data-start="1254" data-end="1267">
<p data-start="1256" data-end="1267">Xử lý logic</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1268" data-end="1286">
<p data-start="1270" data-end="1286">Kết nối database</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1287" data-end="1305">
<p data-start="1289" data-end="1305">API <code data-start="1293" data-end="1305">/api/shoes</code></p>
</li>
<li data-start="1306" data-end="1329">
<p data-start="1308" data-end="1329">Đăng nhập, thanh toán</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="1331" data-end="1334">
<h2 data-start="1336" data-end="1372">5️⃣ So sánh FE vs BE (CỰC DỄ NHỚ)</h2>
<div class="TyagGW_tableContainer"><div tabindex="-1" class="group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit"><table data-start="1374" data-end="1599" class="w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)"><thead data-start="1374" data-end="1425"><tr data-start="1374" data-end="1425"><th data-start="1374" data-end="1393" data-col-size="sm" class="">Frontend (React)</th><th data-start="1393" data-end="1425" data-col-size="sm" class="">Backend (Node / Java / .NET)</th></tr></thead><tbody data-start="1436" data-end="1599"><tr data-start="1436" data-end="1474"><td data-start="1436" data-end="1457" data-col-size="sm">Hiển thị giao diện</td><td data-start="1457" data-end="1474" data-col-size="sm">Xử lý dữ liệu</td></tr><tr data-start="1475" data-end="1498"><td data-start="1475" data-end="1491" data-col-size="sm">Nút, form, UI</td><td data-start="1491" data-end="1498" data-col-size="sm">API</td></tr><tr data-start="1499" data-end="1543"><td data-start="1499" data-end="1523" data-col-size="sm">Chạy trên trình duyệt</td><td data-start="1523" data-end="1543" data-col-size="sm">Chạy trên server</td></tr><tr data-start="1544" data-end="1599"><td data-start="1544" data-end="1570" data-col-size="sm"><code data-start="1546" data-end="1554">pages/</code>, <code data-start="1556" data-end="1569">components/</code></td><td data-start="1570" data-end="1599" data-col-size="sm"><code data-start="1572" data-end="1586">controllers/</code>, <code data-start="1588" data-end="1597">routes/</code></td></tr></tbody></table><div class="sticky h-0 select-none end-(--thread-content-margin) self-end"><div class="absolute end-0 flex items-end" style="height: 33.1562px;"><span class="" data-state="closed"><button aria-label="Sao chép bảng" class="hover:bg-token-bg-tertiary text-token-text-secondary my-1 rounded-sm p-1 transition-opacity group-[:not(:hover):not(:focus-within)]:pointer-events-none group-[:not(:hover):not(:focus-within)]:opacity-0"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-j9921kii.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></span></div></div></div></div>
<hr data-start="1601" data-end="1604">
<h2 data-start="1606" data-end="1658">6️⃣ Web bán giày <strong data-start="1626" data-end="1643">KHÔNG backend</strong> có được không?</h2>
<p data-start="1659" data-end="1688">✅ <strong data-start="1661" data-end="1688">CÓ – với bài tập lớn FE</strong></p>
<p data-start="1690" data-end="1695">Dùng:</p>
<ul data-start="1696" data-end="1743">
<li data-start="1696" data-end="1713">
<p data-start="1698" data-end="1713"><code data-start="1698" data-end="1713">data/shoes.js</code></p>
</li>
<li data-start="1714" data-end="1730">
<p data-start="1716" data-end="1730"><code data-start="1716" data-end="1730">localStorage</code></p>
</li>
<li data-start="1731" data-end="1743">
<p data-start="1733" data-end="1743">Fake login</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="1745" data-end="1772">📌 Thường được <strong data-start="1760" data-end="1772">8–9 điểm</strong></p>
<hr data-start="1774" data-end="1777">
<h2 data-start="1779" data-end="1827">7️⃣ Web bán giày <strong data-start="1799" data-end="1813">CÓ backend</strong> (ăn điểm cao)</h2>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="1828" data-end="1907"><div class="contain-inline-size rounded-2xl corner-superellipse/1.1 relative bg-token-sidebar-surface-primary"><div class="flex items-center text-token-text-secondary px-4 py-2 text-xs font-sans justify-between h-9 bg-token-sidebar-surface-primary select-none rounded-t-2xl corner-t-superellipse/1.1">css</div><div class="sticky top-[calc(var(--sticky-padding-top)+9*var(--spacing))]"><div class="absolute end-0 bottom-0 flex h-9 items-center pe-2"><div class="bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary text-token-text-secondary flex items-center gap-4 rounded-sm px-2 font-sans text-xs"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none py-1" aria-label="Sao chép"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-j9921kii.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg>Sao chép mã</button></div></div></div><div class="overflow-y-auto p-4" dir="ltr"><code class="whitespace-pre!"><span><span>React (FE)
