wn-new-styling"><p data-start="0" data-end="102">Câu này hỏi <strong data-start="12" data-end="43">đúng “xương sống” của React</strong> 👍<br data-start="46" data-end="49">
Mình trả lời theo <strong data-start="67" data-end="101">chuẩn thực tế + chuẩn chấm bài</strong>.</p>
<hr data-start="104" data-end="107">
<h1 data-start="109" data-end="162">🧠 XỬ LÝ CHỨC NĂNG (THÊM GIỎ, TÍNH TIỀN) NẰM Ở ĐÂU?</h1>
<h2 data-start="164" data-end="186">🔑 TRẢ LỜI NGẮN GỌN</h2>
<p data-start="187" data-end="267">👉 <strong data-start="190" data-end="216">NẰM Ở FRONTEND (React)</strong><br data-start="216" data-end="219">
👉 <strong data-start="222" data-end="267">ĐẶT Ở COMPONENT CHA (thường là <code data-start="255" data-end="264">App.jsx</code>)</strong></p>
<hr data-start="269" data-end="272">
<h2 data-start="274" data-end="314">1️⃣ Vì sao KHÔNG đặt ở <code data-start="300" data-end="313">ProductCard</code>?</h2>
<p data-start="315" data-end="344">❌ <code data-start="317" data-end="330">ProductCard</code> chỉ là <strong data-start="338" data-end="344">UI</strong></p>
<ul data-start="345" data-end="388">
<li data-start="345" data-end="360">
<p data-start="347" data-end="360">Hiển thị giày</p>
</li>
<li data-start="361" data-end="373">
<p data-start="363" data-end="373">Nhận props</p>
</li>
<li data-start="374" data-end="388">
<p data-start="376" data-end="388">Phát sự kiện</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="390" data-end="419">❌ Không quản lý dữ liệu chung</p>
<hr data-start="421" data-end="424">
<h2 data-start="426" data-end="450">2️⃣ VỊ TRÍ ĐÚNG CHUẨN</h2>
<h3 data-start="451" data-end="469">✅ Đặt logic ở:</h3>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="470" data-end="571"><div class="contain-inline-size rounded-2xl corner-superellipse/1.1 relative bg-token-sidebar-surface-primary"><div class="flex items-center text-token-text-secondary px-4 py-2 text-xs font-sans justify-between h-9 bg-token-sidebar-surface-primary select-none rounded-t-2xl corner-t-superellipse/1.1">css</div><div class="sticky top-[calc(var(--sticky-padding-top)+9*var(--spacing))]"><div class="absolute end-0 bottom-0 flex h-9 items-center pe-2"><div class="bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary text-token-text-secondary flex items-center gap-4 rounded-sm px-2 font-sans text-xs"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none py-1" aria-label="Sao chép"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-j9921kii.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg>Sao chép mã</button></div></div></div><div class="overflow-y-auto p-4" dir="ltr"><code class="whitespace-pre!"><span><span><span class="hljs-attribute">src</span></span><span>/
 ├─ App</span><span><span class="hljs-selector-class">.jsx</span></span><span>           ⭐
 ├─ pages/Cart</span><span><span class="hljs-selector-class">.jsx</span></span><span>
 ├─ hooks/ (nâng cao)
 └─ context/ (nâng cao)
</span></span></code></div></div></pre>
<hr data-start="573" data-end="576">
<h2 data-start="578" data-end="607">3️⃣ Ví dụ LUỒNG ĐÚNG CHUẨN</h2>
<h3 data-start="609" data-end="643">📌 <code data-start="616" data-end="625">App.jsx</code> – NƠI XỬ LÝ LOGIC</h3>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="644" data-end="1130"><div class="contain-inline-size rounded-2xl corner-superellipse/1.1 relative bg-token-sidebar-surface-primary"><div class="flex items-center text-token-text-secondary px-4 py-2 text-xs font-sans justify-between h-9 bg-token-sidebar-surface-primary select-none rounded-t-2xl corner-t-superellipse/1.1">jsx</div><div class="sticky top-[calc(var(--sticky-padding-top)+9*var(--spacing))]"><div class="absolute end-0 bottom-0 flex h-9 items-center pe-2"><div class="bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary text-token-text-secondary flex items-center gap-4 rounded-sm px-2 font-sans text-xs"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none py-1" aria-label="Sao chép"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-j9921kii.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg>Sao chép mã</button></div></div></div><div class="overflow-y-auto p-4" dir="ltr"><code class="whitespace-pre! language-jsx"><span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">import</span></span><span> { useState } </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">from</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-string">"react"</span></span><span>
</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">import</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-title class_">Home</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">from</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-string">"./pages/Home"</span></span><span>
</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">import</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-title class_">Cart</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">from</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-string">"./pages/Cart"</span></span><span>

</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">function</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-title function_">App</span></span><span>(</span><span><span class="hljs-params"></span></span><span>) {
  </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">const</span></span><span> [cart, setCart] = </span><span><span class="hljs-title function_">useState</span></span><span>([])

  </span><span><span class="hljs-comment">// THÊM VÀO GIỎ</span></span><span>
  </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">const</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-title function_">addToCart</span></span><span> = (</span><span><span class="hljs-params">shoe</span></span><span>) =&gt; {
    </span><span><span class="hljs-title function_">setCart</span></span><span>([...cart, shoe])
  }

  </span><span><span class="hljs-comment">// TÍNH TỔNG TIỀN</span></span><span>
  </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">const</span></span><span> totalPrice = cart.</span><span><span class="hljs-title function_">reduce</span></span><span>(
    </span><span><span class="hljs-function">(<span class="hljs-params">sum, item</span></span></span><span>) =&gt; sum + item.</span><span><span class="hljs-property">price</span></span><span>,
    </span><span><span class="hljs-number">0</span></span><span>
  )

  </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">return</span></span><span> (
    </span><span><span class="language-xml"><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;&gt;</span></span></span><span>
      </span><span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">Home</span></span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-attr">addToCart</span></span><span>=</span><span><span class="hljs-string">{addToCart}</span></span><span> /&gt;
      </span><span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">Cart</span></span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-attr">cart</span></span><span>=</span><span><span class="hljs-string">{cart}</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-attr">total</span></span><span>=</span><span><span class="hljs-string">{totalPrice}</span></span><span> /&gt;
    </span><span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;/&gt;</span></span><span>
  )
}

</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">export</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">default</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-title class_">App</span></span><span>
</span></span></code></div></div></pre>
<p data-start="1132" data-end="1157">📌 <strong data-start="1135" data-end="1157">App.jsx = “bộ não”</strong></p>
<hr data-start="1159" data-end="1162">
<h2 data-start="1164" data-end="1194">4️⃣ <code data-start="1171" data-end="1181">Home.jsx</code> – TRUNG GIAN</h2>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="1195" data-end="1307"><div class="contain-inline-size rounded-2xl corner-superellipse/1.1 relative bg-token-sidebar-surface-primary"><div class="flex items-center text-token-text-secondary px-4 py-2 text-xs font-sans justify-between h-9 bg-token-sidebar-surface-primary select-none rounded-t-2xl corner-t-superellipse/1.1">jsx</div><div class="sticky top-[calc(var(--sticky-padding-top)+9*var(--spacing))]"><div class="absolute end-0 bottom-0 flex h-9 items-center pe-2"><div class="bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary text-token-text-secondary flex items-center gap-4 rounded-sm px-2 font-sans text-xs"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none py-1" aria-label="Sao chép"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-j9921kii.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg>Sao chép mã</button></div></div></div><div class="overflow-y-auto p-4" dir="ltr"><code class="whitespace-pre! language-jsx"><span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">function</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-title function_">Home</span></span><span>(</span><span><span class="hljs-params">{ addToCart }</span></span><span>) {
  </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">return</span></span><span> (
    </span><span><span class="language-xml"><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">ProductCard</span></span></span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-attr">shoe</span></span><span>=</span><span><span class="hljs-string">{shoe}</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-attr">addToCart</span></span><span>=</span><span><span class="hljs-string">{addToCart}</span></span><span> /&gt;
  )
}
</span></span></code></div></div></pre>
<hr data-start="1309" data-end="1312">
<h2 data-start="1314" data-end="1352">5️⃣ <code data-start="1321" data-end="1338">ProductCard.jsx</code> – CHỈ GỌI HÀM</h2>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="1353" data-end="1502"><div class="contain-inline-size rounded-2xl corner-superellipse/1.1 relative bg-token-sidebar-surface-primary"><div class="flex items-center text-token-text-secondary px-4 py-2 text-xs font-sans justify-between h-9 bg-token-sidebar-surface-primary select-none rounded-t-2xl corner-t-superellipse/1.1">jsx</div><div class="sticky top-[calc(var(--sticky-padding-top)+9*var(--spacing))]"><div class="absolute end-0 bottom-0 flex h-9 items-center pe-2"><div class="bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary text-token-text-secondary flex items-center gap-4 rounded-sm px-2 font-sans text-xs"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none py-1" aria-label="Sao chép"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-j9921kii.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg>Sao chép mã</button></div></div></div><div class="overflow-y-auto p-4" dir="ltr"><code class="whitespace-pre! language-jsx"><span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">function</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-title function_">ProductCard</span></span><span>(</span><span><span class="hljs-params">{ shoe, addToCart }</span></span><span>) {
  </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">return</span></span><span> (
    </span><span><span class="language-xml"><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">button</span></span></span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-attr">onClick</span></span><span>=</span><span><span class="hljs-string">{()</span></span><span> =&gt; addToCart(shoe)}&gt;
      Thêm vào giỏ
    </span><span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;/<span class="hljs-name">button</span></span></span><span>&gt;
  )
}
</span></span></code></div></div></pre>
<p data-start="1504" data-end="1535">📌 ❗ Không xử lý logic phức tạp</p>
<hr data-start="1537" data-end="1540">
<h2 data-start="1542" data-end="1570">6️⃣ <code data-start="1549" data-end="1559">Cart.jsx</code> – HIỂN THỊ</h2>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="1571" data-end="1776"><div class="contain-inline-size rounded-2xl corner-superellipse/1.1 relative bg-token-sidebar-surface-primary"><div class="flex items-center text-token-text-secondary px-4 py-2 text-xs font-sans justify-between h-9 bg-token-sidebar-surface-primary select-none rounded-t-2xl corner-t-superellipse/1.1">jsx</div><div class="sticky top-[calc(var(--sticky-padding-top)+9*var(--spacing))]"><div class="absolute end-0 bottom-0 flex h-9 items-center pe-2"><div class="bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary text-token-text-secondary flex items-center gap-4 rounded-sm px-2 font-sans text-xs"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none py-1" aria-label="Sao chép"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-j9921kii.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg>Sao chép mã</button></div></div></div><div class="overflow-y-auto p-4" dir="ltr"><code class="whitespace-pre! language-jsx"><span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">function</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-title function_">Cart</span></span><span>(</span><span><span class="hljs-params">{ cart, total }</span></span><span>) {
  </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">return</span></span><span> (
    </span><span><span class="language-xml"><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;&gt;</span></span></span><span>
      {cart.map(item =&gt; (
        </span><span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">p</span></span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-attr">key</span></span><span>=</span><span><span class="hljs-string">{item.id}</span></span><span>&gt;{item.name}</span><span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;/<span class="hljs-name">p</span></span></span><span>&gt;
      ))}
      </span><span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">h3</span></span></span><span>&gt;Tổng tiền: {total.toLocaleString()} ₫</span><span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;/<span class="hljs-name">h3</span></span></span><span>&gt;
    </span><span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;/&gt;</span></span><span>
  )
}
</span></span></code></div></div></pre>
