</ul>
<h3 data-start="1164" data-end="1177">❌ Backend</h3>
<p data-start="1178" data-end="1212">👉 <strong data-start="1181" data-end="1212">KHÔNG nằm trong project này</strong></p>
<hr data-start="1214" data-end="1217">
