<hr data-start="83" data-end="86">
<h1 data-start="88" data-end="118">🧩 COMPONENT DÙNG ĐỂ LÀM GÌ?</h1>
<p data-start="120" data-end="163">👉 <strong data-start="123" data-end="163">Component = khối giao diện + hành vi</strong></p>
<ul data-start="164" data-end="228">
<li data-start="164" data-end="184">
<p data-start="166" data-end="184">Chia nhỏ giao diện</p>
</li>
<li data-start="185" data-end="205">
<p data-start="187" data-end="205">Dùng lại nhiều lần</p>
</li>
<li data-start="206" data-end="228">
<p data-start="208" data-end="228">Code gọn, dễ bảo trì</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="230" data-end="233">
<h2 data-start="235" data-end="271">1️⃣ <code data-start="242" data-end="255">components/</code> dùng để làm gì?</h2>
<p data-start="272" data-end="320">👉 Chứa <strong data-start="280" data-end="302">component dùng lại</strong>, KHÔNG phải trang</p>
<h3 data-start="322" data-end="345">📌 Ví dụ component:</h3>
<div class="TyagGW_tableContainer"><div tabindex="-1" class="group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit"><table data-start="346" data-end="551" class="w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)"><thead data-start="346" data-end="369"><tr data-start="346" data-end="369"><th data-start="346" data-end="358" data-col-size="sm" class="">Component</th><th data-start="358" data-end="369" data-col-size="sm" class="">Dùng để</th></tr></thead><tbody data-start="391" data-end="551"><tr data-start="391" data-end="426"><td data-start="391" data-end="406" data-col-size="sm"><code data-start="393" data-end="405">Header.jsx</code></td><td data-start="406" data-end="426" data-col-size="sm">Thanh menu, logo</td></tr><tr data-start="427" data-end="456"><td data-start="427" data-end="442" data-col-size="sm"><code data-start="429" data-end="441">Footer.jsx</code></td><td data-start="442" data-end="456" data-col-size="sm">Chân trang</td></tr><tr data-start="457" data-end="500"><td data-start="457" data-end="477" data-col-size="sm"><code data-start="459" data-end="476">ProductCard.jsx</code></td><td data-start="477" data-end="500" data-col-size="sm">Hiển thị 1 đôi giày</td></tr><tr data-start="501" data-end="551"><td data-start="501" data-end="518" data-col-size="sm"><code data-start="503" data-end="517">CartItem.jsx</code></td><td data-start="518" data-end="551" data-col-size="sm">Hiển thị 1 sản phẩm trong giỏ</td></tr></tbody></table><div class="sticky h-0 select-none end-(--thread-content-margin) self-end"><div class="absolute end-0 flex items-end" style="height: 33.1562px;"><span class="" data-state="closed"><button aria-label="Sao chép bảng" class="hover:bg-token-bg-tertiary text-token-text-secondary my-1 rounded-sm p-1 transition-opacity group-[:not(:hover):not(:focus-within)]:pointer-events-none group-[:not(:hover):not(:focus-within)]:opacity-0"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-j9921kii.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></span></div></div></div></div>
<p data-start="553" data-end="610">📌 <strong data-start="556" data-end="578">Không có URL riêng</strong><br data-start="578" data-end="581">
📌 <strong data-start="584" data-end="610">Nhận dữ liệu qua props</strong></p>
<hr data-start="612" data-end="615">
<h3 data-start="617" data-end="647">🔎 Ví dụ <code data-start="630" data-end="647">ProductCard.jsx</code></h3>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="648" data-end="851"><div class="contain-inline-size rounded-2xl corner-superellipse/1.1 relative bg-token-sidebar-surface-primary"><div class="flex items-center text-token-text-secondary px-4 py-2 text-xs font-sans justify-between h-9 bg-token-sidebar-surface-primary select-none rounded-t-2xl corner-t-superellipse/1.1">jsx</div><div class="sticky top-[calc(var(--sticky-padding-top)+9*var(--spacing))]"><div class="absolute end-0 bottom-0 flex h-9 items-center pe-2"><div class="bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary text-token-text-secondary flex items-center gap-4 rounded-sm px-2 font-sans text-xs"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none py-1" aria-label="Sao chép"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-j9921kii.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg>Sao chép mã</button></div></div></div><div class="overflow-y-auto p-4" dir="ltr"><code class="whitespace-pre! language-jsx"><span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">function</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-title function_">ProductCard</span></span><span>(</span><span><span class="hljs-params">{ shoe, addToCart }</span></span><span>) {
  </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">return</span></span><span> (
    </span><span><span class="language-xml"><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">div</span></span></span></span><span>&gt;
      </span><span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">h3</span></span></span><span>&gt;{shoe.name}</span><span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;/<span class="hljs-name">h3</span></span></span><span>&gt;
      </span><span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">button</span></span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-attr">onClick</span></span><span>=</span><span><span class="hljs-string">{()</span></span><span> =&gt; addToCart(shoe)}&gt;
        Thêm vào giỏ
      </span><span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;/<span class="hljs-name">button</span></span></span><span>&gt;
    </span><span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;/<span class="hljs-name">div</span></span></span><span>&gt;
  )
}
</span></span></code></div></div></pre>
<p data-start="853" data-end="897">👉 Component <strong data-start="866" data-end="897">chỉ hiển thị + phát sự kiện</strong></p>
<hr data-start="899" data-end="902">
<h1 data-start="904" data-end="934">🧠 <code data-start="909" data-end="918">App.jsx</code> DÙNG ĐỂ LÀM GÌ?</h1>
<p data-start="936" data-end="984">👉 <strong data-start="939" data-end="984">App.jsx = COMPONENT CHA CAO NHẤT (BỘ NÃO)</strong></p>
<hr data-start="986" data-end="989">
<h2 data-start="991" data-end="1019">2️⃣ Vai trò của <code data-start="1010" data-end="1019">App.jsx</code></h2>
<h3 data-start="1020" data-end="1052">✅ 1. Quản lý <strong data-start="1037" data-end="1052">state chung</strong></h3>
<ul data-start="1053" data-end="1100">
<li data-start="1053" data-end="1063">
<p data-start="1055" data-end="1063">Giỏ hàng</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1064" data-end="1080">
<p data-start="1066" data-end="1080">User đăng nhập</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1081" data-end="1100">
<p data-start="1083" data-end="1100">Số lượng sản phẩm</p>
</li>
</ul>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="1102" data-end="1149"><div class="contain-inline-size rounded-2xl corner-superellipse/1.1 relative bg-token-sidebar-surface-primary"><div class="flex items-center text-token-text-secondary px-4 py-2 text-xs font-sans justify-between h-9 bg-token-sidebar-surface-primary select-none rounded-t-2xl corner-t-superellipse/1.1">jsx</div><div class="sticky top-[calc(var(--sticky-padding-top)+9*var(--spacing))]"><div class="absolute end-0 bottom-0 flex h-9 items-center pe-2"><div class="bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary text-token-text-secondary flex items-center gap-4 rounded-sm px-2 font-sans text-xs"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none py-1" aria-label="Sao chép"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-j9921kii.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg>Sao chép mã</button></div></div></div><div class="overflow-y-auto p-4" dir="ltr"><code class="whitespace-pre! language-jsx"><span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">const</span></span><span> [cart, setCart] = </span><span><span class="hljs-title function_">useState</span></span><span>([])
</span></span></code></div></div></pre>
<hr data-start="1151" data-end="1154">
<h3 data-start="1156" data-end="1190">✅ 2. Xử lý <strong data-start="1171" data-end="1190">logic chức năng</strong></h3>
<ul data-start="1191" data-end="1239">
<li data-start="1191" data-end="1212">
<p data-start="1193" data-end="1212">Thêm / xóa giỏ hàng</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1213" data-end="1229">
<p data-start="1215" data-end="1229">Tính tổng tiền</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1230" data-end="1239">
<p data-start="1232" data-end="1239">Gọi API</p>
</li>
</ul>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="1241" data-end="1310"><div class="contain-inline-size rounded-2xl corner-superellipse/1.1 relative bg-token-sidebar-surface-primary"><div class="flex items-center text-token-text-secondary px-4 py-2 text-xs font-sans justify-between h-9 bg-token-sidebar-surface-primary select-none rounded-t-2xl corner-t-superellipse/1.1">jsx</div><div class="sticky top-[calc(var(--sticky-padding-top)+9*var(--spacing))]"><div class="absolute end-0 bottom-0 flex h-9 items-center pe-2"><div class="bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary text-token-text-secondary flex items-center gap-4 rounded-sm px-2 font-sans text-xs"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none py-1" aria-label="Sao chép"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-j9921kii.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg>Sao chép mã</button></div></div></div><div class="overflow-y-auto p-4" dir="ltr"><code class="whitespace-pre! language-jsx"><span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">const</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-title function_">addToCart</span></span><span> = (</span><span><span class="hljs-params">shoe</span></span><span>) =&gt; {
  </span><span><span class="hljs-title function_">setCart</span></span><span>([...cart, shoe])
}
</span></span></code></div></div></pre>
<hr data-start="1312" data-end="1315">
<h3 data-start="1317" data-end="1351">✅ 3. Ghép các page &amp; component</h3>
