<p data-start="70" data-end="153">Bây giờ mình giải thích <strong data-start="94" data-end="104">vì sao</strong>, và <strong data-start="109" data-end="132">trường hợp ngoại lệ</strong> để bạn hiểu tận gốc.</p>
<hr data-start="155" data-end="158">
<h1 data-start="160" data-end="194">❓ KHÔNG CÓ <code data-start="173" data-end="182">App.jsx</code> ĐƯỢC KHÔNG?</h1>
<h2 data-start="196" data-end="241">1️⃣ Vì sao <strong data-start="210" data-end="240">BẮT BUỘC phải có <code data-start="229" data-end="238">App.jsx</code></strong>?</h2>
<h3 data-start="243" data-end="283">🔑 React <strong data-start="256" data-end="283">phải có 1 component gốc</strong></h3>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="284" data-end="335"><div class="contain-inline-size rounded-2xl corner-superellipse/1.1 relative bg-token-sidebar-surface-primary"><div class="flex items-center text-token-text-secondary px-4 py-2 text-xs font-sans justify-between h-9 bg-token-sidebar-surface-primary select-none rounded-t-2xl corner-t-superellipse/1.1">jsx</div><div class="sticky top-[calc(var(--sticky-padding-top)+9*var(--spacing))]"><div class="absolute end-0 bottom-0 flex h-9 items-center pe-2"><div class="bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary text-token-text-secondary flex items-center gap-4 rounded-sm px-2 font-sans text-xs"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none py-1" aria-label="Sao chép"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-j9921kii.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg>Sao chép mã</button></div></div></div><div class="overflow-y-auto p-4" dir="ltr"><code class="whitespace-pre! language-jsx"><span><span><span class="hljs-title class_">ReactDOM</span></span><span>.</span><span><span class="hljs-title function_">createRoot</span></span><span>(...).</span><span><span class="hljs-title function_">render</span></span><span>(</span><span><span class="language-xml"><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">App</span></span></span></span><span> /&gt;)
</span></span></code></div></div></pre>
<p data-start="337" data-end="359">📌 <code data-start="340" data-end="349">App.jsx</code> chính là:</p>
<ul data-start="360" data-end="422">
<li data-start="360" data-end="392">
<p data-start="362" data-end="392">Component gốc (root component)</p>
</li>
<li data-start="393" data-end="422">
<p data-start="395" data-end="422">Điểm bắt đầu của toàn bộ UI</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="424" data-end="480">➡️ <strong data-start="427" data-end="480">Không có App.jsx → React không biết render cái gì</strong></p>
<hr data-start="482" data-end="485">
<h2 data-start="487" data-end="534">2️⃣ <code data-start="494" data-end="504">main.jsx</code> không thay thế được <code data-start="525" data-end="534">App.jsx</code></h2>
<p data-start="535" data-end="546">❌ Sai cách:</p>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="547" data-end="584"><div class="contain-inline-size rounded-2xl corner-superellipse/1.1 relative bg-token-sidebar-surface-primary"><div class="flex items-center text-token-text-secondary px-4 py-2 text-xs font-sans justify-between h-9 bg-token-sidebar-surface-primary select-none rounded-t-2xl corner-t-superellipse/1.1">jsx</div><div class="sticky top-[calc(var(--sticky-padding-top)+9*var(--spacing))]"><div class="absolute end-0 bottom-0 flex h-9 items-center pe-2"><div class="bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary text-token-text-secondary flex items-center gap-4 rounded-sm px-2 font-sans text-xs"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none py-1" aria-label="Sao chép"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-j9921kii.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg>Sao chép mã</button></div></div></div><div class="overflow-y-auto p-4" dir="ltr"><code class="whitespace-pre! language-jsx"><span><span><span class="hljs-comment">// main.jsx</span></span><span>
&lt;h1&gt;</span><span><span class="hljs-title class_">Hello</span></span><span>&lt;/h1&gt;
</span></span></code></div></div></pre>
<p data-start="586" data-end="612">📌 <code data-start="589" data-end="599">main.jsx</code> chỉ dùng để:</p>
<ul data-start="613" data-end="669">
<li data-start="613" data-end="633">
<p data-start="615" data-end="633">Gắn React vào HTML</p>
</li>
<li data-start="634" data-end="646">
<p data-start="636" data-end="646">Import CSS</p>
</li>
<li data-start="647" data-end="669">
<p data-start="649" data-end="669">Render component gốc</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="671" data-end="674">
<h2 data-start="676" data-end="718">3️⃣ Cấu trúc React BẮT BUỘC (tối thiểu)</h2>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="719" data-end="764"><div class="contain-inline-size rounded-2xl corner-superellipse/1.1 relative bg-token-sidebar-surface-primary"><div class="flex items-center text-token-text-secondary px-4 py-2 text-xs font-sans justify-between h-9 bg-token-sidebar-surface-primary select-none rounded-t-2xl corner-t-superellipse/1.1">css</div><div class="sticky top-[calc(var(--sticky-padding-top)+9*var(--spacing))]"><div class="absolute end-0 bottom-0 flex h-9 items-center pe-2"><div class="bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary text-token-text-secondary flex items-center gap-4 rounded-sm px-2 font-sans text-xs"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none py-1" aria-label="Sao chép"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-j9921kii.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg>Sao chép mã</button></div></div></div><div class="overflow-y-auto p-4" dir="ltr"><code class="whitespace-pre!"><span><span>index</span><span><span class="hljs-selector-class">.html</span></span><span>
   ↓
</span><span><span class="hljs-selector-tag">main</span></span><span><span class="hljs-selector-class">.jsx</span></span><span>
