<hr data-start="766" data-end="769">
<h2 data-start="771" data-end="809">4️⃣ Ngoại lệ (NHƯNG KHÔNG NÊN DÙNG)</h2>
<h3 data-start="811" data-end="857">❗ Có thể render trực tiếp 1 component khác</h3>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="858" data-end="910"><div class="contain-inline-size rounded-2xl corner-superellipse/1.1 relative bg-token-sidebar-surface-primary"><div class="flex items-center text-token-text-secondary px-4 py-2 text-xs font-sans justify-between h-9 bg-token-sidebar-surface-primary select-none rounded-t-2xl corner-t-superellipse/1.1">jsx</div><div class="sticky top-[calc(var(--sticky-padding-top)+9*var(--spacing))]"><div class="absolute end-0 bottom-0 flex h-9 items-center pe-2"><div class="bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary text-token-text-secondary flex items-center gap-4 rounded-sm px-2 font-sans text-xs"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none py-1" aria-label="Sao chép"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-j9921kii.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg>Sao chép mã</button></div></div></div><div class="overflow-y-auto p-4" dir="ltr"><code class="whitespace-pre! language-jsx"><span><span><span class="hljs-title class_">ReactDOM</span></span><span>.</span><span><span class="hljs-title function_">createRoot</span></span><span>(...).</span><span><span class="hljs-title function_">render</span></span><span>(</span><span><span class="language-xml"><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">Home</span></span></span></span><span> /&gt;)
</span></span></code></div></div></pre>
<p data-start="912" data-end="928">📌 Nhưng khi đó:</p>
<ul data-start="929" data-end="988">
<li data-start="929" data-end="958">
<p data-start="931" data-end="958"><code data-start="931" data-end="937">Home</code> <strong data-start="938" data-end="958">đóng vai trò App</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start="959" data-end="988">
<p data-start="961" data-end="988">Vẫn cần <strong data-start="969" data-end="988">1 component gốc</strong></p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="990" data-end="1027">➡️ Chỉ <strong data-start="997" data-end="1008">đổi tên</strong>, không phải bỏ App</p>
<hr data-start="1029" data-end="1032">
<h2 data-start="1034" data-end="1092">5️⃣ Vì sao giáo viên / thực tế BẮT BUỘC dùng <code data-start="1082" data-end="1091">App.jsx</code>?</h2>
<div class="TyagGW_tableContainer"><div tabindex="-1" class="group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit"><table data-start="1093" data-end="1279" class="w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)"><thead data-start="1093" data-end="1115"><tr data-start="1093" data-end="1115"><th data-start="1093" data-end="1101" data-col-size="sm" class="">Lý do</th><th data-start="1101" data-end="1115" data-col-size="sm" class="">Giải thích</th></tr></thead><tbody data-start="1126" data-end="1279"><tr data-start="1126" data-end="1158"><td data-start="1126" data-end="1140" data-col-size="sm">Chuẩn React</td><td data-start="1140" data-end="1158" data-col-size="sm">99% dự án dùng</td></tr><tr data-start="1159" data-end="1191"><td data-start="1159" data-end="1172" data-col-size="sm">Dễ quản lý</td><td data-start="1172" data-end="1191" data-col-size="sm">Gom logic chung</td></tr><tr data-start="1192" data-end="1219"><td data-start="1192" data-end="1201" data-col-size="sm">Router</td><td data-start="1201" data-end="1219" data-col-size="sm">Phải đặt ở App</td></tr><tr data-start="1220" data-end="1248"><td data-start="1220" data-end="1230" data-col-size="sm">Context</td><td data-start="1230" data-end="1248" data-col-size="sm">Phải bọc ở App</td></tr><tr data-start="1249" data-end="1279"><td data-start="1249" data-end="1261" data-col-size="sm">Chấm điểm</td><td data-start="1261" data-end="1279" data-col-size="sm">Đúng kiến trúc</td></tr></tbody></table><div class="sticky h-0 select-none end-(--thread-content-margin) self-end"><div class="absolute end-0 flex items-end" style="height: 33.1562px;"><span class="" data-state="closed"><button aria-label="Sao chép bảng" class="hover:bg-token-bg-tertiary text-token-text-secondary my-1 rounded-sm p-1 transition-opacity group-[:not(:hover):not(:focus-within)]:pointer-events-none group-[:not(:hover):not(:focus-within)]:opacity-0"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon"><use href="/cdn/assets/