<div class="TyagGW_tableContainer"><div tabindex="-1" class="group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit"><table data-start="1579" data-end="1699" class="w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)"><thead data-start="1579" data-end="1601"><tr data-start="1579" data-end="1601"><th data-start="1579" data-end="1588" data-col-size="sm" class="">Router</th><th data-start="1588" data-end="1601" data-col-size="sm" class="">Component</th></tr></thead><tbody data-start="1612" data-end="1699"><tr data-start="1612" data-end="1637"><td data-start="1612" data-end="1625" data-col-size="sm">Điều hướng</td><td data-start="1625" data-end="1637" data-col-size="sm">Hiển thị</td></tr><tr data-start="1638" data-end="1668"><td data-start="1638" data-end="1652" data-col-size="sm">Dựa vào URL</td><td data-start="1652" data-end="1668" data-col-size="sm">Không có URL</td></tr><tr data-start="1669" data-end="1699"><td data-start="1669" data-end="1681" data-col-size="sm">Đổi trang</td><td data-start="1681" data-end="1699" data-col-size="sm">Khối giao diện</td></tr></tbody></table><div class="sticky h-0 select-none end-(--thread-content-margin) self-end"><div class="absolute end-0 flex items-end" style="height: 33.1562px;"><span class="" data-state="closed"><button aria-label="Sao chép bảng" class="hover:bg-token-bg-tertiary text-token-text-secondary my-1 rounded-sm p-1 transition-opacity group-[:not(:hover):not(:focus-within)]:pointer-events-none group-[:not(:hover):not(:focus-within)]:opacity-0"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-j9921kii.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></span></div></div></div></div>
<hr data-start="1701" data-end="1704">
<h1 data-start="1706" data-end="1726">🎤 Câu nói ăn điểm</h1>
<blockquote data-start="1727" data-end="1849">
<p data-start="1729" data-end="1849">“Router cho phép điều hướng giữa các trang trong ứng dụng React mà không cần tải lại trang, giúp xây dựng ứng dụng SPA.”</p>
</blockquote>
<hr data-start="1851" data-end="1854">
<p data-start="1856" data-end="1869">Nếu bạn muốn:</p>
<ul data-start="1870" data-end="1962">
<li data-start="1870" data-end="1908">
<p data-start="1872" data-end="1908">✔ Ví dụ <strong data-start="1880" data-end="1908">router chi tiết sản phẩm</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start="1909" data-end="1938">
<p data-start="1911" data-end="1938">✔ So sánh <strong data-start="1921" data-end="1938">Router vs MVC</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start="1939" data-end="1962">
<p data-start="1941" data-end="1962">✔ Vẽ <strong data-start="1946" data-end="1962">sơ đồ router</strong></p>
</li>
</ul>
