tôi vẫn chưa biết các trang này có gì </div></div></div></div></div><div class="z-0 flex justify-end"><div class="touch:-me-2 touch:-ms-3.5 -ms-2.5 -me-1 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-y-4 p-1 select-none focus-within:transition-none hover:transition-none touch:pointer-events-auto touch:opacity-100 duration-300 group-hover/turn-messages:delay-300 pointer-events-none opacity-0 motion-safe:transition-opacity group-hover/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-hover/turn-messages:opacity-100 group-focus-within/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-focus-within/turn-messages:opacity-100 has-data-[state=open]:pointer-events-auto has-data-[state=open]:opacity-100" style="mask-position: 0% 0%;"><button class="text-token-text-secondary hover:bg-token-bg-secondary rounded-lg" aria-label="Sao chép" aria-pressed="false" data-testid="copy-turn-action-button" data-state="closed"><span class="flex items-center justify-center touch:w-10 h-8 w-8"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-j9921kii.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></span></button><button class="text-token-text-secondary hover:bg-token-bg-secondary rounded-lg" aria-label="Chỉnh sửa tin nhắn" aria-pressed="false" data-state="closed"><span class="flex items-center justify-center touch:w-10 h-8 w-8"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-j9921kii.svg#6d87e1" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></span></button></div></div></div></div><br class="sr-only"></article><article class="text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none [--shadow-height:45px] has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none has-data-writing-block:-mt-(--shadow-height) has-data-writing-block:pt-(--shadow-height) [&amp;:has([data-writing-block])&gt;*]:pointer-events-auto scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]" tabindex="-1" dir="auto" data-turn-id="d187fa51-180e-4032-a579-6c0afdf6ad23" data-testid="conversation-turn-32" data-scroll-anchor="false" data-turn="assistant"><h6 class="sr-only">ChatGPT đã nói:</h6><div class="text-base my-auto mx-auto [--thread-content-margin:--spacing(4)] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:--spacing(6)] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:--spacing(16)] px-(--thread-content-margin)"><div class="[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn" tabindex="-1"><div class="flex max-w-full flex-col grow"><div data-message-author-role="assistant" data-message-id="d187fa51-180e-4032-a579-6c0afdf6ad23" dir="auto" class="min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1" data-message-model-slug="gpt-5-2"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden first:pt-[1px]"><div class="markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full wrap-break-word light markdown-new-styling"><p data-start="0" data-end="217">Ok, mấy trang <strong data-start="14" data-end="42">Quản lý cửa hàng (Admin)</strong> này bạn cứ hiểu đơn giản là <strong data-start="71" data-end="108">web cho chủ shop / nhân viên dùng</strong>, không phải cho khách hàng. Mình giải thích <strong data-start="153" data-end="197">từng trang có gì – làm gì – ví dụ cụ thể</strong> cho dễ hình dung 👇</p>
<hr data-start="219" data-end="222">
<h2 data-start="224" data-end="258">1️⃣ Dashboard (Trang tổng quan)</h2>
<p data-start="260" data-end="305">👉 <strong data-start="263" data-end="305">Trang vào đầu tiên khi admin đăng nhập</strong></p>
<h3 data-start="307" data-end="334">Dashboard thường có gì?</h3>
<ul data-start="335" data-end="565">
<li data-start="335" data-end="438">
<p data-start="337" data-end="355"><strong data-start="337" data-end="355">Thống kê nhanh</strong></p>
<ul data-start="358" data-end="438">
<li data-start="358" data-end="376">
<p data-start="360" data-end="376">Tổng số đơn hàng</p>
</li>
<li data-start="379" data-end="395">
<p data-start="381" data-end="395">Tổng doanh thu</p>
</li>
<li data-start="398" data-end="420">
<p data-start="400" data-end="420">Số sản phẩm đang bán</p>
</li>
<li data-start="423" data-end="438">
<p data-start="425" data-end="438">Số khách hàng</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start="439" data-end="500">
<p data-start="441" data-end="452"><strong data-start="441" data-end="452">Biểu đồ</strong></p>
<ul data-start="455" data-end="500">
<li data-start="455" data-end="484">
<p data-start="457" data-end="484">Doanh thu theo ngày / tháng</p>
</li>
<li data-start="487" data-end="500">
<p data-start="489" data-end="500">Số đơn hàng</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start="501" data-end="565">
<p data-start="503" data-end="521"><strong data-start="503" data-end="521">Danh sách ngắn</strong></p>
<ul data-start="524" data-end="565">
<li data-start="524" data-end="543">
<p data-start="526" data-end="543">Đơn hàng mới nhất</p>
</li>
<li data-start="546" data-end="565">
<p data-start="548" data-end="565">Sản phẩm bán chạy</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-start="567" data-end="577">Ví dụ:</h3>
<ul data-start="578" data-end="671">
<li data-start="578" data-end="601">
<p data-start="580" data-end="601">Hôm nay có <strong data-start="591" data-end="601">12 đơn</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start="602" data-end="629">
<p data-start="604" data-end="629">Doanh thu: <strong data-start="615" data-end="629">5.200.000đ</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start="630" data-end="671">
<p data-start="632" data-end="671">Sản phẩm bán chạy: <strong data-start="651" data-end="671">Nike Air Force 1</strong></p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="673" data-end="728">👉 Mục đích: <strong data-start="686" data-end="728">nhìn 1 phát là biết tình hình cửa hàng</strong></p>
<hr data-start="730" data-end="733">
<h2 data-start="735" data-end="758">2️⃣ Quản lý đơn hàng</h2>
<p data-start="760" data-end="799">👉 <strong data-start="763" data-end="799">Xem &amp; xử lý các đơn khách đã đặt</strong></p>
<h3 data-start="801" data-end="827">Có những chức năng gì?</h3>
<ul data-start="828" data-end="1073">
<li data-start="828" data-end="903">
<p data-start="830" data-end="849">Danh sách đơn hàng:</p>
<ul data-start="852" data-end="903">
<li data-start="852" data-end="860">
<p data-start="854" data-end="860">Mã đơn</p>
</li>
<li data-start="863" data-end="874">
<p data-start="865" data-end="874">Tên khách</p>
</li>
<li data-start="877" data-end="888">
<p data-start="879" data-end="888">Tổng tiền</p>
</li>
<li data-start="891" data-end="903">
<p data-start="893" data-end="903">Trạng thái</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start="904" data-end="975">
<p data-start="906" data-end="921">Trạng thái đơn:</p>
<ul data-start="924" data-end="975">
<li data-start="924" data-end="938">
<p data-start="926" data-end="938">Chờ xác nhận</p>
</li>
<li data-start="941" data-end="952">
<p data-start="943" data-end="952">Đang giao</p>
</li>
<li data-start="955" data-end="964">
<p data-start="957" data-end="964">Đã giao</p>
</li>
<li data-start="967" data-end="975">
<p data-start="969" data-end="975">Đã hủy</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start="976" data-end="1047">
<p data-start="978" data-end="995">Xem chi tiết đơn:</p>
<ul data-start="998" data-end="1047">
<li data-start="998" data-end="1012">
<p data-start="1000" data-end="1012">Sản phẩm mua</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1015" data-end="1025">
<p data-start="1017" data-end="1025">Số lượng</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1028" data-end="1047">
<p data-start="1030" data-end="1047">Địa chỉ giao hàng</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start="1048" data-end="1073">
<p data-start="1050" data-end="1073">Cập nhật trạng thái đơn</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-start="1075" data-end="1085">Ví dụ:</h3>
<div class="TyagGW_tableContainer"><div tabindex="-1" class="group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit"><table data-start="1086" data-end="1199" class="w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)"><thead data-start="1086" data-end="1124"><tr data-start="1086" data-end="1124"><th data-start="1086" data-end="1095" data-col-size="sm" class="">Mã đơn</th><th data-start="1095" data-end="1103" data-col-size="sm" class="">Khách</th><th data-start="1103" data-end="1110" data-col-size="sm" class="">Tổng</th><th data-start="1110" data-end="1124" data-col-size="sm" class="">Trạng thái</th></tr></thead><tbody data-start="1159" data-end="1199"><tr data-start="1159" data-end="1199"><td data-start="1159" data-end="1166" data-col-size="sm">#001</td><td data-start="1166" data-end="1173" data-col-size="sm">Tuấn</td><td data-start="1173" data-end="1186" data-col-size="sm">2.300.000đ</td><td data-start="1186" data-end="1199" data-col-size="sm">Đang giao</td></tr></tbody></table><div class="sticky h-0 select-none end-(--thread-content-margin) self-end"><div class="absolute end-0 flex items-end" style="height: 33.1562px;"><span class="" data-state="closed"><button aria-label="Sao chép bảng" class="hover:bg-token-bg-tertiary text-token-text-secondary my-1 rounded-sm p-1 transition-opacity group-[:not(:hover):not(:focus-within)]:pointer-events-none group-[:not(:hover):not(:focus-within)]:opacity-0"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-j9921kii.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></span></div></div></div></div>
<p data-start="1201" data-end="1237">👉 Mục đích: <strong data-start="1214" data-end="1237">xử lý đơn cho khách</strong></p>
<hr data-start="1239" data-end="1242">
<h2 data-start="1244" data-end="1267">3️⃣ Quản lý sản phẩm</h2>
<p data-start="1269" data-end="1301">👉 <strong data-start="1272" data-end="1301">Nơi thêm – sửa – xóa giày</strong></p>
