strong>, theo đúng nghĩa <strong data-start="76" data-end="137">component là gì – dùng khi nào – ví dụ trong web bán giày</strong> để bạn dễ nhớ và dễ làm 👇</p>
<hr data-start="168" data-end="171">
<h2 data-start="173" data-end="190">1️⃣ Breadcrumb</h2>
<h3 data-start="192" data-end="202">Là gì?</h3>
<p data-start="203" data-end="256">Hiển thị <strong data-start="212" data-end="240">đường dẫn trang hiện tại</strong> của người dùng.</p>
<h3 data-start="258" data-end="277">Dùng để làm gì?</h3>
<ul data-start="278" data-end="344">
<li data-start="278" data-end="315">
<p data-start="280" data-end="315">Giúp người dùng biết <strong data-start="301" data-end="315">đang ở đâu</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start="316" data-end="344">
<p data-start="318" data-end="344">Quay lại trang trước nhanh</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-start="346" data-end="356">Ví dụ:</h3>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="357" data-end="406"><div class="contain-inline-size rounded-2xl corner-superellipse/1.1 relative bg-token-sidebar-surface-primary"><div class="flex items-center text-token-text-secondary px-4 py-2 text-xs font-sans justify-between h-9 bg-token-sidebar-surface-primary select-none rounded-t-2xl corner-t-superellipse/1.1">css</div><div class="sticky top-[calc(var(--sticky-padding-top)+9*var(--spacing))]"><div class="absolute end-0 bottom-0 flex h-9 items-center pe-2"><div class="bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary text-token-text-secondary flex items-center gap-4 rounded-sm px-2 font-sans text-xs"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none py-1" aria-label="Sao chép"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-j9921kii.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg>Sao chép mã</button></div></div></div><div class="overflow-y-auto p-4" dir="ltr"><code class="whitespace-pre!"><span><span>Trang chủ &gt; Cử</span><span><span class="hljs-selector-tag">a</span></span><span> hàng &gt; Nike &gt; Air Force </span><span><span class="hljs-number">1</span></span><span>
</span></span></code></div></div></pre>
<h3 data-start="408" data-end="423">Dùng ở đâu?</h3>
<ul data-start="424" data-end="466">
<li data-start="424" data-end="440">
<p data-start="426" data-end="440">Trang cửa hàng</p>
</li>
<li data-start="441" data-end="466">
<p data-start="443" data-end="466">Trang chi tiết sản phẩm</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="468" data-end="508">👉 <strong data-start="471" data-end="508">Component điều hướng (navigation)</strong></p>
<hr data-start="510" data-end="513">
<h2 data-start="515" data-end="530">2️⃣ Checkbox</h2>
<h3 data-start="532" data-end="542">Là gì?</h3>
<p data-start="543" data-end="585">Ô vuông để <strong data-start="554" data-end="585">chọn nhiều giá trị cùng lúc</strong></p>
<h3 data-start="587" data-end="606">Dùng để làm gì?</h3>
<ul data-start="607" data-end="644">
<li data-start="607" data-end="621">
<p data-start="609" data-end="621">Lọc sản phẩm</p>
</li>
<li data-start="622" data-end="644">
<p data-start="624" data-end="644">Chọn nhiều điều kiện</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-start="646" data-end="671">Ví dụ trong web giày:</h3>
<ul data-start="672" data-end="715">
<li data-start="672" data-end="680">
<p data-start="674" data-end="680">☑ Nike</p>
</li>
<li data-start="681" data-end="691">
<p data-start="683" data-end="691">☑ Adidas</p>
</li>
<li data-start="692" data-end="703">
<p data-start="694" data-end="703">☑ Size 40</p>
</li>
<li data-start="704" data-end="715">
<p data-start="706" data-end="715">☑ Size 41</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="717" data-end="745">👉 <strong data-start="720" data-end="745">Component lọc dữ liệu</strong></p>
<hr data-start="747" data-end="750">
<h2 data-start="752" data-end="767">3️⃣ Dropdown</h2>
<h3 data-start="769" data-end="779">Là gì?</h3>
<p data-start="780" data-end="821">Danh sách <strong data-start="790" data-end="821">thả xuống để chọn 1 giá trị</strong></p>
<h3 data-start="823" data-end="842">Dùng để làm gì?</h3>
<ul data-start="843" data-end="873">
<li data-start="843" data-end="854">
<p data-start="845" data-end="854">Chọn size</p>
</li>
<li data-start="855" data-end="873">
<p data-start="857" data-end="873">Sắp xếp sản phẩm</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-start="875" data-end="885">Ví dụ:</h3>
<ul data-start="886" data-end="969">
<li data-start="886" data-end="935">
