</li>
<li data-start="921" data-end="935">
<p data-start="923" data-end="935">Giá giảm dần</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start="936" data-end="969">
<p data-start="938" data-end="948">Chọn size:</p>
<ul data-start="951" data-end="969">
<li data-start="951" data-end="955">
<p data-start="953" data-end="955">39</p>
</li>
<li data-start="958" data-end="962">
<p data-start="960" data-end="962">40</p>
</li>
<li data-start="965" data-end="969">
<p data-start="967" data-end="969">41</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="971" data-end="1003">👉 <strong data-start="974" data-end="1003">Component chọn nhanh, gọn</strong></p>
<hr data-start="1005" data-end="1008">
<h2 data-start="1010" data-end="1039">4️⃣ Promotion (Khuyến mãi)</h2>
<h3 data-start="1041" data-end="1051">Là gì?</h3>
