</li>
<li data-start="1602" data-end="1615">
<p data-start="1604" data-end="1615">Mã giảm giá</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="1617" data-end="1643">👉 <strong data-start="1620" data-end="1643">Component nhập liệu</strong></p>
