<hr data-start="120" data-end="123">
<h2 data-start="125" data-end="141">❌ Lỗi bạn gặp</h2>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="142" data-end="234"><div class="contain-inline-size rounded-2xl corner-superellipse/1.1 relative bg-token-sidebar-surface-primary"><div class="flex items-center text-token-text-secondary px-4 py-2 text-xs font-sans justify-between h-9 bg-token-sidebar-surface-primary select-none rounded-t-2xl corner-t-superellipse/1.1">nginx</div><div class="sticky top-[calc(var(--sticky-padding-top)+9*var(--spacing))]"><div class="absolute end-0 bottom-0 flex h-9 items-center pe-2"><div class="bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary text-token-text-secondary flex items-center gap-4 rounded-sm px-2 font-sans text-xs"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none py-1" aria-label="Sao chép"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-j9921kii.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg>Sao chép mã</button></div></div></div><div class="overflow-y-auto p-4" dir="ltr"><code class="whitespace-pre!"><span><span><span class="hljs-attribute">Command</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-string">'Git: Show Git Output'</span></span><span> resulted in an </span><span><span class="hljs-literal">error</span></span><span>
command git.showOutput not found
</span></span></code></div></div></pre>
<p data-start="236" data-end="248">👉 Nghĩa là:</p>
<ul data-start="249" data-end="351">
<li data-start="249" data-end="286">
<p data-start="251" data-end="286">VS Code <strong data-start="259" data-end="286">không tìm thấy lệnh Git</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start="287" data-end="351">
<p data-start="289" data-end="351">Thường do <strong data-start="299" data-end="320">Git chưa được cài</strong> hoặc <strong data-start="326" data-end="351">VS Code chưa nhận Git</strong></p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="353" data-end="356">
<h2 data-start="358" data-end="402">✅ NGUYÊN NHÂN THƯỜNG GẶP (90% là cái này)</h2>
<h3 data-start="404" data-end="437">1️⃣ <strong data-start="412" data-end="428">CHƯA CÀI GIT</strong> trên máy</h3>
<p data-start="438" data-end="485">VS Code <strong data-start="446" data-end="466">không có Git sẵn</strong>, nó chỉ là editor.</p>
<p data-start="487" data-end="544">👉 Nếu chưa cài Git → mọi lệnh Git trong VS Code đều lỗi.</p>
<hr data-start="546" data-end="549">
<h3 data-start="551" data-end="597">2️⃣ Git cóI VS Code bị tắt / lỗi extension</h3>
<ul data-start="598" data-end="657">
<li data-start="598" data-end="624">
<p data-start="600" data-end="624">Extension Git bị disable</p>
</li>
<li data-start="625" data-end="657">
<p data-start="627" data-end="657">VS Code chưa nhận PATH của Git</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="659" data-end="662">
<h2 data-start="664" data-end="703">🛠️ CÁCH KHẮC PHỤC (LÀM THEO THỨ TỰ)</h2>
<hr data-start="705" data-end="708">
<h2 data-start="710" data-end="747">✅ BƯỚC 1: KIỂM TRA ĐÃ CÀI GIT CHƯA</h2>
<h3 data-start="749" data-end="798">Mở <strong data-start="756" data-end="780">Command Prompt (CMD)</strong> hoặc <strong data-start="786" data-end="798">Terminal</strong></h3>
<p data-start="799" data-end="802">Gõ:</p>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="803" data-end="828"><div class="contain-inline-size rounded-2xl corner-superellipse/1.1 relative bg-token-sidebar-surface-primary"><div class="flex items-center text-token-text-secondary px-4 py-2 text-xs font-sans justify-between h-9 bg-token-sidebar-surface-primary select-none rounded-t-2xl corner-t-superellipse/1.1">bash</div><div class="sticky top-[calc(var(--sticky-padding-top)+9*var(--spacing))]"><div class="absolute end-0 bottom-0 flex h-9 items-center pe-2"><div class="bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary text-token-text-secondary flex items-center gap-4 rounded-sm px-2 font-sans text-xs"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none py-1" aria-label="Sao chép"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-j9921kii.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg>Sao chép mã</button></div></div></div><div class="overflow-y-auto p-4" dir="ltr"><code class="whitespace-pre! language-bash"><span><span>git --version
</span></span></code></div></div></pre>
<h3 data-start="830" data-end="845">👉 Kết quả:</h3>
<ul data-start="846" data-end="1035">
<li data-start="846" data-end="952">
<p data-start="848" data-end="858">❌ Nếu báo:</p>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="861" data-end="931"><div class="contain-inline-size rounded-2xl corner-superellipse/1.1 relative bg-token-sidebar-surface-primary"><div class="flex items-center text-token-text-secondary px-4 py-2 text-xs font-sans justify-between h-9 bg-token-sidebar-surface-primary select-none rounded-t-2xl corner-t-superellipse/1.1">kotlin</div><div class="sticky top-[calc(var(--sticky-padding-top)+9*var(--spacing))]"><div class="absolute end-0 bottom-0 flex h-9 items-center pe-2"><div class="bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary text-token-text-secondary flex items-center gap-4 rounded-sm px-2 font-sans text-xs"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none py-1" aria-label="Sao chép"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-j9921kii.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg>Sao chép mã</button></div></div></div><div class="overflow-y-auto p-4" dir="ltr"><code class="whitespace-pre!"><span><span><span class="hljs-string">'git'</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">is</span></span><span> not recognized </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">as</span></span><span> an </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">internal</span></span><span> or </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">external</span></span><span> command
</span></span></code></div></div></pre>
<p data-start="934" data-end="952">→ <strong data-start="936" data-end="952">CHƯA CÀI GIT</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start="953" data-end="1035">
<p data-start="955" data-end="974">✅ Nếu hiện version:</p>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="977" data-end="1007"><div class="contain-inline-size rounded-2xl corner-superellipse/1.1 relative bg-token-sidebar-surface-primary"><div class="flex items-center text-token-text-secondary px-4 py-2 text-xs font-sans justify-between h-9 bg-token-sidebar-surface-primary select-none rounded-t-2xl corner-t-superellipse/1.1">nginx</div><div class="sticky top-[calc(var(--sticky-padding-top)+9*var(--spacing))]"><div class="absolute end-0 bottom-0 flex h-9 items-center pe-2"><div class="bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary text-token-text-secondary flex items-center gap-4 rounded-sm px-2 font-sans text-xs"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none py-1" aria-label="Sao chép"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-j9921kii.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg>Sao chép mã</button></div></div></div><div class="overflow-y-auto p-4" dir="ltr"><code class="whitespace-pre!"><span><span><span class="hljs-attribute">git</span></span><span> version </span><span><span class="hljs-number">2</span></span><span>.xx.x
</span></span></code></div></div></pre>
<p data-start="1010" data-end="1035">→ Git đã cài → qua Bước 3</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="1037" data-end="1040">
<h2 data-start="1042" data-end="1076">✅ BƯỚC 2: CÀI GIT (NẾU CHƯA CÓ)</h2>
<ol data-start="1078" data-end="1241">
<li data-start="1078" data-end="1109">
<p data-start="1081" data-end="1109">Vào: <strong data-start="1086" data-end="1109"><a data-start="1088" data-end="1107" rel="noopener" target="_new" class="decorated-link" href="https://git-scm.com/">https://git-scm.com<span aria-hidden="true" class="ms-0.5 inline-block align-middle leading-none"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" data-rtl-flip="" class="block h-[0.75em] w-[0.75em] stroke-current stroke-[0.75]"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-j9921kii.svg#304883" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></span></a></strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start="1110" data-end="1132">
<p data-start="1113" data-end="1132">Tải Git cho Windows</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1133" data-end="1178">
<p data-start="1136" data-end="1178">Cài đặt → <strong data-start="1146" data-end="1158">Next hết</strong>, KHÔNG cần chỉnh gì</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1179" data-end="1241">
<p data-start="1182" data-end="1199">Sau khi cài xong:</p>
<ul data-start="1203" data-end="1241">
<li data-start="1203" data-end="1221">
<p data-start="1205" data-end="1221"><strong data-start="1205" data-end="1221">ĐÓNG VS CODE</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start="1225" data-end="1241">
<p data-start="1227" data-end="1241">Mở lại VS Code</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ol>
<p data-start="1243" data-end="1271">👉 Bước này rất quan trọng ❗</p>
<hr data-start="1273" data-end="1276">
<h2 data-start="1278" data-end="1317">✅ BƯỚC 3: KIỂM TRA GIT TRONG VS CODE</h2>
<h3 data-start="1319" data-end="1339">Cách 1 (dễ nhất)</h3>
<ul data-start="1340" data-end="1416">
<li data-start="1340" data-end="1363">
<p data-start="1342" data-end="1363">Nhìn góc trái VS Code</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1364" data-end="1416">
<p data-start="1366" data-end="1416">Có icon <strong data-start="1374" data-end="1409">Source Control (hình nhánh cây)</strong> không?</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="1418" data-end="1436">Nếu có → Git OK 👍</p>
<hr data-start="1438" data-end="1441">
<h3 data-start="1443" data-end="1453">Cách 2</h3>
<p data-start="1454" data-end="1478"><code data-start="1454" data-end="1472">Ctrl + Shift + P</code><br data-start="1472" data-end="1475">
Gõ:</p>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="1479" data-end="1497"><div class="contain-inline-size rounded-2xl corner-superellipse/1.1 relative bg-token-sidebar-surface-primary"><div class="flex items-center text-token-text-secondary px-4 py-2 text-xs font-sans justify-between h-9 bg-token-sidebar-surface-primary select-none rounded-t-2xl corner-t-superellipse/1.1">makefile</div><div class="sticky top-[calc(var(--sticky-padding-top)+9*var(--spacing))]"><div class="absolute end-0 bottom-0 flex h-9 items-center pe-2"><div class="bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary text-token-text-secondary flex items-center gap-4 rounded-sm px-2 font-sans text-xs"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none py-1" aria-label="Sao chép"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-j9921kii.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg>Sao chép mã</button></div></div></div><div class="overflow-y-auto p-4" dir="ltr"><code class="whitespace-pre!"><span><span><span class="hljs-section">Git: Clone</span></span><span>
</span></span></code></div></div></pre>
<p data-start="1499" data-end="1531">👉 Nếu thấy lệnh → Git hoạt động</p>
<hr data-start="1533" data-end="1536">
<h2 data-start="1538" data-end="1573">❌ VỀ LỆNH “Git: Show Git Output”</h2>
<p data-start="1574" data-end="1586">👉 Lệnh này:</p>
<ul data-start="1587" data-end="1673">
<li data-start="1587" data-end="1627">
<p data-start="1589" data-end="1627"><strong data-start="1589" data-end="1627">Không phải lúc nào VS Code cũng có</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start="1628" data-end="1673">
<p data-start="1630" data-end="1673">Một số phiên bản VS Code <strong data-start="1655" data-end="1673">đã bỏ lệnh này</strong></p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="1675" data-end="1704">👉 <strong data-start="1678" data-end="1704">KHÔNG CẦN dùng lệnh đó</strong></p>
<hr data-start="1706" data-end="1709">
<h2 data-start="1711" data-end="1729">✅ THAY THẾ ĐÚNG</h2>
<h3 data-start="1731" data-end="1767">Muốn xem log Git → dùng Terminal</h3>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="1768" data-end="1798"><div class="contain-inline-size rounded-2xl corner-superellipse/1.1 relative bg-token-sidebar-surface-primary"><div class="flex items-center text-token-text-secondary px-4 py-2 text-xs font-sans justify-between h-9 bg-token-sidebar-surface-primary select-none rounded-t-2xl corner-t-superellipse/1.1">bash</div><div class="sticky top-[calc(var(--sticky-padding-top)+9*var(--spacing))]"><div class="absolute end-0 bottom-0 flex h-9 items-center pe-2"><div class="bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary text-token-text-secondary flex items-center gap-4 rounded-sm px-2 font-sans text-xs"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none py-1" aria-label="Sao chép"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-j9921kii.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg>Sao chép mã</button></div></div></div><div class="overflow-y-auto p-4" dir="ltr"><code class="whitespace-pre! language-bash"><span><span>git status
git </span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">log</span></span><span>
</span></span></code></div></div></pre>
<h3 data-start="1800" data-end="1822">Muốn clone project</h3>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="1823" data-end="1858"><div class="contain-inline-size rounded-2xl corner-superellipse/1.1 relative bg-token-sidebar-surface-primary"><div class="flex items-center text-token-text-secondary px-4 py-2 text-xs font-sans justify-between h-9 bg-token-sidebar-surface-primary select-none rounded-t-2xl corner-t-superellipse/1.1">bash</div><div class="sticky top-[calc(var(--sticky-padding-top)+9*var(--spacing))]"><div class="absolute end-0 bottom-0 flex h-9 items-center pe-2"><div class="bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary text-token-text-secondary flex items-center gap-4 rounded-sm px-2 font-sans text-xs"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none py-1" aria-label="Sao chép"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-j9921kii.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg>Sao chép mã</button></div></div></div><div class="overflow-y-auto p-4" dir="ltr"><code class="whitespace-pre! language-bash"><span><span>git </span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">clone</span></span><span> &lt;link-github&gt;
</span></span></code></div></div></pre>
<hr data-start="1860" data-end="1863">
<h2 data-start="1865" data-end="1887">🧠 TÓM TẮT NGẮN GỌN</h2>
<ul data-start="1888" data-end="1992">
<li data-start="1888" data-end="1913">
<p data-start="1890" data-end="1913">❌ Lỗi không phải do bạn</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1914" data-end="1941">
<p data-start="1916" data-end="1941">✅ 99% là <strong data-start="1925" data-end="1941">chưa cài Git</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start="1942" data-end="1992">
<p data-start="1944" data-end="1992">👉 Cài Git → restart VS Code → dùng <code data-start="1980" data-end="1992">Git: Clone</code></p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="1994" data-end="1997">
