ssage-model-slug="gpt-5-2"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden first:pt-[1px]"><div class="markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full wrap-break-word light markdown-new-styling"><p data-start="0" data-end="105">Lỗi này <strong data-start="8" data-end="34">đã rõ 100% nguyên nhân</strong> rồi 👍<br data-start="41" data-end="44">
Mình giải thích <strong data-start="60" data-end="100">dễ hiểu + cách sửa chuẩn cho Windows</strong> nhé.</p>
<hr data-start="107" data-end="110">
<h2 data-start="112" data-end="128">❌ Lỗi bạn gặp</h2>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="129" data-end="262"><div class="contain-inline-size rounded-2xl corner-superellipse/1.1 relative bg-token-sidebar-surface-primary"><div class="flex items-center text-token-text-secondary px-4 py-2 text-xs font-sans justify-between h-9 bg-token-sidebar-surface-primary select-none rounded-t-2xl corner-t-superellipse/1.1">python</div><div class="sticky top-[calc(var(--sticky-padding-top)+9*var(--spacing))]"><div class="absolute end-0 bottom-0 flex h-9 items-center pe-2"><div class="bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary text-token-text-secondary flex items-center gap-4 rounded-sm px-2 font-sans text-xs"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none py-1" aria-label="Sao chép"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-j9921kii.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg>Sao chép mã</button></div></div></div><div class="overflow-y-auto p-4" dir="ltr"><code class="whitespace-pre!"><span><span>cmd.exe - Machine </span><span><span class="hljs-type">Type</span></span><span> Mismatch
The image file ... git.exe </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">is</span></span><span> valid, but </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">is</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">for</span></span><span> a machine </span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">type</span></span><span> other than the current machine
</span></span></code></div></div></pre>
<p data-start="264" data-end="276">👉 Nghĩa là:</p>
<ul data-start="277" data-end="382">
<li data-start="277" data-end="334">
<p data-start="279" data-end="334">Bạn đang chạy <strong data-start="293" data-end="334">Git KHÔNG PHÙ HỢP với Windows của bạn</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start="335" data-end="382">
<p data-start="337" data-end="382"><strong data-start="337" data-end="382">Cài sai kiến trúc (32-bit / 64-bit / ARM)</strong></p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="384" data-end="387">
<h2 data-start="389" data-end="413">🔍 NGUYÊN NHÂN CỤ THỂ</h2>
<h3 data-start="415" data-end="446">Trường hợp thường gặp nhất:</h3>
<ul data-start="447" data-end="572">
<li data-start="447" data-end="554">
<p data-start="449" data-end="468">Windows của bạn là:</p>
<ul data-start="471" data-end="554">
<li data-start="471" data-end="512">
<p data-start="473" data-end="512">❌ <strong data-start="475" data-end="485">32-bit</strong> → nhưng cài Git <strong data-start="502" data-end="512">64-bit</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start="515" data-end="554">
<p data-start="517" data-end="554">❌ <strong data-start="519" data-end="534">Windows ARM</strong> → nhưng cài Git x64</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start="555" data-end="572">
<p data-start="557" data-end="572">Hoặc máy rất cũ</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="574" data-end="577">
<h2 data-start="579" data-end="615">✅ CÁCH SỬA (LÀM THEO ĐÚNG THỨ TỰ)</h2>
<hr data-start="617" data-end="620">
<h2 data-start="622" data-end="660">🟢 BƯỚC 1: KIỂM TRA WINDOWS CỦA BẠN</h2>
<h3 data-start="662" data-end="682">Cách nhanh nhất:</h3>
<ol data-start="683" data-end="765">
<li data-start="683" data-end="704">
<p data-start="686" data-end="704">Nhấn <code data-start="691" data-end="704">Windows + R</code></p>
</li>
<li data-start="705" data-end="737">
<p data-start="708" data-end="711">Gõ:</p>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="715" data-end="737"><div class="contain-inline-size rounded-2xl corner-superellipse/1.1 relative bg-token-sidebar-surface-primary"><div class="flex items-center text-token-text-secondary px-4 py-2 text-xs font-sans justify-between h-9 bg-token-sidebar-surface-primary select-none rounded-t-2xl corner-t-superellipse/1.1">nginx</div><div class="sticky top-[calc(var(--sticky-padding-top)+9*var(--spacing))]"><div class="absolute end-0 bottom-0 flex h-9 items-center pe-2"><div class="bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary text-token-text-secondary flex items-center gap-4 rounded-sm px-2 font-sans text-xs"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none py-1" aria-label="Sao chép"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-j9921kii.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg>Sao chép mã</button></div></div></div><div class="overflow-y-auto p-4" dir="ltr"><code class="whitespace-pre!"><span><span><span class="hljs-attribute">msinfo32</span></span><span>
</span></span></code></div></div></pre>
</li>
<li data-start="738" data-end="765">
<p data-start="741" data-end="765">Xem dòng <strong data-start="750" data-end="765">System Type</strong></p>
</li>
</ol>
<h3 data-start="767" data-end="779">Kết quả:</h3>
<ul data-start="780" data-end="880">
<li data-start="780" data-end="813">
<p data-start="782" data-end="813"><code data-start="782" data-end="796">x64-based PC</code> → Windows 64-bit</p>
</li>
<li data-start="814" data-end="847">
<p data-start="816" data-end="847"><code data-start="816" data-end="830">x86-based PC</code> → Windows 32-bit</p>
</li>
<li data-start="848" data-end="880">
<p data-start="850" data-end="880"><code data-start="850" data-end="864">ARM-based PC</code> → Windows ARM ❗</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="882" data-end="885">
<h2 data-start="887" data-end="927">🟢 BƯỚC 2: GỠ GIT CŨ (RẤT QUAN TRỌNG)</h2>
<ol data-start="929" data-end="1055">
<li data-start="929" data-end="956">
<p data-start="932" data-end="956">Control Panel → Programs</p>
</li>
<li data-start="957" data-end="977">
<p data-start="960" data-end="977">Uninstall <strong data-start="970" data-end="977">Git</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start="978" data-end="1036">
<p data-start="981" data-end="998">Xóa luôn thư mục:</p>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="1002" data-end="1036"><div class="contain-inline-size rounded-2xl corner-superellipse/1.1 relative bg-token-sidebar-surface-primary"><div class="flex items-center text-token-text-secondary px-4 py-2 text-xs font-sans justify-between h-9 bg-token-sidebar-surface-primary select-none rounded-t-2xl corner-t-superellipse/1.1">makefile</div><div class="sticky top-[calc(var(--sticky-padding-top)+9*var(--spacing))]"><div class="absolute end-0 bottom-0 flex h-9 items-center pe-2"><div class="bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary text-token-text-secondary flex items-center gap-4 rounded-sm px-2 font-sans text-xs"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none py-1" aria-label="Sao chép"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-j9921kii.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg>Sao chép mã</button></div></div></div><div class="overflow-y-auto p-4" dir="ltr"><code class="whitespace-pre!"><span><span><span class="hljs-section">C:\Program Files\Git</span></span><span>
</span></span></code></div></div></pre>
</li>
<li data-start="1037" data-end="1055">
<p data-start="1040" data-end="1055"><strong data-start="1040" data-end="1055">Restart máy</strong></p>
</li>
</ol>
<hr data-start="1057" data-end="1060">
<h2 data-start="1062" data-end="1098">🟢 BƯỚC 3: TẢI GIT ĐÚNG KIẾN TRÚC</h2>
<p data-start="1100" data-end="1139">Vào:<br data-start="1104" data-end="1107">
👉 <a data-start="1110" data-end="1139" rel="noopener" target="_new" class="decorated-link" href="https://git-scm.com/downloads">https://git-scm.com/downloads<span aria-hidden="true" class="ms-0.5 inline-block align-middle leading-none"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" data-rtl-flip="" class="block h-[0.75em] w-[0.75em] stroke-current stroke-[0.75]"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-j9921kii.svg#304883" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></span></a></p>
<h3 data-start="1141" data-end="1155">Chọn đúng:</h3>
<ul data-start="1156" data-end="1292">
<li data-start="1156" data-end="1201">
<p data-start="1158" data-end="1201">🖥 Windows 64-bit → <strong data-start="1178" data-end="1201">Git for Windows x64</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start="1202" data-end="1247">
<p data-start="1204" data-end="1247">🖥 Windows 32-bit → <strong data-start="1224" data-end="1247">Git for Windows x86</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start="1248" data-end="1292">
<p data-start="1250" data-end="1292">💻 Windows ARM → <strong data-start="1267" data-end="1292">Git for Windows ARM64</strong></p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="1294" data-end="1314">❗ <strong data-start="1296" data-end="1314">KHÔNG chọn đại</strong></p>
<hr data-start="1316" data-end="1319">
<h2 data-start="1321" data-end="1354">🟢 BƯỚC 4: CÀI GIT (CÀI CHUẨN)</h2>
<ul data-start="1356" data-end="1453">
<li data-start="1356" data-end="1372">
<p data-start="1358" data-end="1372">Mở file <code data-start="1366" data-end="1372">.exe</code></p>
</li>
<li data-start="1373" data-end="1387">
<p data-start="1375" data-end="1387"><strong data-start="1375" data-end="1387">Next hết</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start="1388" data-end="1404">
<p data-start="1390" data-end="1404">Không chỉnh gì</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1405" data-end="1453">
<p data-start="1407" data-end="1423">Đảm bảo có bước:</p>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="1426" data-end="1453"><div class="contain-inline-size rounded-2xl corner-superellipse/1.1 relative bg-token-sidebar-surface-primary"><div class="flex items-center text-token-text-secondary px-4 py-2 text-xs font-sans justify-between h-9 bg-token-sidebar-surface-primary select-none rounded-t-2xl corner-t-superellipse/1.1">pgsql</div><div class="sticky top-[calc(var(--sticky-padding-top)+9*var(--spacing))]"><div class="absolute end-0 bottom-0 flex h-9 items-center pe-2"><div class="bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary text-token-text-secondary flex items-center gap-4 rounded-sm px-2 font-sans text-xs"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none py-1" aria-label="Sao chép"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-j9921kii.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg>Sao chép mã</button></div></div></div><div class="overflow-y-auto p-4" dir="ltr"><code class="whitespace-pre!"><span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">Add</span></span><span> Git </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">to</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-type">PATH</span></span><span>
</span></span></code></div></div></pre>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="1455" data-end="1458">
<h2 data-start="1460" data-end="1486">🟢 BƯỚC 5: KIỂM TRA LẠI</h2>
<p data-start="1488" data-end="1499">Mở CMD mới:</p>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="1500" data-end="1525"><div class="contain-inline-size rounded-2xl corner-superellipse/1.1 relative bg-token-sidebar-surface-primary"><div class="flex items-center text-token-text-secondary px-4 py-2 text-xs font-sans justify-between h-9 bg-token-sidebar-surface-primary select-none rounded-t-2xl corner-t-superellipse/1.1">bash</div><div class="sticky top-[calc(var(--sticky-padding-top)+9*var(--spacing))]"><div class="absolute end-0 bottom-0 flex h-9 items-center pe-2"><div class="bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary text-token-text-secondary flex items-center gap-4 rounded-sm px-2 font-sans text-xs"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none py-1" aria-label="Sao chép"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-j9921kii.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg>Sao chép mã</button></div></div></div><div class="overflow-y-auto p-4" dir="ltr"><code class="whitespace-pre! language-bash"><span><span>git --version
</span></span></code></div></div></pre>
<p data-start="1527" data-end="1552">👉 Nếu ra version → OK 🎉</p>
<p data-start="1554" data-end="1572">Sau đó mở VS Code:</p>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="1573" data-end="1595"><div class="contain-inline-size rounded-2xl corner-superellipse/1.1 relative bg-token-sidebar-surface-primary"><div class="flex items-center text-token-text-secondary px-4 py-2 text-xs font-sans justify-between h-9 bg-token-sidebar-surface-primary select-none rounded-t-2xl corner-t-superellipse/1.1">bash</div><div class="sticky top-[calc(var(--sticky-padding-top)+9*var(--spacing))]"><div class="absolute end-0 bottom-0 flex h-9 items-center pe-2"><div class="bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary text-token-text-secondary flex items-center gap-4 rounded-sm px-2 font-sans text-xs"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none py-1" aria-label="Sao chép"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-j9921kii.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg>Sao chép mã</button></div></div></div><div class="overflow-y-auto p-4" dir="ltr"><code class="whitespace-pre! language-bash"><span><span>Git: Clone
</span></span></code></div></div></pre>
<hr data-start="1597" data-end="1600">
<h2 data-start="1602" data-end="1624">⚠️ LƯU Ý QUAN TRỌNG</h2>
<ul data-start="1625" data-end="1732">
<li data-start="1625" data-end="1664">
<p data-start="1627" data-end="1664"><strong data-start="1627" data-end="1655">Cài xong mà chưa restart</strong> → dễ lỗi</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1665" data-end="1697">
<p data-start="1667" data-end="1697">Không copy git.exe từ máy khác</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1698" data-end="1732">
<p data-start="1700" data-end="1732">Không cài Git Portable lung tung</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="1734" data-end="1737">
<h2 data-start="1739" data-end="1759">🧠 TÓM TẮT 1 DÒNG</h2>
<blockquote data-start="1760" data-end="1848">
<p data-start="1762" data-end="1848">Lỗi do <strong data-start="1769" data-end="1815">cài sai bản Git so với Windows (32/64/ARM)</strong> → gỡ Git → cài lại bản đúng → OK</p>
</blockquote>
<hr data-start="1850" data-end="1853">
<p data-start="1855" data-end="1899">👉 Bạn làm tới <strong data-start="1870" data-end="1880">Bước 1</strong> xong thì gửi mình:</p>
<ul data-start="1900" data-end="1994" data-is-last-node="" data-is-only-node="">
<li data-start="1900" data-end="1994" data-is-last-node="">
<p data-start="1902" data-end="1994" data-is-last-node=""><code data-start="1902" data-end="1915">System Type</code> là gì<br data-start="1921" data-end="1924">
Mình sẽ nói <strong data-start="1936" data-end="1974">chính xác bạn phải tải bản Git nào</strong>, khỏi lo sai nữa 👍</p>
</li>
</ul></div></div></div></div><div class="z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start"><div class="touch:-me-2 touch:-ms-3.5 -ms-2.5 -me-1 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-y-4 p-1 select-none touch:w-[calc(100%+--spacing(3.5))] -mt-1 w-[calc(100%+--spacing(2.5))] duration-[1.5s] focus-within:transition-none hover:transition-none touch:pointer-events-auto pointer-events-none [mask-image:linear-gradient(to_right,black_33%,transparent_66%)] [mask-size:300%_100%] [mask-position:100%_0%] motion-safe:transition-[mask-position] group-hover/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-hover/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] group-focus-within/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-focus-within/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] has-data-[state=open]:pointer-events-auto has-data-[state=open]:[mask-position:0_0]" style="mask-position: 0% 0%;"><button class="text-token-text-secondary hover:bg-token-bg-secondary rounded-lg" aria-label="Sao chép" aria-pressed="false" data-testid="copy-turn-action-button" data-state="closed"><span class="flex items-center justify-center touch:w-10 h-8 w-8"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-j9921kii.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></span></button><button class="text-token-text-secondary hover:bg-token-bg-secondary rounded-lg" aria-label="Phản hồi tốt" aria-pressed="false" data-testid="good-response-turn-action-button" data-state="closed"><span class="flex items-center justify-center touch:w-10 h-8 w-8"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-j9921kii.svg#51753c" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></span></button><button class="text-token-text-secondary hover:bg-token-bg-secondary rounded-lg" aria-label="Phản hồi không tốt" aria-pressed="false" data-testid="bad-response-turn-action-button" data-state="closed"><span class="flex items-center justify-center touch:w-10 h-8 