<hr data-start="149" data-end="152">
<h2 data-start="154" data-end="177">❗ SỰ THẬT QUAN TRỌNG</h2>
<p data-start="178" data-end="246"><strong data-start="178" data-end="222"><code data-start="180" data-end="202">Git: Show Git Output</code> KHÔNG CÒN TỒN TẠI</strong> trong VS Code hiện tại.</p>
<p data-start="248" data-end="258">➡️ Vì vậy:</p>
<ul data-start="259" data-end="342">
<li data-start="259" data-end="287">
<p data-start="261" data-end="287">Gọi lệnh đó → <strong data-start="275" data-end="287">luôn lỗi</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start="288" data-end="342">
<p data-start="290" data-end="342">Cài Git đúng hay sai <strong data-start="311" data-end="330">KHÔNG LIÊN QUAN</strong> tới lỗi này</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="344" data-end="400">👉 Bạn <strong data-start="351" data-end="368">đang làm đúng</strong>, chỉ là dùng <strong data-start="382" data-end="399">lệnh đã bị bỏ</strong>.</p>
<hr data-start="402" data-end="405">
<h2 data-start="407" data-end="456">✅ CÁCH LÀM ĐÚNG (KHÔNG DÙNG <code data-start="438" data-end="455">Show Git Output</code>)</h2>
<h3 data-start="458" data-end="498">🔹 1. Kiểm tra Git đã hoạt động chưa</h3>
<p data-start="499" data-end="542">Mở <strong data-start="502" data-end="528">Terminal trong VS Code</strong> (`Ctrl + ``):</p>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="544" data-end="569"><div class="contain-inline-size rounded-2xl corner-superellipse/1.1 relative bg-token-sidebar-surface-primary"><div class="flex items-center text-token-text-secondary px-4 py-2 text-xs font-sans justify-between h-9 bg-token-sidebar-surface-primary select-none rounded-t-2xl corner-t-superellipse/1.1">bash</div><div class="sticky top-[calc(var(--sticky-padding-top)+9*var(--spacing))]"><div class="absolute end-0 bottom-0 flex h-9 items-center pe-2"><div class="bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary text-token-text-secondary flex items-center gap-4 rounded-sm px-2 font-sans text-xs"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none py-1" aria-label="Sao chép"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-j9921kii.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg>Sao chép mã</button></div></div></div><div class="overflow-y-auto p-4" dir="ltr"><code class="whitespace-pre! language-bash"><span><span>git --version
</span></span></code></div></div></pre>
<ul data-start="571" data-end="625">
<li data-start="571" data-end="596">
<p data-start="573" data-end="596">Nếu ra version → Git OK</p>
</li>
<li data-start="597" data-end="625">
<p data-start="599" data-end="625">Nếu không → mới là lỗi Git</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="627" data-end="630">
<h3 data-start="632" data-end="667">🔹 2. Clone project (CÁCH ĐÚNG)</h3>
<h4 data-start="669" data-end="696">Cách A – trong VS Code</h4>
<ul data-start="697" data-end="783">
<li data-start="697" data-end="717">
<p data-start="699" data-end="717"><code data-start="699" data-end="717">Ctrl + Shift + P</code></p>
</li>
<li data-start="718" data-end="750">
<p data-start="720" data-end="725">Gõ:</p>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="728" data-end="750"><div class="contain-inline-size rounded-2xl corner-superellipse/1.1 relative bg-token-sidebar-surface-primary"><div class="flex items-center text-token-text-secondary px-4 py-2 text-xs font-sans justify-between h-9 bg-token-sidebar-surface-primary select-none rounded-t-2xl corner-t-superellipse/1.1">makefile</div><div class="sticky top-[calc(var(--sticky-padding-top)+9*var(--spacing))]"><div class="absolute end-0 bottom-0 flex h-9 items-center pe-2"><div class="bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary text-token-text-secondary flex items-center gap-4 rounded-sm px-2 font-sans text-xs"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none py-1" aria-label="Sao chép"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-j9921kii.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg>Sao chép mã</button></div></div></div><div class="overflow-y-auto p-4" dir="ltr"><code class="whitespace-pre!"><span><span><span class="hljs-section">Git: Clone</span></span><span>
</span></span></code></div></div></pre>
</li>
<li data-start="751" data-end="768">
<p data-start="753" data-end="768">Dán link GitHub</p>
</li>
<li data-start="769" data-end="783">
<p data-start="771" data-end="783">Chọn thư mục</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="785" data-end="824">❌ <strong data-start="787" data-end="801">KHÔNG dùng</strong> <code data-start="802" data-end="824">Git: Show Git Output</code></p>
<hr data-start="826" data-end="829">
<h4 data-start="831" data-end="858">Cách B – dùng Terminal</h4>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="859" data-end="894"><div class="contain-inline-size rounded-2xl corner-superellipse/1.1 relative bg-token-sidebar-surface-primary"><div class="flex items-center text-token-text-secondary px-4 py-2 text-xs font-sans justify-between h-9 bg-token-sidebar-surface-primary select-none rounded-t-2xl corner-t-superellipse/1.1">bash</div><div class="sticky top-[calc(var(--sticky-padding-top)+9*var(--spacing))]"><div class="absolute end-0 bottom-0 flex h-9 items-center pe-2"><div class="bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary text-token-text-secondary flex items-center gap-4 rounded-sm px-2 font-sans text-xs"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none py-1" aria-label="Sao chép"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-j9921kii.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg>Sao chép mã</button></div></div></div><div class="overflow-y-auto p-4" dir="ltr"><code class="whitespace-pre! language-bash"><span><span>git </span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">clone</span></span><span> &lt;link-github&gt;
</span></span></code></div></div></pre>
<hr data-start="896" data-end="899">
<h3 data-start="901" data-end="947">🔹 3. Xem trạng thái Git (THAY THẾ OUTPUT)</h3>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="948" data-end="970"><div class="contain-inline-size rounded-2xl corner-superellipse/1.1 relative bg-token-sidebar-surface-primary"><div class="flex items-center text-token-text-secondary px-4 py-2 text-xs font-sans justify-between h-9 bg-token-sidebar-surface-primary select-none rounded-t-2xl corner-t-superellipse/1.1">bash</div><div class="sticky top-[calc(var(--sticky-padding-top)+9*var(--spacing))]"><div class="absolute end-0 bottom-0 flex h-9 items-center pe-2"><div class="bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary text-token-text-secondary flex items-center gap-4 rounded-sm px-2 font-sans text-xs"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none py-1" aria-label="Sao chép"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-j9921kii.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg>Sao chép mã</button></div></div></div><div class="overflow-y-auto p-4" dir="ltr"><code class="whitespace-pre! language-bash"><span><span>git status
</span></span></code></div></div></pre>
<hr data-start="972" data-end="975">
<h2 data-start="977" data-end="999">🧠 TÓM TẮT NGẮN GỌN</h2>
<ul data-start="1000" data-end="1097">
<li data-start="1000" data-end="1039">
<p data-start="1002" data-end="1039">❌ <code data-start="1004" data-end="1026">Git: Show Git Output</code> → <strong data-start="1029" data-end="1039">bỏ qua</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start="1040" data-end="1097">
<p data-start="1042" data-end="1049">✅ Dùng:</p>
<ul data-start="1052" data-end="1097">
<li data-start="1052" data-end="1066">
<p data-start="1054" data-end="1066"><code data-start="1054" data-end="1066">Git: Clone</code></p>
</li>
<li data-start="1069" data-end="1083">
<p data-start="1071" data-end="1083"><code data-start="1071" data-end="1083">git status</code></p>
</li>
<li data-start="1086" data-end="1097">
<p data-start="1088" data-end="1097"><code data-start="1088" data-end="1097">git log</code></p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="1099" data-end="1102">
<h2 data-start="1104" data-end="1136">📌 NẾU BẠN MUỐN XÁC NHẬN 100%</h2>
<p data-start="1138" data-end="1172">Gửi mình <strong data-start="1147" data-end="1171">kết quả của lệnh này</strong>:</p>
