<p data-start="62" data-end="85">👉 Điều này khẳng định:</p>
<ul data-start="86" data-end="187">
<li data-start="86" data-end="112">
<p data-start="88" data-end="112">Git <strong data-start="92" data-end="112">đã được cài đúng</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start="113" data-end="149">
<p data-start="115" data-end="149">Git <strong data-start="119" data-end="149">chạy được trong PowerShell</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start="150" data-end="187">
<p data-start="152" data-end="187">VS Code <strong data-start="160" data-end="187">KHÔNG còn vấn đề về Git</strong></p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="189" data-end="192">
<h2 data-start="194" data-end="227">❗ Vì sao bạn vẫn thấy lỗi kia?</h2>
<p data-start="229" data-end="259">👉 Nhắc lại lần cuối cho chắc:</p>
<p data-start="261" data-end="376"><strong data-start="261" data-end="319"><code data-start="263" data-end="285">Git: Show Git Output</code> KHÔNG còn tồn tại trong VS Code</strong><br data-start="319" data-end="322">
→ Gọi lệnh này <strong data-start="337" data-end="349">luôn lỗi</strong>, dù Git có đúng hay không.</p>
<p data-start="378" data-end="408">➡️ <strong data-start="381" data-end="408">BỎ QUA HOÀN TOÀN LỖI ĐÓ</strong></p>
<hr data-start="410" data-end="413">
<h2 data-start="415" data-end="447">✅ TỪ GIỜ BẠN LÀM ĐÚNG NHƯ SAU</h2>
<h3 data-start="449" data-end="469">🔹 Clone project</h3>
<p data-start="470" data-end="489"><strong data-start="470" data-end="489">Cách 1: VS Code</strong></p>
<ul data-start="490" data-end="547">
<li data-start="490" data-end="510">
<p data-start="492" data-end="510"><code data-start="492" data-end="510">Ctrl + Shift + P</code></p>
</li>
<li data-start="511" data-end="529">
<p data-start="513" data-end="529">Gõ: <code data-start="517" data-end="529">Git: Clone</code></p>
</li>
<li data-start="530" data-end="547">
<p data-start="532" data-end="547">Dán link GitHub</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="549" data-end="569"><strong data-start="549" data-end="569">Cách 2: Terminal</strong></p>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="570" data-end="605"><div class="contain-inline-size rounded-2xl corner-superellipse/1.1 relative bg-token-sidebar-surface-primary"><div class="flex items-center text-token-text-secondary px-4 py-2 text-xs font-sans justify-between h-9 bg-token-sidebar-surface-primary select-none rounded-t-2xl corner-t-superellipse/1.1">bash</div><div class="sticky top-[calc(var(--sticky-padding-top)+9*var(--spacing))]"><div class="absolute end-0 bottom-0 flex h-9 items-center pe-2"><div class="bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary text-token-text-secondary flex items-center gap-4 rounded-sm px-2 font-sans text-xs"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none py-1" aria-label="Sao chép"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-j9921kii.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg>Sao chép mã</button></div></div></div><div class="overflow-y-auto p-4" dir="ltr"><code class="whitespace-pre! language-bash"><span><span>git </span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">clone</span></span><span> &lt;link-github&gt;
</span></span></code></div></div></pre>
<hr data-start="607" data-end="610">
