<hr data-start="831" data-end="834">
<h2 data-start="836" data-end="861">🧠 TÓM TẮT CHO BẠN NHỚ</h2>
<ul data-start="862" data-end="982">
<li data-start="862" data-end="877">
<p data-start="864" data-end="877">Git đã <strong data-start="871" data-end="877">OK</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start="878" data-end="897">
<p data-start="880" data-end="897">VS Code không lỗi</p>
</li>
<li data-start="898" data-end="938">
<p data-start="900" data-end="938">Lỗi kia là do <strong data-start="914" data-end="938">dùng nhầm command cũ</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start="939" data-end="982">
<p data-start="941" data-end="982"><strong data-start="941" data-end="982">Không dùng <code data-start="954" data-end="976">Git: Show Git Output</code> nữa</strong></p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="984" data-end="987">
<p data-start="989" data-end="1006">Nếu bạn muốn 👉</p>
<ul data-start="1007" data-end="1140">
<li data-start="1007" data-end="1058">
<p data-start="1009" data-end="1058">Mình <strong data-start="1014" data-end="1058">hướng dẫn quy trình làm nhóm chuẩn 1–2–3</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start="1059" data-end="1104">
<p data-start="1061" data-end="1104">Hoặc <strong data-start="1066" data-end="1104">setup project React + Vite từ repo</strong></p>
