markdown-new-styling"><p data-start="0" data-end="101">Hiểu rồi 👍<br data-start="11" data-end="14">
Bạn hỏi <strong data-start="22" data-end="43">“xem nhanh ở đâu”</strong> thì có <strong data-start="51" data-end="75">3 chỗ xem nhanh nhất</strong>, tùy bạn muốn xem cái gì:</p>
<hr data-start="103" data-end="106">
<h2 data-start="108" data-end="149">✅ 1️⃣ Xem nhanh code (KHÔNG cần clone)</h2>
<p data-start="150" data-end="172">👉 <strong data-start="153" data-end="172">Trên GitHub web</strong></p>
<p data-start="174" data-end="182">Mở link:</p>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="183" data-end="229"><div class="contain-inline-size rounded-2xl corner-superellipse/1.1 relative bg-token-sidebar-surface-primary"><div class="flex items-center text-token-text-secondary px-4 py-2 text-xs font-sans justify-between h-9 bg-token-sidebar-surface-primary select-none rounded-t-2xl corner-t-superellipse/1.1">bash</div><div class="sticky top-[calc(var(--sticky-padding-top)+9*var(--spacing))]"><div class="absolute end-0 bottom-0 flex h-9 items-center pe-2"><div class="bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary text-token-text-secondary flex items-center gap-4 rounded-sm px-2 font-sans text-xs"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none py-1" aria-label="Sao chép"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-j9921kii.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg>Sao chép mã</button></div></div></div><div class="overflow-y-auto p-4" dir="ltr"><code class="whitespace-pre!"><span><span>https://github.com/lttboy25/shoe-store
</span></span></code></div></div></pre>
<p data-start="231" data-end="240">Dùng khi:</p>
<ul data-start="241" data-end="306">
<li data-start="241" data-end="263">
<p data-start="243" data-end="263">Xem cấu trúc thư mục</p>
</li>
<li data-start="264" data-end="286">
<p data-start="266" data-end="286">Xem file ai vừa push</p>
</li>
<li data-start="287" data-end="306">
<p data-start="289" data-end="306">Review nhanh code</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="308" data-end="344">👉 <strong data-start="311" data-end="344">Nhanh nhất, không cần VS Code</strong></p>
<hr data-start="346" data-end="349">
<h2 data-start="351" data-end="401">✅ 2️⃣ Xem nhanh tình trạng code (TRONG VS CODE)</h2>
<p data-start="402" data-end="440">👉 <strong data-start="405" data-end="440">Source Control (icon nhánh cây)</strong></p>
<ul data-start="442" data-end="577">
<li data-start="442" data-end="468">
