lex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden first:pt-[1px]"><div class="markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full wrap-break-word light markdown-new-styling"><p data-start="0" data-end="73">Lỗi này <strong data-start="8" data-end="25">rất chuẩn Git</strong> 👍, mình giải thích ngắn gọn + cách xử lý ngay:</p>
<hr data-start="75" data-end="78">
<h2 data-start="80" data-end="89">❌ Lỗi:</h2>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="90" data-end="213"><div class="contain-inline-size rounded-2xl corner-superellipse/1.1 relative bg-token-sidebar-surface-primary"><div class="flex items-center text-token-text-secondary px-4 py-2 text-xs font-sans justify-between h-9 bg-token-sidebar-surface-primary select-none rounded-t-2xl corner-t-superellipse/1.1">pgsql</div><div class="sticky top-[calc(var(--sticky-padding-top)+9*var(--spacing))]"><div class="absolute end-0 bottom-0 flex h-9 items-center pe-2"><div class="bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary text-token-text-secondary flex items-center gap-4 rounded-sm px-2 font-sans text-xs"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none py-1" aria-label="Sao chép"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-j9921kii.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg>Sao chép mã</button></div></div></div><div class="overflow-y-auto p-4" dir="ltr"><code class="whitespace-pre!"><span><span>cannot </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">delete</span></span><span> branch </span><span><span class="hljs-string">'tu'</span></span><span> used </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">by</span></span><span> worktree at </span><span><span class="hljs-string">'T:/HK2-2025-2026/Phat_Trien_Giao_Dien_Ung_Dung/BaiTapLon/shoe-store'</span></span><span>
</span></span></code></div></div></pre>
<h3 data-start="215" data-end="233">👉 Nguyên nhân</h3>
<ul data-start="234" data-end="330">
<li data-start="234" data-end="269">
<p data-start="236" data-end="269">Bạn <strong data-start="240" data-end="269">đang đứng trên nhánh <code data-start="263" data-end="267">tu</code></strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start="270" data-end="330">
<p data-start="272" data-end="330">Git <strong data-start="276" data-end="330">không cho xóa nhánh đang được checkout (đang dùng)</strong></p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="332" data-end="335">
<h2 data-start="337" data-end="368">✅ Cách sửa (làm theo thứ tự)</h2>
<h3 data-start="370" data-end="422">🔹 Bước 1: Chuyển sang nhánh khác (ví dụ <code data-start="415" data-end="421">main</code>)</h3>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="423" data-end="452"><div class="contain-inline-size rounded-2xl corner-superellipse/1.1 relative bg-token-sidebar-surface-primary"><div class="flex items-center text-token-text-secondary px-4 py-2 text-xs font-sans justify-between h-9 bg-token-sidebar-surface-primary select-none rounded-t-2xl corner-t-superellipse/1.1">bash</div><div class="sticky top-[calc(var(--sticky-padding-top)+9*var(--spacing))]"><div class="absolute end-0 bottom-0 flex h-9 items-center pe-2"><div class="bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary text-token-text-secondary flex items-center gap-4 rounded-sm px-2 font-sans text-xs"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none py-1" aria-label="Sao chép"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-j9921kii.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg>Sao chép mã</button></div></div></div><div class="overflow-y-auto p-4" dir="ltr"><code class="whitespace-pre! language-bash"><span><span>git checkout main
</span></span></code></div></div></pre>
<p data-start="453" data-end="475">hoặc nếu dùng Git mới:</p>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="476" data-end="503"><div class="contain-inline-size rounded-2xl corner-superellipse/1.1 relative bg-token-sidebar-surface-primary"><div class="flex items-center text-token-text-secondary px-4 py-2 text-xs font-sans justify-between h-9 bg-token-sidebar-surface-primary select-none rounded-t-2xl corner-t-superellipse/1.1">bash</div><div class="sticky top-[calc(var(--sticky-padding-top)+9*var(--spacing))]"><div class="absolute end-0 bottom-0 flex h-9 items-center pe-2"><div class="bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary text-token-text-secondary flex items-center gap-4 rounded-sm px-2 font-sans text-xs"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none py-1" aria-label="Sao chép"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-j9921kii.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg>Sao chép mã</button></div></div></div><div class="overflow-y-auto p-4" dir="ltr"><code class="whitespace-pre! language-bash"><span><span>git switch main
</span></span></code></div></div></pre>
<blockquote data-start="505" data-end="568">
<p data-start="507" data-end="568">Nếu <code data-start="511" data-end="517">main</code> bị khóa push thì <strong data-start="535" data-end="568">vẫn checkout được bình thường</strong></p>
</blockquote>
<hr data-start="570" data-end="573">
<h3 data-start="575" data-end="604">🔹 Bước 2: Xóa nhánh <code data-start="600" data-end="604">tu</code></h3>
<h4 data-start="606" data-end="636">Xóa nhánh local (an toàn)</h4>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="637" data-end="665"><div class="contain-inline-size rounded-2xl corner-superellipse/1.1 relative bg-token-sidebar-surface-primary"><div class="flex items-center text-token-text-secondary px-4 py-2 text-xs font-sans justify-between h-9 bg-token-sidebar-surface-primary select-none rounded-t-2xl corner-t-superellipse/1.1">bash</div><div class="sticky top-[calc(var(--sticky-padding-top)+9*var(--spacing))]"><div class="absolute end-0 bottom-0 flex h-9 items-center pe-2"><div class="bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary text-token-text-secondary flex items-center gap-4 rounded-sm px-2 font-sans text-xs"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none py-1" aria-label="Sao chép"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-j9921kii.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg>Sao chép mã</button></div></div></div><div class="overflow-y-auto p-4" dir="ltr"><code class="whitespace-pre! language-bash"><span><span>git branch -d tu
</span></span></code></div></div></pre>
<h4 data-start="667" data-end="703">Nếu Git báo chưa merge → ép xóa</h4>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="704" data-end="732"><div class="contain-inline-size rounded-2xl corner-superellipse/1.1 relative bg-token-sidebar-surface-primary"><div class="flex items-center text-token-text-secondary px-4 py-2 text-xs font-sans justify-between h-9 bg-token-sidebar-surface-primary select-none rounded-t-2xl corner-t-superellipse/1.1">bash</div><div class="sticky top-[calc(var(--sticky-padding-top)+9*var(--spacing))]"><div class="absolute end-0 bottom-0 flex h-9 items-center pe-2"><div class="bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary text-token-text-secondary flex items-center gap-4 rounded-sm px-2 font-sans text-xs"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none py-1" aria-label="Sao chép"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-j9921kii.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg>Sao chép mã</button></div></div></div><div class="overflow-y-auto p-4" dir="ltr"><code class="whitespace-pre! language-bash"><span><span>git branch -D tu
</span></span></code></div></div></pre>
<hr data-start="734" data-end="737">
<h2 data-start="739" data-end="791">🌐 Nếu muốn xóa nhánh trên remote (GitHub/GitLab)</h2>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="792" data-end="831"><div class="contain-inline-size rounded-2xl corner-superellipse/1.1 relative bg-token-sidebar-surface-primary"><div class="flex items-center text-token-text-secondary px-4 py-2 text-xs font-sans justify-between h-9 bg-token-sidebar-surface-primary select-none rounded-t-2xl corner-t-superellipse/1.1">bash</div><div class="sticky top-[calc(var(--sticky-padding-top)+9*var(--spacing))]"><div class="absolute end-0 bottom-0 flex h-9 items-center pe-2"><div class="bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary text-token-text-secondary flex items-center gap-4 rounded-sm px-2 font-sans text-xs"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none py-1" aria-label="Sao chép"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-j9921kii.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg>Sao chép mã</button></div></div></div><div class="overflow-y-auto p-4" dir="ltr"><code class="whitespace-pre! language-bash"><span><span>git push origin --delete tu
</span></span></code></div></div></pre>
<hr data-start="833" data-end="836">
<h2 data-start="838" data-end="866">🔍 Kiểm tra lại các nhánh</h2>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="867" data-end="970"><div class="contain-inline-size rounded-2xl corner-superellipse/1.1 relative bg-token-sidebar-surface-primary"><div class="flex items-center text-token-text-secondary px-4 py-2 text-xs font-sans justify-between h-9 bg-token-sidebar-surface-primary select-none rounded-t-2xl corner-t-superellipse/1.1">bash</div><div class="sticky top-[calc(var(--sticky-padding-top)+9*var(--spacing))]"><div class="absolute end-0 bottom-0 flex h-9 items-center pe-2"><div class="bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary text-token-text-secondary flex items-center gap-4 rounded-sm px-2 font-sans text-xs"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none py-1" aria-label="Sao chép"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-j9921kii.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg>Sao chép mã</button></div></div></div><div class="overflow-y-auto p-4" dir="ltr"><code class="whitespace-pre! language-bash"><span><span>git branch        </span><span><span class="hljs-comment"># nhánh local</span></span><span>
git branch -r     </span><span><span class="hljs-comment"># nhánh remote</span></span><span>
git branch -a     </span><span><span class="hljs-comment"># tất cả</span></span><span>
</span></span></code></div></div></pre>
<hr data-start="972" data-end="975">
<h2 data-start="977" data-end="996">📝 Tóm tắt nhanh</h2>
<div class="TyagGW_tableContainer"><div tabindex="-1" class="group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit"><table data-start="997" data-end="1213" class="w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)"><thead data-start="997" data-end="1012"><tr data-start="997" data-end="1012"><th data-start="997" data-end="1004" data-col-size="sm" class="">Việc</th><th data-start="1004" data-end="1012" data-col-size="sm" class="">Lệnh</th></tr></thead><tbody data-start="1025" data-end="1213"><tr data-start="1025" data-end="1053"><td data-start="1025" data-end="1037" data-col-size="sm">Xem nhánh</td><td data-start="1037" data-end="1053" data-col-size="sm"><code data-start="1039" data-end="1051">git branch</code></td></tr><tr data-start="1054" data-end="1087"><td data-start="1054" data-end="1066" data-col-size="sm">Đổi nhánh</td><td data-start="1066" data-end="1087" data-col-size="sm"><code data-start="1068" data-end="1085">git switch main</code></td></tr><tr data-start="1088" data-end="1128"><td data-start="1088" data-end="1106" data-col-size="sm">Xóa nhánh local</td><td data-start="1106" data-end="1128" data-col-size="sm"><code data-start="1108" data-end="1126">git branch -d tu</code></td></tr><tr data-start="1129" data-end="1160"><td data-start="1129" data-end="1138" data-col-size="sm">Ép xóa</td><td data-start="1138" data-end="1160" data-col-size="sm"><code data-start="1140" data-end="1158">git branch -D tu</code></td></tr><tr data-start="1161" data-end="1213"><td data-start="1161" data-end="1180" data-col-size="sm">Xóa nhánh remote</td><td data-start="1180" data-end="1213" data-col-size="sm"><code data-start="1182" data-end="1211">git push origin --delete tu</code></td></tr></tbody></table><div class="sticky h-0 select-none end-(--thread-content-margin) self-end"><div class="absolute end-0 flex items-end" style="height: 33.1562px;"><span class="" data-state="closed"><button aria-label="Sao chép bảng" class="hover:bg-token-bg-tertiary text-token-text-secondary my-1 rounded-sm p-1