giải thích</div></div></div></div></div><div class="z-0 flex justify-end"><div class="touch:-me-2 touch:-ms-3.5 -ms-2.5 -me-1 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-y-4 p-1 select-none focus-within:transition-none hover:transition-none touch:pointer-events-auto touch:opacity-100 duration-300 group-hover/turn-messages:delay-300 pointer-events-none opacity-0 motion-safe:transition-opacity group-hover/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-hover/turn-messages:opacity-100 group-focus-within/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-focus-within/turn-messages:opacity-100 has-data-[state=open]:pointer-events-auto has-data-[state=open]:opacity-100" style="mask-position: 0% 0%;"><button class="text-token-text-secondary hover:bg-token-bg-secondary rounded-lg" aria-label="Sao chép" aria-pressed="false" data-testid="copy-turn-action-button" data-state="closed"><span class="flex items-center justify-center touch:w-10 h-8 w-8"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-j9921kii.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></span></button><button class="text-token-text-secondary hover:bg-token-bg-secondary rounded-lg" aria-label="Chỉnh sửa tin nhắn" aria-pressed="false" data-state="closed"><span class="flex items-center justify-center touch:w-10 h-8 w-8"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-j9921kii.svg#6d87e1" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></span></button></div></div></div></div><br class="sr-only"></article><article class="text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none [--shadow-height:45px] has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none has-data-writing-block:-mt-(--shadow-height) has-data-writing-block:pt-(--shadow-height) [&amp;:has([data-writing-block])&gt;*]:pointer-events-auto scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]" tabindex="-1" dir="auto" data-turn-id="ac603209-2896-4aa1-b99c-f4e9e9793b30" data-testid="conversation-turn-74" data-scroll-anchor="false" data-turn="assistant"><h6 class="sr-only">ChatGPT đã nói:</h6><div class="text-base my-auto mx-auto [--thread-content-margin:--spacing(4)] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:--spacing(6)] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:--spacing(16)] px-(--thread-content-margin)"><div class="[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn" tabindex="-1"><div class="flex max-w-full flex-col grow"><div data-message-author-role="assistant" data-message-id="ac603209-2896-4aa1-b99c-f4e9e9793b30" dir="auto" class="min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1" data-message-model-slug="gpt-5-2"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden first:pt-[1px]"><div class="markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full wrap-break-word light markdown-new-styling"><p data-start="0" data-end="80">Mình giải thích <strong data-start="16" data-end="73">từng câu – đúng ngữ cảnh làm việc nhóm với Git/GitHub</strong> nhé 👇</p>
<hr data-start="82" data-end="85">
<h3 data-start="87" data-end="184"><strong data-start="91" data-end="184">1️⃣ “Mai mốt mọi người cứ clone về xong qua nhánh của mình làm r push lên nhánh mình nhé”</strong></h3>
<p data-start="186" data-end="197">👉 Ý nghĩa:</p>
<ul data-start="198" data-end="378">
<li data-start="198" data-end="238">
<p data-start="200" data-end="238">Mỗi người <strong data-start="210" data-end="238">clone source code về máy</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start="239" data-end="276">
<p data-start="241" data-end="276"><strong data-start="241" data-end="276">KHÔNG làm trực tiếp trên <code data-start="268" data-end="274">main</code></strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start="277" data-end="335">
<p data-start="279" data-end="335">Tạo <strong data-start="283" data-end="307">nhánh riêng của mình</strong> (ví dụ: <code data-start="316" data-end="320">tu</code>, <code data-start="322" data-end="326">an</code>, <code data-start="328" data-end="334">binh</code>)</p>
</li>
<li data-start="336" data-end="378">
<p data-start="338" data-end="378">Code xong thì <strong data-start="352" data-end="378">push lên nhánh cá nhân</strong></p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="380" data-end="392">📌 Mục đích:</p>
<ul data-start="393" data-end="475">
<li data-start="393" data-end="415">
<p data-start="395" data-end="415">Tránh đụng code nhau</p>
</li>
<li data-start="416" data-end="475">
<p data-start="418" data-end="475">Ai làm lỗi → chỉ lỗi nhánh đó, không ảnh hưởng người khác</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="477" data-end="480">
<h3 data-start="482" data-end="566"><strong data-start="486" data-end="566">2️⃣ “Tui khóa nhánh main lại r ko push trực tiếp lên được đâu nên đỡ sợ lỗi”</strong></h3>
<p data-start="568" data-end="579">👉 Ý nghĩa:</p>
<ul data-start="580" data-end="731">
<li data-start="580" data-end="633">
<p data-start="582" data-end="633">Nhánh <code data-start="588" data-end="594">main</code> đã được <strong data-start="603" data-end="633">protect (khóa) trên GitHub</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start="634" data-end="691">
<p data-start="636" data-end="652">Không ai có thể:</p>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="655" data-end="691"><div class="contain-inline-size rounded-2xl corner-superellipse/1.1 relative bg-token-sidebar-surface-primary"><div class="flex items-center text-token-text-secondary px-4 py-2 text-xs font-sans justify-between h-9 bg-token-sidebar-surface-primary select-none rounded-t-2xl corner-t-superellipse/1.1">bash</div><div class="sticky top-[calc(var(--sticky-padding-top)+9*var(--spacing))]"><div class="absolute end-0 bottom-0 flex h-9 items-center pe-2"><div class="bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary text-token-text-secondary flex items-center gap-4 rounded-sm px-2 font-sans text-xs"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none py-1" aria-label="Sao chép"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-j9921kii.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg>Sao chép mã</button></div></div></div><div class="overflow-y-auto p-4" dir="ltr"><code class="whitespace-pre! language-bash"><span><span>git push origin main
</span></span></code></div></div></pre>
</li>
<li data-start="692" data-end="731">
<p data-start="694" data-end="731">Chỉ có thể <strong data-start="705" data-end="731">merge qua Pull Request</strong></p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="733" data-end="744">📌 Lợi ích:</p>
<ul data-start="745" data-end="799">
<li data-start="745" data-end="799">
<p data-start="747" data-end="753">Tránh:</p>
<ul data-start="756" data-end="799">
<li data-start="756" data-end="767">
<p data-start="758" data-end="767">Push nhầm</p>
</li>
<li data-start="770" data-end="779">
<p data-start="772" data-end="779">Đè code</p>
</li>
<li data-start="782" data-end="799">
<p data-start="784" data-end="799">Làm sập project</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="801" data-end="843">👉 Đây là <strong data-start="811" data-end="843">cách làm CHUẨN trong công ty</strong></p>
<hr data-start="845" data-end="848">
<h3 data-start="850" data-end="914"><strong data-start="854" data-end="914">3️⃣ “Mỗi lần mn làm thì nhớ pull main mới nhất về là ok”</strong></h3>
<p data-start="916" data-end="927">👉 Ý nghĩa:</p>
<ul data-start="928" data-end="945">
<li data-start="928" data-end="945">
<p data-start="930" data-end="945">Trước khi code:</p>
</li>
</ul>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="946" data-end="996"><div class="contain-inline-size rounded-2xl corner-superellipse/1.1 relative bg-token-sidebar-surface-primary"><div class="flex items-center text-token-text-secondary px-4 py-2 text-xs font-sans justify-between h-9 bg-token-sidebar-surface-primary select-none rounded-t-2xl corner-t-superellipse/1.1">bash</div><div class="sticky top-[calc(var(--sticky-padding-top)+9*var(--spacing))]"><div class="absolute end-0 bottom-0 flex h-9 items-center pe-2"><div class="bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary text-token-text-secondary flex items-center gap-4 rounded-sm px-2 font-sans text-xs"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none py-1" aria-label="Sao chép"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-j9921kii.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg>Sao chép mã</button></div></div></div><div class="overflow-y-auto p-4" dir="ltr"><code class="whitespace-pre! language-bash"><span><span>git checkout main
git pull origin main
</span></span></code></div></div></pre>
<ul data-start="998" data-end="1030">
<li data-start="998" data-end="1030">
<p data-start="1000" data-end="1030">Sau đó quay lại nhánh cá nhân:</p>
</li>
</ul>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="1031" data-end="1073"><div class="contain-inline-size rounded-2xl corner-superellipse/1.1 relative bg-token-sidebar-surface-primary"><div class="flex items-center text-token-text-secondary px-4 py-2 text-xs font-sans justify-between h-9 bg-token-sidebar-surface-primary select-none rounded-t-2xl corner-t-superellipse/1.1">bash</div><div class="sticky top-[calc(var(--sticky-padding-top)+9*var(--spacing))]"><div class="absolute end-0 bottom-0 flex h-9 items-center pe-2"><div class="bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary text-token-text-secondary flex items-center gap-4 rounded-sm px-2 font-sans text-xs"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none py-1" aria-label="Sao chép"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-j9921kii.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg>Sao chép mã</button></div></div></div><div class="overflow-y-auto p-4" dir="ltr"><code class="whitespace-pre! language-bash"><span><span>git checkout tu
git merge main
</span></span></code></div></div></pre>
<p data-start="1074" data-end="1087">(hoặc rebase)</p>
<p data-start="1089" data-end="1101">📌 Mục đích:</p>
<ul data-start="1102" data-end="1164">
<li data-start="1102" data-end="1137">
<p data-start="1104" data-end="1137">Lấy <strong data-start="1108" data-end="1137">code mới nhất của cả nhóm</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start="1138" data-end="1164">
<p data-start="1140" data-end="1164">Tránh conflict khi merge</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="1166" data-end="1169">
<h2 data-start="1171" data-end="1202">🔁 Quy trình chuẩn (tóm gọn)</h2>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="1204" data-end="1447"><div class="contain-inline-size rounded-2xl corner-superellipse/1.1 relative bg-token-sidebar-surface-primary"><div class="flex items-center text-token-text-secondary px-4 py-2 text-xs font-sans justify-between h-9 bg-token-sidebar-surface-primary select-none rounded-t-2xl corner-t-superellipse/1.1">bash</div><div class="sticky top-[calc(var(--sticky-padding-top)+9*var(--spacing))]"><div class="absolute end-0 bottom-0 flex h-9 items-center pe-2"><div class="bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary text-token-text-secondary flex items-center gap-4 rounded-sm px-2 font-sans text-xs"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none py-1" aria-label="Sao chép"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-j9921kii.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg>Sao chép mã</button></div></div></div><div class="overflow-y-auto p-4" dir="ltr"><code class="whitespace-pre! language-bash"><span><span>git </span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">clone</span></span><span> &lt;repo&gt;
git checkout -b ten_nhanh_cua_ban

</span><span><span class="hljs-comment"># mỗi lần làm</span></span><span>
git checkout main
git pull origin main
git checkout ten_nhanh_cua_ban
git merge main

</span><span><span class="hljs-comment"># code xong</span></span><span>
git add .
git commit -m </span><span><span class="hljs-string">"message"</span></span><span>
git push origin ten_nhanh_cua_ban
</span></span></code></div></div></pre>
<p data-start="1449" data-end="1490">👉 Sau đó tạo <strong data-start="1463" data-end="1479">Pull Request</strong> lên <code data-start="1484" data-end="1490">main</code></p>
<hr data-start="1492" data-end="1495">
<h2 data-start="1497" data-end="1515">✅ Nói ngắn gọn:</h2>
<blockquote data-start="1516" data-end="1582">
<p data-start="1518" data-end="1582"><strong data-start="1518" data-end="1582">Mỗi người 1 nhánh → main là nơi an toàn → merge có kiểm soát</strong></p>
</blockquote>
<p data-start="1584" data-end="1610">Nếu bạn muốn, mình có thể:</p>
<ul data-start="1611" data-end="1725">
<li data-start="1611" data-end="1675">
<p data-start="1613" data-end="1675">Viết lại đoạn này <strong data-start="1631" data-end="1675">cho chuyên nghiệp hơn để gửi cho cả nhóm</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start="1676" data-end="1725">
<p data-start="1678" data-end="1725">Hoặc vẽ <strong data-start="1686" data-end="1725">sơ đồ Git flow dễ nhớ cho sinh viên</strong></p>
</li>
</ul>
