<hr data-start="106" data-end="109">
<h2 data-start="111" data-end="134">🔍 Vấn đề nằm ở đâu?</h2>
<p data-start="136" data-end="154">Danh sách của bạn:</p>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="155" data-end="235"><div class="contain-inline-size rounded-2xl corner-superellipse/1.1 relative bg-token-sidebar-surface-primary"><div class="flex items-center text-token-text-secondary px-4 py-2 text-xs font-sans justify-between h-9 bg-token-sidebar-surface-primary select-none rounded-t-2xl corner-t-superellipse/1.1">arduino</div><div class="sticky top-[calc(var(--sticky-padding-top)+9*var(--spacing))]"><div class="absolute end-0 bottom-0 flex h-9 items-center pe-2"><div class="bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary text-token-text-secondary flex items-center gap-4 rounded-sm px-2 font-sans text-xs"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none py-1" aria-label="Sao chép"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-j9921kii.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg>Sao chép mã</button></div></div></div><div class="overflow-y-auto p-4" dir="ltr"><code class="whitespace-pre!"><span><span>node_modules
</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">public</span></span><span>
src
.gitignore
package.json
README.md
vite.config.js
</span></span></code></div></div></pre>
<p data-start="237" data-end="269">👉 <strong data-start="240" data-end="269">KHÔNG thấy thư mục <code data-start="261" data-end="267">.git</code></strong></p>
<p data-start="271" data-end="281">Trong khi:</p>
<ul data-start="282" data-end="384">
<li data-start="282" data-end="312">
<p data-start="284" data-end="312"><code data-start="284" data-end="296">.gitignore</code> chỉ là <strong data-start="304" data-end="312">file</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start="313" data-end="384">
<p data-start="315" data-end="384"><code data-start="315" data-end="321">.git</code> mới là <strong data-start="329" data-end="384">thứ quyết định đây có phải Git repository hay không</strong></p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="386" data-end="404">➡️ Vì vậy Git báo:</p>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="405" data-end="440"><div class="contain-inline-size rounded-2xl corner-superellipse/1.1 relative bg-token-sidebar-surface-primary"><div class="flex items-center text-token-text-secondary px-4 py-2 text-xs font-sans justify-between h-9 bg-token-sidebar-surface-primary select-none rounded-t-2xl corner-t-superellipse/1.1">makefile</div><div class="sticky top-[calc(var(--sticky-padding-top)+9*var(--spacing))]"><div class="absolute end-0 bottom-0 flex h-9 items-center pe-2"><div class="bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary text-token-text-secondary flex items-center gap-4 rounded-sm px-2 font-sans text-xs"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none py-1" aria-label="Sao chép"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-j9921kii.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg>Sao chép mã</button></div></div></div><div class="overflow-y-auto p-4" dir="ltr"><code class="whitespace-pre!"><span><span><span class="hljs-section">fatal: not a git repository</span></span><span>
</span></span></code></div></div></pre>
<hr data-start="442" data-end="445">
<h2 data-start="447" data-end="482">🧠 Vì sao lại không thấy <code data-start="475" data-end="481">.git</code>?</h2>
<p data-start="484" data-end="517">Có <strong data-start="487" data-end="516">2 khả năng rất thường gặp</strong>:</p>
<hr data-start="519" data-end="522">
<h3 data-start="524" data-end="579">✅ Khả năng 1 (hay gặp nhất): <code data-start="557" data-end="563">.git</code> bị ẩn (Windows)</h3>
<p data-start="581" data-end="619">Windows <strong data-start="589" data-end="618">mặc định ẩn folder <code data-start="610" data-end="616">.git</code></strong>.</p>
<p data-start="621" data-end="664">👉 Chạy lệnh này để kiểm tra <strong data-start="650" data-end="663">đúng 100%</strong>:</p>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="665" data-end="687"><div class="contain-inline-size rounded-2xl corner-superellipse/1.1 relative bg-token-sidebar-surface-primary"><div class="flex items-center text-token-text-secondary px-4 py-2 text-xs font-sans justify-between h-9 bg-token-sidebar-surface-primary select-none rounded-t-2xl corner-t-superellipse/1.1">bash</div><div class="sticky top-[calc(var(--sticky-padding-top)+9*var(--spacing))]"><div class="absolute end-0 bottom-0 flex h-9 items-center pe-2"><div class="bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary text-token-text-secondary flex items-center gap-4 rounded-sm px-2 font-sans text-xs"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none py-1" aria-label="Sao chép"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-j9921kii.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg>Sao chép mã</button></div></div></div><div class="overflow-y-auto p-4" dir="ltr"><code class="whitespace-pre! language-bash"><span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">dir</span></span><span> -Force
</span></span></code></div></div></pre>
<p data-start="689" data-end="698">Nếu thấy:</p>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="699" data-end="711"><div class="contain-inline-size rounded-2xl corner-superellipse/1.1 relative bg-token-sidebar-surface-primary"><div class="flex items-center text-token-text-secondary px-4 py-2 text-xs font-sans justify-between h-9 bg-token-sidebar-surface-primary select-none rounded-t-2xl corner-t-superellipse/1.1"></div><div class="sticky top-[calc(var(--sticky-padding-top)+9*var(--spacing))]"><div class="absolute end-0 bottom-0 flex h-9 items-center pe-2"><div class="bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary text-token-text-secondary flex items-center gap-4 rounded-sm px-2 font-sans text-xs"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none py-1" aria-label="Sao chép"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-j9921kii.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg>Sao chép mã</button></div></div></div><div class="overflow-y-auto p-4" dir="ltr"><code class="whitespace-pre!"><span><span>.git
</span></span></code></div></div></pre>
<p data-start="712" data-end="750">➡️ OK, repo vẫn còn → Git sẽ chạy được</p>
<p data-start="752" data-end="767">Sau đó thử lại:</p>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="768" data-end="804"><div class="contain-inline-size rounded-2xl corner-superellipse/1.1 relative bg-token-sidebar-surface-primary"><div class="flex items-center text-token-text-secondary px-4 py-2 text-xs font-sans justify-between h-9 bg-token-sidebar-surface-primary select-none rounded-t-2xl corner-t-superellipse/1.1">bash</div><div class="sticky top-[calc(var(--sticky-padding-top)+9*var(--spacing))]"><div class="absolute end-0 bottom-0 flex h-9 items-center pe-2"><div class="bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary text-token-text-secondary flex items-center gap-4 rounded-sm px-2 font-sans text-xs"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none py-1" aria-label="Sao chép"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-j9921kii.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg>Sao chép mã</button></div></div></div><div class="overflow-y-auto p-4" dir="ltr"><code class="whitespace-pre! language-bash"><span><span>git status
git branch -a
</span></span></code></div></div></pre>
<hr data-start="806" data-end="809">
<h3 data-start="811" data-end="867">❌ Khả năng 2: Thư mục này KHÔNG phải clone từ GitHub</h3>
<p data-start="869" data-end="876">Tức là:</p>
<ul data-start="877" data-end="950">
<li data-start="877" data-end="899">
<p data-start="879" data-end="899">Bạn <strong data-start="883" data-end="899">copy project</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start="900" data-end="923">
<p data-start="902" data-end="923">Hoặc <strong data-start="907" data-end="923">tạo vite mới</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start="924" data-end="950">
<p data-start="926" data-end="950">Hoặc <strong data-start="931" data-end="950">xóa nhầm <code data-start="942" data-end="948">.git</code></strong></p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="952" data-end="1003">➡️ Khi đó thư mục này <strong data-start="974" data-end="1003">không còn liên kết GitHub</strong></p>
<hr data-start="1005" data-end="1008">
<h2 data-start="1010" data-end="1056">✅ Cách sửa NHANH &amp; CHUẨN NHẤT (khuyên dùng)</h2>
<h3 data-start="1058" data-end="1100">🔥 XÓA thư mục hiện tại (hoặc đổi tên)</h3>
<p data-start="1101" data-end="1107">Ví dụ:</p>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="1108" data-end="1155"><div class="contain-inline-size rounded-2xl corner-superellipse/1.1 relative bg-token-sidebar-surface-primary"><div class="flex items-center text-token-text-secondary px-4 py-2 text-xs font-sans justify-between h-9 bg-token-sidebar-surface-primary select-none rounded-t-2xl corner-t-superellipse/1.1">bash</div><div class="sticky top-[calc(var(--sticky-padding-top)+9*var(--spacing))]"><div class="absolute end-0 bottom-0 flex h-9 items-center pe-2"><div class="bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary text-token-text-secondary flex items-center gap-4 rounded-sm px-2 font-sans text-xs"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none py-1" aria-label="Sao chép"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-j9921kii.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg>Sao chép mã</button></div></div></div><div class="overflow-y-auto p-4" dir="ltr"><code class="whitespace-pre! language-bash"><span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">cd</span></span><span> ..
ren shoe-store shoe-store-old
</span></span></code></div></div></pre>
<hr data-start="1157" data-end="1160">
<h3 data-start="1162" data-end="1188">🔥 Clone lại từ GitHub</h3>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="1189" data-end="1267"><div class="contain-inline-size rounded-2xl corner-superellipse/1.1 relative bg-token-sidebar-surface-primary"><div class="flex items-center text-token-text-secondary px-4 py-2 text-xs font-sans justify-between h-9 bg-token-sidebar-surface-primary select-none rounded-t-2xl corner-t-superellipse/1.1">bash</div><div class="sticky top-[calc(var(--sticky-padding-top)+9*var(--spacing))]"><div class="absolute end-0 bottom-0 flex h-9 items-center pe-2"><div class="bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary text-token-text-secondary flex items-center gap-4 rounded-sm px-2 font-sans text-xs"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none py-1" aria-label="Sao chép"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-j9921kii.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg>Sao chép mã</button></div></div></div><div class="overflow-y-auto p-4" dir="ltr"><code class="whitespace-pre! language-bash"><span><span>git </span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">clone</span></span><span> https://github.com/lttboy25/shoe-store.git
</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">cd</span></span><span> shoe-store
</span></span></code></div></div></pre>
<hr data-start="1269" data-end="1272">
<h3 data-start="1274" data-end="1289">🔥 Kiểm tra</h3>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="1290" data-end="1312"><div class="contain-inline-size rounded-2xl corner-superellipse/1.1 relative bg-token-sidebar-surface-primary"><div class="flex items-center text-token-text-secondary px-4 py-2 text-xs font-sans justify-between h-9 bg-token-sidebar-surface-primary select-none rounded-t-2xl corner-t-superellipse/1.1">bash</div><div class="sticky top-[calc(var(--sticky-padding-top)+9*var(--spacing))]"><div class="absolute end-0 bottom-0 flex h-9 items-center pe-2"><div class="bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary text-token-text-secondary flex items-center gap-4 rounded-sm px-2 font-sans text-xs"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none py-1" aria-label="Sao chép"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-j9921kii.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg>Sao chép mã</button></div></div></div><div class="overflow-y-auto p-4" dir="ltr"><code class="whitespace-pre! language-bash"><span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">dir</span></span><span> -Force
</span></span></code></div></div></pre>
<p data-start="1313" data-end="1326">👉 Phải thấy:</p>
