<hr data-start="511" data-end="514">
<h2 data-start="516" data-end="558">🔹 BƯỚC 3: Pull code mới nhất từ <code data-start="552" data-end="558">main</code></h2>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="559" data-end="591"><div class="contain-inline-size rounded-2xl corner-superellipse/1.1 relative bg-token-sidebar-surface-primary"><div class="flex items-center text-token-text-secondary px-4 py-2 text-xs font-sans justify-between h-9 bg-token-sidebar-surface-primary select-none rounded-t-2xl corner-t-superellipse/1.1">bash</div><div class="sticky top-[calc(var(--sticky-padding-top)+9*var(--spacing))]"><div class="absolute end-0 bottom-0 flex h-9 items-center pe-2"><div class="bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary text-token-text-secondary flex items-center gap-4 rounded-sm px-2 font-sans text-xs"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none py-1" aria-label="Sao chép"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-j9921kii.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg>Sao chép mã</button></div></div></div><div class="overflow-y-auto p-4" dir="ltr"><code class="whitespace-pre! language-bash"><span><span>git pull origin main
</span></span></code></div></div></pre>
<p data-start="593" data-end="614">👉 Lệnh này có nghĩa:</p>
<blockquote data-start="615" data-end="704">
<p data-start="617" data-end="704">Lấy code mới nhất của <strong data-start="639" data-end="659">main trên GitHub</strong><br data-start="659" data-end="662">
→ <strong data-start="666" data-end="681">gộp (merge)</strong> vào nhánh <code data-start="692" data-end="696">tu</code> của bạn</p>
</blockquote>
<hr data-start="706" data-end="709">
<h2 data-start="711" data-end="751">🔹 BƯỚC 4: Nếu có conflict (xung đột)</h2>
<p data-start="752" data-end="763">Git sẽ báo:</p>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="764" data-end="813"><div class="contain-inline-size rounded-2xl corner-superellipse/1.1 relative bg-token-sidebar-surface-primary"><div class="flex items-center text-token-text-secondary px-4 py-2 text-xs font-sans justify-between h-9 bg-token-sidebar-surface-primary select-none rounded-t-2xl corner-t-superellipse/1.1">css</div><div class="sticky top-[calc(var(--sticky-padding-top)+9*var(--spacing))]"><div class="absolute end-0 bottom-0 flex h-9 items-center pe-2"><div class="bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary text-token-text-secondary flex items-center gap-4 rounded-sm px-2 font-sans text-xs"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none py-1" aria-label="Sao chép"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-j9921kii.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg>Sao chép mã</button></div></div></div><div class="overflow-y-auto p-4" dir="ltr"><code class="whitespace-pre!"><span><span>CONFLICT (</span><span><span class="hljs-attribute">content</span></span><span>): Merge conflict in ...
</span></span></code></div></div></pre>
<p data-start="815" data-end="825">👉 Khi đó:</p>
<ol data-start="826" data-end="877">
<li data-start="826" data-end="848">
<p data-start="829" data-end="848">Mở file bị conflict</p>
</li>
<li data-start="849" data-end="855">
<p data-start="852" data-end="855">Sửa</p>
</li>
<li data-start="856" data-end="862">
<p data-start="859" data-end="862">Lưu</p>
</li>
<li data-start="863" data-end="877">
<p data-start="866" data-end="877">Commit lại:</p>
</li>
</ol>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="878" data-end="948"><div class="contain-inline-size rounded-2xl corner-superellipse/1.1 relative bg-token-sidebar-surface-primary"><div class="flex items-center text-token-text-secondary px-4 py-2 text-xs font-sans justify-between h-9 bg-token-sidebar-surface-primary select-none rounded-t-2xl corner-t-superellipse/1.1">bash</div><div class="sticky top-[calc(var(--sticky-padding-top)+9*var(--spacing))]"><div class="absolute end-0 bottom-0 flex h-9 items-center pe-2"><div class="bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary text-token-text-secondary flex items-center gap-4 rounded-sm px-2 font-sans text-xs"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none py-1" aria-label="Sao chép"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-j9921kii.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg>Sao chép mã</button></div></div></div><div class="overflow-y-auto p-4" dir="ltr"><code class="whitespace-pre! language-bash"><span><span>git add .
git commit -m </span><span><span class="hljs-string">"Resolve merge conflict from main"</span></span><span>
</span></span></code></div></div></pre>
<hr data-start="950" data-end="953">
<h2 data-start="955" data-end="991">🔹 BƯỚC 5: Push lại nhánh của bạn</h2>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="992" data-end="1022"><div class="contain-inline-size rounded-2xl corner-superellipse/1.1 relative bg-token-sidebar-surface-primary"><div class="flex items-center text-token-text-secondary px-4 py-2 text-xs font-sans justify-between h-9 bg-token-sidebar-surface-primary select-none rounded-t-2xl corner-t-superellipse/1.1">bash</div><div class="sticky top-[calc(var(--sticky-padding-top)+9*var(--spacing))]"><div class="absolute end-0 bottom-0 flex h-9 items-center pe-2"><div class="bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary text-token-text-secondary flex items-center gap-4 rounded-sm px-2 font-sans text-xs"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none py-1" aria-label="Sao chép"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-j9921kii.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg>Sao chép mã</button></div></div></div><div class="overflow-y-auto p-4" dir="ltr"><code class="whitespace-pre! language-bash"><span><span>git push origin tu
</span></span></code></div></div></pre>
<hr data-start="1024" data-end="1027">
<h1 data-start="1029" data-end="1066">🚀 TÓM TẮT QUY TRÌNH CHUẨN (nhớ kỹ)</h1>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="1067" data-end="1183"><div class="contain-inline-size rounded-2xl corner-superellipse/1.1 relative bg-token-sidebar-surface-primary"><div class="flex items-center text-token-text-secondary px-4 py-2 text-xs font-sans justify-between h-9 bg-token-sidebar-surface-primary select-none rounded-t-2xl corner-t-superellipse/1.1">bash</div><div class="sticky top-[calc(var(--sticky-padding-top)+9*var(--spacing))]"><div class="absolute end-0 bottom-0 flex h-9 items-center pe-2"><div class="bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary text-token-text-secondary flex items-center gap-4 rounded-sm px-2 font-sans text-xs"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none py-1" aria-label="Sao chép"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-j9921kii.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg>Sao chép mã</button></div></div></div><div class="overflow-y-auto p-4" dir="ltr"><code class="whitespace-pre! language-bash"><span><span>git checkout tu
git pull origin main
</span><span><span class="hljs-comment"># code...</span></span><span>
git add .
git commit -m </span><span><span class="hljs-string">"your message"</span></span><span>
git push origin tu
</span></span></code></div></div></pre>
<hr data-start="1185" data-end="1188">
<h2 data-start="1190" data-end="1213">❓ Câu hỏi thường gặp</h2>
<h3 data-start="1215" data-end="1262">❌ Có cần checkout sang main rồi pull không?</h3>
<p data-start="1263" data-end="1275">➡️ <strong data-start="1266" data-end="1275">KHÔNG</strong></p>
<blockquote data-start="1276" data-end="1323">
<p data-start="1278" data-end="1323">Pull trực tiếp <code data-start="1293" data-end="1299">main</code> vào nhánh mình đang làm</p>
</blockquote>
<hr data-start="1325" data-end="1328">
<h3 data-start="1330" data-end="1360">❌ Có ảnh hưởng main không?</h3>
<p data-start="1361" data-end="1373">➡️ <strong data-start="1364" data-end="1373">KHÔNG</strong></p>
<blockquote data-start="1374" data-end="1405">
<p data-start="1376" data-end="1405">main bị khóa, bạn chỉ pull về</p>
</blockquote>
<hr data-start="1407" data-end="1410">
<h2 data-start="1412" data-end="1441">📌 Lời khuyên cho làm nhóm</h2>
<p data-start="1442" data-end="1474">👉 <strong data-start="1445" data-end="1474">Mỗi lần bắt đầu làm việc:</strong></p>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="1475" data-end="1523"><div class="contain-inline-size rounded-2xl corner-superellipse/1.1 relative bg-token-sidebar-surface-primary"><div class="flex items-center text-token-text-secondary px-4 py-2 text-xs font-sans justify-between h-9 bg-token-sidebar-surface-primary select-none rounded-t-2xl corner-t-superellipse/1.1">bash</div><div class="sticky top-[calc(var(--sticky-padding-top)+9*var(--spacing))]"><div class="absolute end-0 bottom-0 flex h-9 items-center pe-2"><div class="bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary text-token-text-secondary flex items-center gap-4 rounded-sm px-2 font-sans text-xs"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none py-1" aria-label="Sao chép"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-j9921kii.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg>Sao chép mã</button></div></div></div><div class="overflow-y-auto p-4" dir="ltr"><code class="whitespace-pre! language-bash"><span><span>git checkout tu
git pull origin main
</span></span></code></div></div></pre>
<hr data-start="1525" data-end="1528">
<p data-start="1530" data-end="1556">Nếu bạn muốn, mình có thể:</p>
<ul data-start="1557" data-end="1660">
<li data-start="1557" data-end="1602">
<p data-start="1559" data-end="1602">Viết <strong data-start="1564" data-end="1602">1 ảnh sơ đồ luồng Git cho làm nhóm</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start="1603" data-end="1660">
<p data-start="1605" data-end="1660">Hoặc <strong data-start="1610" data-end="1644">1 file README.md quy trình Git</strong> để gửi cho team</p>
</li>
</ul>
