2-b888205f7694" data-testid="conversation-turn-86" data-scroll-anchor="false" data-turn="assistant"><h6 class="sr-only">ChatGPT đã nói:</h6><div class="text-base my-auto mx-auto [--thread-content-margin:--spacing(4)] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:--spacing(6)] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:--spacing(16)] px-(--thread-content-margin)"><div class="[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn" tabindex="-1"><div class="flex max-w-full flex-col grow"><div data-message-author-role="assistant" data-message-id="2f6bd43a-7769-43b0-93a2-b888205f7694" dir="auto" class="min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1" data-message-model-slug="gpt-5-2"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden first:pt-[1px]"><div class="markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full wrap-break-word light markdown-new-styling"><p data-start="0" data-end="129">Lỗi này <strong data-start="8" data-end="33">hoàn toàn bình thường</strong> khi làm Git 👍<br data-start="48" data-end="51">
Mình giải thích + cho bạn <strong data-start="77" data-end="101">3 cách xử lý an toàn</strong>, bạn chọn cách phù hợp nhé.</p>
<hr data-start="131" data-end="134">
<h2 data-start="136" data-end="152">❌ LỖI BẠN GẶP</h2>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="153" data-end="269"><div class="contain-inline-size rounded-2xl corner-superellipse/1.1 relative bg-token-sidebar-surface-primary"><div class="flex items-center text-token-text-secondary px-4 py-2 text-xs font-sans justify-between h-9 bg-token-sidebar-surface-primary select-none rounded-t-2xl corner-t-superellipse/1.1">lua</div><div class="sticky top-[calc(var(--sticky-padding-top)+9*var(--spacing))]"><div class="absolute end-0 bottom-0 flex h-9 items-center pe-2"><div class="bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary text-token-text-secondary flex items-center gap-4 rounded-sm px-2 font-sans text-xs"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none py-1" aria-label="Sao chép"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-j9921kii.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg>Sao chép mã</button></div></div></div><div class="overflow-y-auto p-4" dir="ltr"><code class="whitespace-pre!"><span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">error</span></span><span>: Your </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">local</span></span><span> changes to the following files would be overwritten by checkout:
        </span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">package</span></span><span>-lock.json
</span></span></code></div></div></pre>
<p data-start="271" data-end="283">👉 Nghĩa là:</p>
<ul data-start="284" data-end="381">
<li data-start="284" data-end="325">
<p data-start="286" data-end="325">Bạn <strong data-start="290" data-end="325">đã sửa file <code data-start="304" data-end="323">package-lock.json</code></strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start="326" data-end="381">
<p data-start="328" data-end="381">Git <strong data-start="332" data-end="358">không cho chuyển nhánh</strong> vì sợ <strong data-start="365" data-end="381">mất thay đổi</strong></p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="383" data-end="386">
<h1 data-start="388" data-end="442">✅ CÁCH 1 (KHUYÊN DÙNG) – COMMIT LẠI RỒI CHUYỂN NHÁNH</h1>
<p data-start="444" data-end="488">Dùng khi:<br>
✔️ Thay đổi này <strong data-start="470" data-end="488">không muốn mất</strong></p>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="490" data-end="588"><div class="contain-inline-size rounded-2xl corner-superellipse/1.1 relative bg-token-sidebar-surface-primary"><div class="flex items-center text-token-text-secondary px-4 py-2 text-xs font-sans justify-between h-9 bg-token-sidebar-surface-primary select-none rounded-t-2xl corner-t-superellipse/1.1">bash</div><div class="sticky top-[calc(var(--sticky-padding-top)+9*var(--spacing))]"><div class="absolute end-0 bottom-0 flex h-9 items-center pe-2"><div class="bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary text-token-text-secondary flex items-center gap-4 rounded-sm px-2 font-sans text-xs"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none py-1" aria-label="Sao chép"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-j9921kii.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg>Sao chép mã</button></div></div></div><div class="overflow-y-auto p-4" dir="ltr"><code class="whitespace-pre! language-bash"><span><span>git add package-lock.json
git commit -m </span><span><span class="hljs-string">"chore: update package-lock"</span></span><span>
git checkout tung
</span></span></code></div></div></pre>
<hr data-start="590" data-end="593">
<h1 data-start="595" data-end="637">✅ CÁCH 2 – STASH (TẠM CẤT, RẤT HAY DÙNG)</h1>
<p data-start="639" data-end="683">Dùng khi:<br>
✔️ Chưa muốn commit<br>
✔️ Chỉ sửa tạm</p>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="685" data-end="724"><div class="contain-inline-size rounded-2xl corner-superellipse/1.1 relative bg-token-sidebar-surface-primary"><div class="flex items-center text-token-text-secondary px-4 py-2 text-xs font-sans justify-between h-9 bg-token-sidebar-surface-primary select-none rounded-t-2xl corner-t-superellipse/1.1">bash</div><div class="sticky top-[calc(var(--sticky-padding-top)+9*var(--spacing))]"><div class="absolute end-0 bottom-0 flex h-9 items-center pe-2"><div class="bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary text-token-text-secondary flex items-center gap-4 rounded-sm px-2 font-sans text-xs"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none py-1" aria-label="Sao chép"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-j9921kii.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg>Sao chép mã</button></div></div></div><div class="overflow-y-auto p-4" dir="ltr"><code class="whitespace-pre! language-bash"><span><span>git stash
git checkout tung
</span></span></code></div></div></pre>
<p data-start="726" data-end="751">👉 Khi quay lại nhánh cũ:</p>
