<p data-start="88" data-end="193">👉 Nghĩa là: <strong data-start="101" data-end="153">project của bạn KHÔNG CÓ vite trong node_modules</strong><br data-start="153" data-end="156">
→ nên khi chạy <code data-start="171" data-end="184">npm run dev</code> thì báo:</p>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="194" data-end="226"><div class="contain-inline-size rounded-2xl corner-superellipse/1.1 relative bg-token-sidebar-surface-primary"><div class="flex items-center text-token-text-secondary px-4 py-2 text-xs font-sans justify-between h-9 bg-token-sidebar-surface-primary select-none rounded-t-2xl corner-t-superellipse/1.1">csharp</div><div class="sticky top-[calc(var(--sticky-padding-top)+9*var(--spacing))]"><div class="absolute end-0 bottom-0 flex h-9 items-center pe-2"><div class="bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary text-token-text-secondary flex items-center gap-4 rounded-sm px-2 font-sans text-xs"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none py-1" aria-label="Sao chép"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-j9921kii.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg>Sao chép mã</button></div></div></div><div class="overflow-y-auto p-4" dir="ltr"><code class="whitespace-pre!"><span><span><span class="hljs-string">'vite'</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">is</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">not</span></span><span> recognized
</span></span></code></div></div></pre>
<hr data-start="228" data-end="231">
<h2 data-start="233" data-end="284">✅ CÁCH SỬA ĐÚNG CHUẨN (THEO TEAM / THEO BÀI LỚN)</h2>
<h3 data-start="286" data-end="327">🔹 Bước 1: Cài lại toàn bộ dependency</h3>
<p data-start="328" data-end="365">Chạy đúng trong thư mục <code data-start="352" data-end="364">shoe-store</code>:</p>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="366" data-end="389"><div class="contain-inline-size rounded-2xl corner-superellipse/1.1 relative bg-token-sidebar-surface-primary"><div class="flex items-center text-token-text-secondary px-4 py-2 text-xs font-sans justify-between h-9 bg-token-sidebar-surface-primary select-none rounded-t-2xl corner-t-superellipse/1.1">bash</div><div class="sticky top-[calc(var(--sticky-padding-top)+9*var(--spacing))]"><div class="absolute end-0 bottom-0 flex h-9 items-center pe-2"><div class="bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary text-token-text-secondary flex items-center gap-4 rounded-sm px-2 font-sans text-xs"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none py-1" aria-label="Sao chép"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-j9921kii.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg>Sao chép mã</button></div></div></div><div class="overflow-y-auto p-4" dir="ltr"><code class="whitespace-pre! language-bash"><span><span>npm install
</span></span></code></div></div></pre>
<p data-start="391" data-end="405">⏳ Lệnh này sẽ:</p>
<ul data-start="406" data-end="488">
<li data-start="406" data-end="426">
<p data-start="408" data-end="426">Đọc <code data-start="412" data-end="426">package.json</code></p>
</li>
<li data-start="427" data-end="467">
<p data-start="429" data-end="467">Cài <strong data-start="433" data-end="467">vite + react + tất cả thư viện</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start="468" data-end="488">
<p data-start="470" data-end="488">Tạo <code data-start="474" data-end="488">node_modules</code></p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="490" data-end="493">
<h3 data-start="495" data-end="527">🔹 Bước 2: Kiểm tra lại vite</h3>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="528" data-end="553"><div class="contain-inline-size rounded-2xl corner-superellipse/1.1 relative bg-token-sidebar-surface-primary"><div class="flex items-center text-token-text-secondary px-4 py-2 text-xs font-sans justify-between h-9 bg-token-sidebar-surface-primary select-none rounded-t-2xl corner-t-superellipse/1.1">bash</div><div class="sticky top-[calc(var(--sticky-padding-top)+9*var(--spacing))]"><div class="absolute end-0 bottom-0 flex h-9 items-center pe-2"><div class="bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary text-token-text-secondary flex items-center gap-4 rounded-sm px-2 font-sans text-xs"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none py-1" aria-label="Sao chép"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-j9921kii.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg>Sao chép mã</button></div></div></div><div class="overflow-y-auto p-4" dir="ltr"><code class="whitespace-pre! language-bash"><span><span>npm list vite
</span></span></code></div></div></pre>
<p data-start="555" data-end="582">👉 Kết quả đúng phải giống:</p>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="583" data-end="605"><div class="contain-inline-size rounded-2xl corner-superellipse/1.1 relative bg-token-sidebar-surface-primary"><div class="flex items-center text-token-text-secondary px-4 py-2 text-xs font-sans justify-between h-9 bg-token-sidebar-surface-primary select-none rounded-t-2xl corner-t-superellipse/1.1">css</div><div class="sticky top-[calc(var(--sticky-padding-top)+9*var(--spacing))]"><div class="absolute end-0 bottom-0 flex h-9 items-center pe-2"><div class="bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary text-token-text-secondary flex items-center gap-4 rounded-sm px-2 font-sans text-xs"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none py-1" aria-label="Sao chép"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-j9921kii.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg>Sao chép mã</button></div></div></div><div class="overflow-y-auto p-4" dir="ltr"><code class="whitespace-pre!"><span><span>└── vite</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">@x</span></span><span>.x.x
