<hr data-start="665" data-end="668">
<h2 data-start="670" data-end="731">⚠️ NẾU <code data-start="680" data-end="693">npm install</code> XONG MÀ VẪN <code data-start="706" data-end="715">(empty)</code> (hiếm nhưng có)</h2>
<p data-start="733" data-end="788">👉 Mở <strong data-start="739" data-end="755">package.json</strong>, kiểm tra phần <code data-start="771" data-end="788">devDependencies</code></p>
<p data-start="790" data-end="803">Phải có dạng:</p>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="804" data-end="857"><div class="contain-inline-size rounded-2xl corner-superellipse/1.1 relative bg-token-sidebar-surface-primary"><div class="flex items-center text-token-text-secondary px-4 py-2 text-xs font-sans justify-between h-9 bg-token-sidebar-surface-primary select-none rounded-t-2xl corner-t-superellipse/1.1">json</div><div class="sticky top-[calc(var(--sticky-padding-top)+9*var(--spacing))]"><div class="absolute end-0 bottom-0 flex h-9 items-center pe-2"><div class="bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary text-token-text-secondary flex items-center gap-4 rounded-sm px-2 font-sans text-xs"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none py-1" aria-label="Sao chép"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-j9921kii.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg>Sao chép mã</button></div></div></div><div class="overflow-y-auto p-4" dir="ltr"><code class="whitespace-pre! language-json"><span><span><span class="hljs-attr">"devDependencies"</span></span><span><span class="hljs-punctuation">:</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-punctuation">{</span></span><span>
  </span><span><span class="hljs-attr">"vite"</span></span><span><span class="hljs-punctuation">:</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-string">"^5.x.x"</span></span><span>
</span><span><span class="hljs-punctuation">}</span></span><span>
</span></span></code></div></div></pre>
<p data-start="859" data-end="918">Nếu <strong data-start="863" data-end="880">KHÔNG CÓ vite</strong> → project này <strong data-start="895" data-end="917">chưa được cài đúng</strong>.</p>
<p data-start="920" data-end="941">👉 Cài vite thủ công:</p>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="942" data-end="973"><div class="contain-inline-size rounded-2xl corner-superellipse/1.1 relative bg-token-sidebar-surface-primary"><div class="flex items-center text-token-text-secondary px-4 py-2 text-xs font-sans justify-between h-9 bg-token-sidebar-surface-primary select-none rounded-t-2xl corner-t-superellipse/1.1">bash</div><div class="sticky top-[calc(var(--sticky-padding-top)+9*var(--spacing))]"><div class="absolute end-0 bottom-0 flex h-9 items-center pe-2"><div class="bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary text-token-text-secondary flex items-center gap-4 rounded-sm px-2 font-sans text-xs"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none py-1" aria-label="Sao chép"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-j9921kii.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg>Sao chép mã</button></div></div></div><div class="overflow-y-auto p-4" dir="ltr"><code class="whitespace-pre! language-bash"><span><span>npm install -D vite
</span></span></code></div></div></pre>
<p data-start="975" data-end="982">Sau đó:</p>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="983" data-end="1006"><div class="contain-inline-size rounded-2xl corner-superellipse/1.1 relative bg-token-sidebar-surface-primary"><div class="flex items-center text-token-text-secondary px-4 py-2 text-xs font-sans justify-between h-9 bg-token-sidebar-surface-primary select-none rounded-t-2xl corner-t-superellipse/1.1">bash</div><div class="sticky top-[calc(var(--sticky-padding-top)+9*var(--spacing))]"><div class="absolute end-0 bottom-0 flex h-9 items-center pe-2"><div class="bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary text-token-text-secondary flex items-center gap-4 rounded-sm px-2 font-sans text-xs"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none py-1" aria-label="Sao chép"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-j9921kii.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg>Sao chép mã</button></div></div></div><div class="overflow-y-auto p-4" dir="ltr"><code class="whitespace-pre! language-bash"><span><span>npm run dev
</span></span></code></div></div></pre>
<hr data-start="1008" data-end="1011">
<h2 data-start="1013" data-end="1057">🧠 Vì sao repo của bạn lại bị thiếu vite?</h2>
<p data-start="1058" data-end="1068">Có thể do:</p>
<ul data-start="1069" data-end="1183">
<li data-start="1069" data-end="1107">
<p data-start="1071" data-end="1107">Ai đó <strong data-start="1077" data-end="1107">xóa vite khỏi package.json</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start="1108" data-end="1130">
<p data-start="1110" data-end="1130">Merge nhánh bị thiếu</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1131" data-end="1183">
<p data-start="1133" data-end="1183">Project được tạo nhưng chưa push đầy đủ dependency</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="1185" data-end="1214">👉 <strong data-start="1188" data-end="1214">Không phải lỗi máy bạn</strong></p>
<hr data-start="1216" data-end="1219">
