y là <strong data-start="11" data-end="37">đúng 1 quy trình chuẩn</strong>, ngắn gọn, làm theo là <strong data-start="61" data-end="112">pull được code mới nhất từ <code data-start="90" data-end="96">main</code> về nhánh <code data-start="106" data-end="110">tu</code></strong> 👇</p>
<hr data-start="117" data-end="120">
<h2 data-start="122" data-end="163">✅ PULL CODE MỚI NHẤT TỪ <code data-start="149" data-end="155">main</code> VỀ <code data-start="159" data-end="163">tu</code></h2>
<h3 data-start="165" data-end="204">🔹 Bước 1: Vào đúng thư mục project</h3>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="205" data-end="230"><div class="contain-inline-size rounded-2xl corner-superellipse/1.1 relative bg-token-sidebar-surface-primary"><div class="flex items-center text-token-text-secondary px-4 py-2 text-xs font-sans justify-between h-9 bg-token-sidebar-surface-primary select-none rounded-t-2xl corner-t-superellipse/1.1">bash</div><div class="sticky top-[calc(var(--sticky-padding-top)+9*var(--spacing))]"><div class="absolute end-0 bottom-0 flex h-9 items-center pe-2"><div class="bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary text-token-text-secondary flex items-center gap-4 rounded-sm px-2 font-sans text-xs"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none py-1" aria-label="Sao chép"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-j9921kii.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg>Sao chép mã</button></div></div></div><div class="overflow-y-auto p-4" dir="ltr"><code class="whitespace-pre! language-bash"><span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">cd</span></span><span> shoe-store
</span></span></code></div></div></pre>
<hr data-start="232" data-end="235">
<h3 data-start="237" data-end="274">🔹 Bước 2: Chuyển sang nhánh <code data-start="270" data-end="274">tu</code></h3>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="275" data-end="302"><div class="contain-inline-size rounded-2xl corner-superellipse/1.1 relative bg-token-sidebar-surface-primary"><div class="flex items-center text-token-text-secondary px-4 py-2 text-xs font-sans justify-between h-9 bg-token-sidebar-surface-primary select-none rounded-t-2xl corner-t-superellipse/1.1">bash</div><div class="sticky top-[calc(var(--sticky-padding-top)+9*var(--spacing))]"><div class="absolute end-0 bottom-0 flex h-9 items-center pe-2"><div class="bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary text-token-text-secondary flex items-center gap-4 rounded-sm px-2 font-sans text-xs"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none py-1" aria-label="Sao chép"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-j9921kii.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg>Sao chép mã</button></div></div></div><div class="overflow-y-auto p-4" dir="ltr"><code class="whitespace-pre! language-bash"><span><span>git checkout tu
</span></span></code></div></div></pre>
<p data-start="304" data-end="313">Kiểm tra:</p>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="314" data-end="336"><div class="contain-inline-size rounded-2xl corner-superellipse/1.1 relative bg-token-sidebar-surface-primary"><div class="flex items-center text-token-text-secondary px-4 py-2 text-xs font-sans justify-between h-9 bg-token-sidebar-surface-primary select-none rounded-t-2xl corner-t-superellipse/1.1">bash</div><div class="sticky top-[calc(var(--sticky-padding-top)+9*var(--spacing))]"><div class="absolute end-0 bottom-0 flex h-9 items-center pe-2"><div class="bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary text-token-text-secondary flex items-center gap-4 rounded-sm px-2 font-sans text-xs"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none py-1" aria-label="Sao chép"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-j9921kii.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg>Sao chép mã</button></div></div></div><div class="overflow-y-auto p-4" dir="ltr"><code class="whitespace-pre! language-bash"><span><span>git branch
</span></span></code></div></div></pre>
<p data-start="337" data-end="359">➡️ thấy <code data-start="345" data-end="351">* tu</code> là đúng</p>
<hr data-start="361" data-end="364">
<h3 data-start="366" data-end="406">🔹 Bước 3: Lấy code mới nhất từ main</h3>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="407" data-end="439"><div class="contain-inline-size rounded-2xl corner-superellipse/1.1 relative bg-token-sidebar-surface-primary"><div class="flex items-center text-token-text-secondary px-4 py-2 text-xs font-sans justify-between h-9 bg-token-sidebar-surface-primary select-none rounded-t-2xl corner-t-superellipse/1.1">bash</div><div class="sticky top-[calc(var(--sticky-padding-top)+9*var(--spacing))]"><div class="absolute end-0 bottom-0 flex h-9 items-center pe-2"><div class="bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary text-token-text-secondary flex items-center gap-4 rounded-sm px-2 font-sans text-xs"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none py-1" aria-label="Sao chép"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-j9921kii.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg>Sao chép mã</button></div></div></div><div class="overflow-y-auto p-4" dir="ltr"><code class="whitespace-pre! language-bash"><span><span>git pull origin main
</span></span></code></div></div></pre>
<p data-start="441" data-end="476">👉 Lệnh này = <strong data-start="455" data-end="476">merge main vào tu</strong></p>
<hr data-start="478" data-end="481">
<h3 data-start="483" data-end="514">🔹 Bước 4 (nếu có conflict)</h3>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="515" data-end="605"><div class="contain-inline-size rounded-2xl corner-superellipse/1.1 relative bg-token-sidebar-surface-primary"><div class="flex items-center text-token-text-secondary px-4 py-2 text-xs font-sans justify-between h-9 bg-token-sidebar-surface-primary select-none rounded-t-2xl corner-t-superellipse/1.1">bash</div><div class="sticky top-[calc(var(--sticky-padding-top)+9*var(--spacing))]"><div class="absolute end-0 bottom-0 flex h-9 items-center pe-2"><div class="bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary text-token-text-secondary flex items-center gap-4 rounded-sm px-2 font-sans text-xs"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none py-1" aria-label="Sao chép"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-j9921kii.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg>Sao chép mã</button></div></div></div><div class="overflow-y-auto p-4" dir="ltr"><code class="whitespace-pre! language-bash"><span><span>git status
</span><span><span class="hljs-comment"># sửa file bị conflict</span></span><span>
git add .
git commit -m </span><span><span class="hljs-string">"Merge main into tu"</span></span><span>
</span></span></code></div></div></pre>
<hr data-start="607" data-end="610">
<h3 data-start="612" data-end="646">🔹 Bước 5: Push lại nhánh <code data-start="642" data-end="646">tu</code></h3>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="647" data-end="677"><div class="contain-inline-size rounded-2xl corner-superellipse/1.1 relative bg-token-sidebar-surface-primary"><div class="flex items-center text-token-text-secondary px-4 py-2 text-xs font-sans justify-between h-9 bg-token-sidebar-surface-primary select-none rounded-t-2xl corner-t-superellipse/1.1">bash</div><div class="sticky top-[calc(var(--sticky-padding-top)+9*var(--spacing))]"><div class="absolute end-0 bottom-0 flex h-9 items-center pe-2"><div class="bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary text-token-text-secondary flex items-center gap-4 rounded-sm px-2 font-sans text-xs"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none py-1" aria-label="Sao chép"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-j9921kii.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg>Sao chép mã</button></div></div></div><div class="overflow-y-auto p-4" dir="ltr"><code class="whitespace-pre! language-bash"><span><span>git push origin tu
</span></span></code></div></div></pre>
<hr data-start="679" data-end="682">
<h2 data-start="684" data-end="713">🔁 TÓM TẮT 1 DÒNG (NHỚ KỸ)</h2>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="714" data-end="762"><div class="contain-inline-size rounded-2xl corner-superellipse/1.1 relative bg-token-sidebar-surface-primary"><div class="flex items-center text-token-text-secondary px-4 py-2 text-xs font-sans justify-between h-9 bg-token-sidebar-surface-primary select-none rounded-t-2xl corner-t-superellipse/1.1">bash</div><div class="sticky top-[calc(var(--sticky-padding-top)+9*var(--spacing))]"><div class="absolute end-0 bottom-0 flex h-9 items-center pe-2"><div class="bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary text-token-text-secondary flex items-center gap-4 rounded-sm px-2 font-sans text-xs"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none py-1" aria-label="Sao chép"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-j9921kii.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg>Sao chép mã</button></div></div></div><div class="overflow-y-auto p-4" dir="ltr"><code class="whitespace-pre! language-bash"><span><span>git checkout tu
git pull origin main
</span></span></code></div></div></pre>
<hr data-start="764" data-end="767">
<h2 data-start="769" data-end="790">❗ LƯU Ý QUAN TRỌNG</h2>
<ul data-start="791" data-end="893">
<li data-start="791" data-end="821">
<p data-start="793" data-end="821">❌ Không checkout sang <code data-start="815" data-end="821">main</code></p>
</li>
<li data-start="822" data-end="857">
<p data-start="824" data-end="857">❌ Không push trực tiếp lên <code data-start="851" data-end="857">main</code></p>
</li>
