<h3 data-start="455" data-end="472">📌 Giải thích</h3>
<ul data-start="473" data-end="625">
<li data-start="473" data-end="518">
<p data-start="475" data-end="518"><code data-start="475" data-end="480">App</code> là <strong data-start="484" data-end="501">component gốc</strong> (root component)</p>
</li>
<li data-start="519" data-end="575">
<p data-start="521" data-end="575">Hiện tại App <strong data-start="534" data-end="575">chỉ render mỗi component <code data-start="561" data-end="573">&lt;Rating /&gt;</code></strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start="576" data-end="625">
<p data-start="578" data-end="625"><code data-start="578" data-end="585">count</code> đang <strong data-start="591" data-end="604">chưa dùng</strong> → có thể xóa cho gọn</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="627" data-end="643">👉 Với code này:</p>
<ul data-start="644" data-end="714">
<li data-start="644" data-end="679">
