</span></span></code></div></div></pre>
<h3 data-start="861" data-end="875">📌 Ý nghĩa</h3>
<ul data-start="876" data-end="985">
<li data-start="876" data-end="910">
<p data-start="878" data-end="910"><code data-start="878" data-end="885">score</code>: số sao hiện tại (0 → 5)</p>
</li>
