a1-405f-9bc3-d25ce28fb53f" data-testid="conversation-turn-110" data-scroll-anchor="false" data-turn="assistant"><h6 class="sr-only">ChatGPT đã nói:</h6><div class="text-base my-auto mx-auto [--thread-content-margin:--spacing(4)] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:--spacing(6)] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:--spacing(16)] px-(--thread-content-margin)"><div class="[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn" tabindex="-1"><div class="flex max-w-full flex-col grow"><div data-message-author-role="assistant" data-message-id="1bb060e2-b777-4920-a576-c7592fb3698c" dir="auto" class="min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1" data-message-model-slug="gpt-5-2"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden first:pt-[1px]"><div class="markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full wrap-break-word light markdown-new-styling"><p data-start="0" data-end="187">OK 👍 code của bạn <strong data-start="19" data-end="54">chạy được nhưng logic chưa đúng</strong>, nên <strong data-start="60" data-end="83">Popup sẽ không hiện</strong> và <strong data-start="87" data-end="124">Rating chưa liên kết gì với Popup</strong>. Mình chỉ ra <strong data-start="138" data-end="186">đúng chỗ sai → sửa tối thiểu → hiểu bản chất</strong>.</p>
<hr data-start="189" data-end="192">
<h2 data-start="194" data-end="230">❌ Vấn đề trong <code data-start="212" data-end="221">App.jsx</code> hiện tại</h2>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="232" data-end="276"><div class="contain-inline-size rounded-2xl corner-superellipse/1.1 relative bg-token-sidebar-surface-primary"><div class="flex items-center text-token-text-secondary px-4 py-2 text-xs font-sans justify-between h-9 bg-token-sidebar-surface-primary select-none rounded-t-2xl corner-t-superellipse/1.1">jsx</div><div class="sticky top-[calc(var(--sticky-padding-top)+9*var(--spacing))]"><div class="absolute end-0 bottom-0 flex h-9 items-center pe-2"><div class="bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary text-token-text-secondary flex items-center gap-4 rounded-sm px-2 font-sans text-xs"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none py-1" aria-label="Sao chép"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-j9921kii.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg>Sao chép mã</button></div></div></div><div class="overflow-y-auto p-4" dir="ltr"><code class="whitespace-pre! language-jsx"><span><span>&lt;</span><span><span class="hljs-title class_">Popup</span></span><span>&gt;&lt;/</span><span><span class="hljs-title class_">Popup</span></span><span>&gt;
</span><span><span class="language-xml"><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">Rating</span></span></span></span><span>&gt;</span><span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;/<span class="hljs-name">Rating</span></span></span><span>&gt;
</span></span></code></div></div></pre>
<h3 data-start="278" data-end="321">1️⃣ Popup <strong data-start="292" data-end="321">không có state điều khiển</strong></h3>
<p data-start="322" data-end="364">Popup component của bạn chắc chắn có dạng:</p>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="366" data-end="434"><div class="contain-inline-size rounded-2xl corner-superellipse/1.1 relative bg-token-sidebar-surface-primary"><div class="flex items-center text-token-text-secondary px-4 py-2 text-xs font-sans justify-between h-9 bg-token-sidebar-surface-primary select-none rounded-t-2xl corner-t-superellipse/1.1">jsx</div><div class="sticky top-[calc(var(--sticky-padding-top)+9*var(--spacing))]"><div class="absolute end-0 bottom-0 flex h-9 items-center pe-2"><div class="bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary text-token-text-secondary flex items-center gap-4 rounded-sm px-2 font-sans text-xs"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none py-1" aria-label="Sao chép"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-j9921kii.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg>Sao chép mã</button></div></div></div><div class="overflow-y-auto p-4" dir="ltr"><code class="whitespace-pre! language-jsx"><span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">const</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-title function_">Popup</span></span><span> = (</span><span><span class="hljs-params">{ open }</span></span><span>) =&gt; {
  </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">if</span></span><span> (!open) </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">return</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-literal">null</span></span><span>;
}
</span></span></code></div></div></pre>
<p data-start="436" data-end="521">👉 Bạn <strong data-start="443" data-end="466">không truyền <code data-start="458" data-end="464">open</code></strong><br data-start="466" data-end="469">
➡️ <code data-start="472" data-end="490">open = undefined</code> → popup <strong data-start="499" data-end="521">không bao giờ hiện</strong></p>
<hr data-start="523" data-end="526">
<h3 data-start="528" data-end="577">2️⃣ Rating đứng riêng → không liên quan Popup</h3>
<ul data-start="578" data-end="649">
<li data-start="578" data-end="606">
<p data-start="580" data-end="606">Click sao <strong data-start="590" data-end="606">không làm gì</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start="607" data-end="649">
<p data-start="609" data-end="649">Popup <strong data-start="615" data-end="649">không biết rating là bao nhiêu</strong></p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="651" data-end="654">
<h2 data-start="656" data-end="690">✅ Cách sửa ĐÚNG – đơn giản nhất</h2>
<h3 data-start="692" data-end="706">🎯 Ý tưởng</h3>
<ul data-start="707" data-end="762">
<li data-start="707" data-end="724">
<p data-start="709" data-end="724"><code data-start="709" data-end="714">App</code> giữ state</p>
</li>
<li data-start="725" data-end="742">
<p data-start="727" data-end="742">Button mở Popup</p>
</li>
<li data-start="743" data-end="762">
<p data-start="745" data-end="762">Popup chứa Rating</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="764" data-end="767">
<h2 data-start="769" data-end="802">🟢 App.jsx (đã sửa đúng chuẩn)</h2>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="804" data-end="1428"><div class="contain-inline-size rounded-2xl corner-superellipse/1.1 relative bg-token-sidebar-surface-primary"><div class="flex items-center text-token-text-secondary px-4 py-2 text-xs font-sans justify-between h-9 bg-token-sidebar-surface-primary select-none rounded-t-2xl corner-t-superellipse/1.1">jsx</div><div class="sticky top-[calc(var(--sticky-padding-top)+9*var(--spacing))]"><div class="absolute end-0 bottom-0 flex h-9 items-center pe-2"><div class="bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary text-token-text-secondary flex items-center gap-4 rounded-sm px-2 font-sans text-xs"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none py-1" aria-label="Sao chép"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-j9921kii.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg>Sao chép mã</button></div></div></div><div class="overflow-y-auto p-4" dir="ltr"><code class="whitespace-pre! language-jsx"><span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">import</span></span><span> { useState } </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">from</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-string">"react"</span></span><span>;
</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">import</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-title class_">Rating</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">from</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-string">"./components/common/Rating.jsx"</span></span><span>;
</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">import</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-title class_">Popup</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">from</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-string">"./components/common/Popup.jsx"</span></span><span>;
</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">import</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-string">"./App.css"</span></span><span>;

</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">function</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-title function_">App</span></span><span>(</span><span><span class="hljs-params"></span></span><span>) {
  </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">const</span></span><span> [openPopup, setOpenPopup] = </span><span><span class="hljs-title function_">useState</span></span><span>(</span><span><span class="hljs-literal">false</span></span><span>);
  </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">const</span></span><span> [rating, setRating] = </span><span><span class="hljs-title function_">useState</span></span><span>(</span><span><span class="hljs-number">0</span></span><span>);

  </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">return</span></span><span> (
    </span><span><span class="language-xml"><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;&gt;</span></span></span><span>
      </span><span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">button</span></span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-attr">onClick</span></span><span>=</span><span><span class="hljs-string">{()</span></span><span> =&gt; setOpenPopup(true)}&gt;
        Mở đánh giá
      </span><span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;/<span class="hljs-name">button</span></span></span><span>&gt;

      </span><span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">Popup</span></span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-attr">open</span></span><span>=</span><span><span class="hljs-string">{openPopup}</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-attr">onClose</span></span><span>=</span><span><span class="hljs-string">{()</span></span><span> =&gt; setOpenPopup(false)}&gt;
        </span><span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">h3</span></span></span><span>&gt;Đánh giá sản phẩm</span><span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;/<span class="hljs-name">h3</span></span></span><span>&gt;
        </span><span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">Rating</span></span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-attr">onChange</span></span><span>=</span><span><span class="hljs-string">{setRating}</span></span><span> /&gt;
        </span><span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">p</span></span></span><span>&gt;Bạn đã chọn: {rating} sao ⭐</span><span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;/<span class="hljs-name">p</span></span></span><span>&gt;
      </span><span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;/<span class="hljs-name">Popup</span></span></span><span>&gt;
    </span><span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;/&gt;</span></span><span>
  );
}

</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">export</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">default</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-title class_">App</span></span><span>;
</span></span></code></div></div></pre>
<hr data-start="1430" data-end="1433">
<h2 data-start="1435" data-end="1480">🧠 Hiểu nhanh (rất quan trọng cho bài lớn)</h2>
<div class="TyagGW_tableContainer"><div tabindex="-1" class="group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit"><table data-start="1482" data-end="1623" class="w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)"><thead data-start="1482" data-end="1506"><tr data-start="1482" data-end="1506"><th data-start="1482" data-end="1495" data-col-size="sm" class="">Thành phần</th><th data-start="1495" data-end="1506" data-col-size="sm" class="">Vai trò</th></tr></thead><tbody data-start="1529" data-end="1623"><tr data-start="1529" data-end="1563"><td data-start="1529" data-end="1537" data-col-size="sm"><code data-start="1531" data-end="1536">App</code></td><td data-start="1537" data-end="1563" data-col-size="sm">Giữ state &amp; điều khiển</td></tr><tr data-start="1564" data-end="1590"><td data-start="1564" data-end="1574" data-col-size="sm"><code data-start="1566" data-end="1573">Popup</code></td><td data-start="1574" data-end="1590" data-col-size="sm">Chỉ hiển thị</td></tr><tr data-start="1591" data-end="1623"><td data-start="1591" data-end="1602" data-col-size="sm"><code data-start="1593" data-end="1601">Rating</code></td><td data-start="1602" data-end="1623" data-col-size="sm">Phát sinh dữ liệu</td></tr></tbody></table><div class="sticky h-0 select-none end-(--thread-content-margin) self-end"><div class="absolute end-0 flex items-end" style="height: 33.1562px;"><span class="" data-state="closed"><button aria-label="Sao chép bảng" class="hover:bg-token-bg-tertiary text-token-text-secondary my-1 rounded-sm p-1 transition-opacity group-[:not(:hover):not(:focus-within)]:pointer-events-none group-[:not(:hover):not(:focus-within)]:opacity-0"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-j9921kii.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></span></div></div></div></div>
<p data-start="1625" data-end="1674">👉 <strong data-start="1628" data-end="1674">Component con KHÔNG tự quyết định hiển thị</strong></p>
