<h2 data-start="1681" data-end="1712">✅ Checklist đúng chuẩn React</h2>
<p data-start="1713" data-end="1831">✔ Không render logic trong <code data-start="1740" data-end="1750">main.jsx</code><br data-start="1750" data-end="1753">
