<hr data-start="99" data-end="102">
<h2 data-start="104" data-end="132">❌ NGUYÊN NHÂN CHÍNH (99%)</h2>
<p data-start="134" data-end="222">👉 <strong data-start="137" data-end="194">Popup của bạn đang <code data-start="158" data-end="171">return null</code> hoặc <code data-start="177" data-end="192">display: none</code></strong>, nên <strong data-start="200" data-end="222">KHÔNG render gì cả</strong></p>
<p data-start="224" data-end="237">Bạn đang gọi:</p>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="239" data-end="274"><div class="contain-inline-size rounded-2xl corner-superellipse/1.1 relative bg-token-sidebar-surface-primary"><div class="flex items-center text-token-text-secondary px-4 py-2 text-xs font-sans justify-between h-9 bg-token-sidebar-surface-primary select-none rounded-t-2xl corner-t-superellipse/1.1">jsx</div><div class="sticky top-[calc(var(--sticky-padding-top)+9*var(--spacing))]"><div class="absolute end-0 bottom-0 flex h-9 items-center pe-2"><div class="bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary text-token-text-secondary flex items-center gap-4 rounded-sm px-2 font-sans text-xs"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none py-1" aria-label="Sao chép"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-j9921kii.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg>Sao chép mã</button></div></div></div><div class="overflow-y-auto p-4" dir="ltr"><code class="whitespace-pre! language-jsx"><span><span>&lt;</span><span><span class="hljs-title class_">Popup</span></span><span> open={openPopup}&gt;
</span></span></code></div></div></pre>
<p data-start="276" data-end="362">nhưng <strong data-start="282" data-end="318">Popup.jsx chưa xử lý đúng <code data-start="310" data-end="316">open</code></strong><br data-start="318" data-end="321">
➡️ React render <strong data-start="337" data-end="362">rỗng → màn hình trắng</strong></p>
<hr data-start="364" data-end="367">
<h2 data-start="369" data-end="414">✅ CÁCH SỬA CHẮC CHẮN HIỆN (Copy dùng luôn)</h2>
<h3 data-start="416" data-end="452">📁 <code data-start="423" data-end="452">components/common/Popup.jsx</code></h3>
