<p data-start="264" data-end="379">👉 <strong data-start="267" data-end="329">Bạn import 2 file khác nhau nhưng dùng CÙNG TÊN <code data-start="317" data-end="327">cartIcon</code></strong><br data-start="329" data-end="332">
