</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="1501" data-end="1538" data-is-last-node="" data-is-only-node="">👉 nói tiếp, mình làm cho bạn luôn 👌</p></div></div></div></div><div class="z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start"><div class="touch:-me-2 touch:-ms-3.5 -ms-2.5 -me-1 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-y-4 p-1 select-none touch:w-[calc(100%+--spacing(3.5))] -mt-1 w-[calc(100%+--spacing(2.5))] duration-[1.5s] focus-within:transition-none hover:transition-none touch:pointer-events-auto pointer-events-none [mask-image:linear-gradient(to_right,black_33%,transparent_66%)] [mask-size:300%_100%] [mask-position:100%_0%] motion-safe:transition-[mask-position] group-hover/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-hover/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] group-focus-within/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-focus-within/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] has-data-[state=open]:pointer-events-auto has-data-[state=open]:[mask-position:0_0]" style="mask-position: 0% 0%;"><button class="text-token-text-secondary hover:bg-token-bg-secondary rounded-lg" aria-label="Sao chép" aria-pressed="false" data-testid="copy-turn-action-button" data-state="closed"><span class="flex items-center justify-center touch:w-10 h-8 w-8"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-j9921kii.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></span></button><button class="text-token-text-secondary hover:bg-token-bg-secondary rounded-lg" aria-label="Phản hồi tốt" aria-pressed="false" data-testid="good-response-turn-action-button" data-state="closed"><span class="flex items-center justify-center touch:w-10 h-8 w-8"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-j9921kii.svg#51753c" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></span></button><button class="text-token-text-secondary hover:bg-token-bg-secondary rounded-lg" aria-label="Phản hồi không tốt" aria-pressed="false" data-testid="bad-response-turn-action-button" data-state="closed"><span class="flex items-center justify-center touch:w-10 h-8 w-8"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-j9921kii.svg#2126ae" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></span></button><button class="text-token-text-secondary hover:bg-token-bg-secondary rounded-lg" aria-label="Chia sẻ" aria-pressed="false" data-state="closed"><span class="flex items-center justify-center touch:w-10 h-8 w-8"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-j9921kii.svg#630ca2" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></span></button><button class="text-token-text-secondary hover:bg-token-bg-secondary touch:w-10 flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center rounded-lg" aria-label="Hành động khác" type="button" id="radix-_r_155_" aria-haspopup="menu" aria-expanded="false" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-j9921kii.svg#f6d0e2" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div></div></div></div><br class="sr-only"></article><article class="text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none [--shadow-height:45px] has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none has-data-writing-block:-mt-(--shadow-height) has-data-writing-block:pt-(--shadow-height) [&amp;:has([data-writing-block])&gt;*]:pointer-events-auto scroll-mt-(--header-height)" tabindex="-1" dir="auto" data-turn-id="f5d62203-f483-405d-bd4f-8383ef161ee6" data-testid="conversation-turn-139" data-scroll-anchor="false" data-turn="user"><h5 class="sr-only">Bạn đã nói:</h5><div class="text-base my-auto mx-auto pt-12 [--thread-content-margin:--spacing(4)] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:--spacing(6)] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:--spacing(16)] px-(--thread-content-margin)"><div class="[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col" tabindex="-1"><div class="flex max-w-full flex-col grow"><div data-message-author-role="user" data-message-id="f5d62203-f483-405d-bd4f-8383ef161ee6" dir="auto" class="min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden items-end rtl:items-start"><div class="user-message-bubble-color corner-superellipse/1.1 relative rounded-[18px] px-4 py-1.5 data-[multiline]:py-3 max-w-[var(--user-chat-width,70%)]" data-multiline=""><div class="whitespace-pre-wrap">import { useState } from "react";
import Popup from "../common/Popup";
import cartIcon from "../../assets/icon/shopping-cart.png";
import userIcon from "../../assets/icon/user.png";

function CartIcon() {
  const [count, setCount] = useState(1);

  return (
    &lt;div style={{ position: "relative", width: 40 }}&gt;
      &lt;img
        src={cartIcon}
        alt="cart"
        style={{ width: 25, height: 25 }}
      /&gt;
      &lt;img
        src={userIcon}
        alt="user"
        style={{ width: 25, height: 25 }}
      /&gt;
      &lt;Popup count={count} /&gt;

      &lt;button onClick={() =&gt; setCount(count + 1)}&gt;
        Thêm
      &lt;/button&gt;
    &lt;/div&gt;
  );
}

export default CartIcon;</div></div></div></div></div><div class="z-0 flex justify-end"><div class="touch:-me-2 touch:-ms-3.5 -ms-2.5 -me-1 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-y-4 p-1 select-none focus-within:transition-none hover:transition-none touch:pointer-events-auto touch:opacity-100 duration-300 group-hover/turn-messages:delay-300 pointer-events-none opacity-0 motion-safe:transition-opacity group-hover/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-hover/turn-messages:opacity-100 group-focus-within/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-focus-within/turn-messages:opacity-100 has-data-[state=open]:pointer-events-auto has-data-[state=open]:opacity-100" style="mask-position: 0% 0%;"><button class="text-token-text-secondary hover:bg-token-bg-secondary rounded-lg" aria-label="Sao chép" aria-pressed="false" data-testid="copy-turn-action-button" data-state="closed"><span class="flex items-center justify-center touch:w-10 h-8 w-8"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-j9921kii.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></span></button><button class="text-token-text-secondary hover:bg-token-bg-secondary rounded-lg" aria-label="Chỉnh sửa tin nhắn" aria-pressed="false" data-state="closed"><span class="flex items-center justify-center touch:w-10 h-8 w-8"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-j9921kii.svg#6d87e1" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></span></button></div></div></div></div><br class="sr-only"></article><article class="text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none [--shadow-height:45px] has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none has-data-writing-block:-mt-(--shadow-height) has-data-writing-block:pt-(--shadow-height) [&amp;:has([data-writing-block])&gt;*]:pointer-events-auto scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]" tabindex="-1" dir="auto" data-turn-id="240e467b-110d-475c-a12d-b83a184ef924" data-testid="conversation-turn-140" data-scroll-anchor="false" data-turn="assistant"><h6 class="sr-only">ChatGPT đã nói:</h6><div class="text-base my-auto mx-auto [--thread-content-margin:--spacing(4)] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:--spacing(6)] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:--spacing(16)] px-(--thread-content-margin)"><div class="[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn" tabindex="-1"><div class="flex max-w-full flex-col grow"><div data-message-author-role="assistant" data-message-id="240e467b-110d-475c-a12d-b83a184ef924" dir="auto" class="min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1" data-message-model-slug="gpt-5-2"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden first:pt-[1px]"><div class="markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full wrap-break-word light markdown-new-styling"><p data-start="0" data-end="152">Code của bạn <strong data-start="13" data-end="26">chạy được</strong>, không sai cú pháp 👍<br data-start="48" data-end="51">
Nhưng <strong data-start="57" data-end="96">UI hiện tại chưa đúng ý nghĩa Popup</strong>, nên mình giải thích rõ <strong data-start="121" data-end="151">vấn đề + cách làm đúng hơn</strong>.</p>
<hr data-start="154" data-end="157">
<h2 data-start="159" data-end="180">🧠 VẤN ĐỀ HIỆN TẠI</h2>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="182" data-end="325"><div class="contain-inline-size rounded-2xl corner-superellipse/1.1 relative bg-token-sidebar-surface-primary"><div class="flex items-center text-token-text-secondary px-4 py-2 text-xs font-sans justify-between h-9 bg-token-sidebar-surface-primary select-none rounded-t-2xl corner-t-superellipse/1.1">jsx</div><div class="sticky top-[calc(var(--sticky-padding-top)+9*var(--spacing))]"><div class="absolute end-0 bottom-0 flex h-9 items-center pe-2"><div class="bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary text-token-text-secondary flex items-center gap-4 rounded-sm px-2 font-sans text-xs"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none py-1" aria-label="Sao chép"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-j9921kii.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg>Sao chép mã</button></div></div></div><div class="overflow-y-auto p-4" dir="ltr"><code class="whitespace-pre! language-jsx"><span><span>&lt;div style={{ </span><span><span class="hljs-attr">position</span></span><span>: </span><span><span class="hljs-string">"relative"</span></span><span>, </span><span><span class="hljs-attr">width</span></span><span>: </span><span><span class="hljs-number">40</span></span><span> }}&gt;
  </span><span><span class="language-xml"><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">img</span></span></span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-attr">src</span></span><span>=</span><span><span class="hljs-string">{cartIcon}</span></span><span> /&gt;
  </span><span><span class="language-xml"><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">img</span></span></span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-attr">src</span></span><span>=</span><span><span class="hljs-string">{userIcon}</span></span><span> /&gt;
  </span><span><span class="language-xml"><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">Popup</span></span></span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-attr">count</span></span><span>=</span><span><span class="hljs-string">{count}</span></span><span> /&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
</span></span></code></div></div></pre>
<p data-start="327" data-end="356">👉 <strong data-start="330" data-end="348">Popup chỉ có 1</strong>, nhưng:</p>
<ul data-start="357" data-end="464">
<li data-start="357" data-end="372">
<p data-start="359" data-end="372">Có <strong data-start="362" data-end="372">2 icon</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start="373" data-end="415">
<p data-start="375" data-end="415">Popup <strong data-start="381" data-end="415">không biết nó gắn cho icon nào</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start="416" data-end="464">
<p data-start="418" data-end="464">Thường nó sẽ <strong data-start="431" data-end="464">đè lung tung / không đúng góc</strong></p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="466" data-end="469">
<h2 data-start="471" data-end="518">❗ Popup (badge) LUÔN gắn với 1 icon cụ thể</h2>
<p data-start="519" data-end="528">👉 Ví dụ:</p>
<ul data-start="529" data-end="597">
<li data-start="529" data-end="556">
<p data-start="531" data-end="556">Badge giỏ hàng → gắn cart</p>
</li>
<li data-start="557" data-end="597">
<p data-start="559" data-end="597">User icon → thường <strong data-start="578" data-end="597">không cần badge</strong></p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="599" data-end="602">
<h2 data-start="604" data-end="642">✅ CÁCH LÀM ĐÚNG (RÕ RÀNG – DỄ HIỂU)</h2>
<h3 data-start="644" data-end="682">🎯 Badge CHỈ gắn với icon giỏ hàng</h3>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="684" data-end="1521"><div class="contain-inline-size rounded-2xl corner-superellipse/1.1 relative bg-token-sidebar-surface-primary"><div class="flex items-center text-token-text-secondary px-4 py-2 text-xs font-sans justify-between h-9 bg-token-sidebar-surface-primary select-none rounded-t-2xl corner-t-superellipse/1.1">jsx</div><div class="sticky top-[calc(var(--sticky-padding-top)+9*var(--spacing))]"><div class="absolute end-0 bottom-0 flex h-9 items-center pe-2"><div class="bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary text-token-text-secondary flex items-center gap-4 rounded-sm px-2 font-sans text-xs"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none py-1" aria-label="Sao chép"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-j9921kii.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg>Sao chép mã</button></div></div></div><div class="overflow-y-auto p-4" dir="ltr"><code class="whitespace-pre! language-jsx"><span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">import</span></span><span> { useState } </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">from</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-string">"react"</span></span><span>;
</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">import</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-title class_">Popup</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">from</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-string">"../common/Popup"</span></span><span>;
</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">import</span></span><span> cartIcon </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">from</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-string">"../../assets/icon/shopping-cart.png"</span></span><span>;
</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">import</span></span><span> userIcon </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">from</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-string">"../../assets/icon/user.png"</span></span><span>;

</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">function</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-title function_">CartIcon</span></span><span>(</span><span><span class="hljs-params"></span></span><span>) {
  </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">const</span></span><span> [count, setCount] = </span><span><span class="hljs-title function_">useState</span></span><span>(</span><span><span class="hljs-number">1</span></span><span>);

  </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">return</span></span><span> (
    </span><span><span class="language-xml"><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">div</span></span></span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-attr">style</span></span><span>=</span><span><span class="hljs-string">{{</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-attr">display:</span></span><span> "</span><span><span class="hljs-attr">flex</span></span><span>", </span><span><span class="hljs-attr">gap:</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-attr">12</span></span><span> }}&gt;
      
      {/* Cart icon + badge */}
      </span><span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">div</span></span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-attr">style</span></span><span>=</span><span><span class="hljs-string">{{</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-attr">position:</span></span><span> "</span><span><span class="hljs-attr">relative</span></span><span>", </span><span><span class="hljs-attr">width:</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-attr">25</span></span><span> }}&gt;
        </span><span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">img</span></span></span><span>
          </span><span><span class="hljs-attr">src</span></span><span>=</span><span><span class="hljs-string">{cartIcon}</span></span><span>
          </span><span><span class="hljs-attr">alt</span></span><span>=</span><span><span class="hljs-string">"cart"</span></span><span>
          </span><span><span class="hljs-attr">style</span></span><span>=</span><span><span class="hljs-string">{{</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-attr">width:</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-attr">25</span></span><span>, </span><span><span class="hljs-attr">height:</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-attr">25</span></span><span> }}
        /&gt;
        </span><span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">Popup</span></span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-attr">count</span></span><span>=</span><span><span class="hljs-string">{count}</span></span><span> /&gt;
      </span><span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;/<span class="hljs-name">div</span></span></span><span>&gt;

      {/* User icon (không badge) */}
      </span><span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">img</span></span></span><span>
        </span><span><span class="hljs-attr">src</span></span><span>=</span><span><span class="hljs-string">{userIcon}</span></span><span>
        </span><span><span class="hljs-attr">alt</span></span><span>=</span><span><span class="hljs-string">"user"</span></span><span>
        </span><span><span class="hljs-attr">style</span></span><span>=</span><span><span class="hljs-string">{{</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-attr">width:</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-attr">25</span></span><span>, </span><span><span class="hljs-attr">height:</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-attr">25</span></span><span> }}
      /&gt;

      </span><span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">button</span></span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-attr">onClick</span></span><span>=</span><span><span class="hljs-string">{()</span></span><span> =&gt; setCount(count + 1)}&gt;
        Thêm
      </span><span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;/<span class="hljs-name">button</span></span></span><span>&gt;
    </span><span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;/<span class="hljs-name">div</span></span></span><span>&gt;
  );
}

</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">export</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">default</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-title class_">CartIcon</span></span><span>;
</span></span></code></div></div></pre>
<hr data-start="1523" data-end="1526">
<h2 data-start="1528" data-end="1541">🎯 KẾT QUẢ</h2>
<ul data-start="1542" data-end="1662">
<li data-start="1542" data-end="1583">
<p data-start="1544" data-end="1583">🔴 Badge nằm <strong data-start="1557" data-end="1583">đúng góc icon giỏ hàng</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start="1584" data-end="1624">
<p data-start="1586" data-end="1624">👤 User icon sạch, không bị dính Popup</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1625" data-end="1662">
<p data-start="1627" data-end="1662">UI rõ ràng, đúng logic web bán giày</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="1664" data-end="1667">
<h2 data-start="1669" data-end="1696">🧠 TẠI SAO PHẢI LÀM VẬY?</h2>
<blockquote data-start="1697" data-end="1793">
<p data-start="1699" data-end="1793"><strong data-start="1699" data-end="1737">Popup phụ thuộc position: absolute</strong><br data-start="1737" data-end="1740">
→ Nó luôn bám vào <strong data-start="1758" data-end="1793">thẻ cha có <code data-start="1771" data-end="1791">position: relative</code></strong></p>
</blockquote>
<hr data-start="1795" data-end="1798">
<h2 data-start="1800" data-end="1825">🔥 TIP CHUẨN DỰ ÁN LỚN</h2>
<p data-start="1826" data-end="1842">Sau này bạn nên:</p>
<ul data-start="1843" data-end="1934">
<li data-start="1843" data-end="1869">
<p data-start="1845" data-end="1869">Cart badge → <code data-start="1858" data-end="1869">CartBadge</code></p>
</li>
<li data-start="1870" data-end="1894">
<p data-start="1872" data-end="1894">User icon → <code data-start="1884" data-end="1894">UserMenu</code></p>
</li>
<li data-start="1895" data-end="1934">
<p data-start="1897" data-end="1934">Không dùng chung popup cho nhiều icon</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="1936" data-end="1939">
<h2 data-start="1941" data-end="1953">✅ TÓM TẮT</h2>
<p data-start="1954" data-end="2064">✔ Code bạn <strong data-start="1965" data-end="1978">không sai</strong><br data-start="1978" data-end="1981">
✔ Nhưng <strong data-start="1989" data-end="2027">cách đặt Popup chưa đúng ngữ nghĩa</strong><br data-start="2027" data-end="2030">
✔ Mỗi icon cần <strong data-start="2045" data-end="2064">container riêng</strong></p>
<p data-start="2066" data-end="2087">Nếu bạn muốn 👉 mình:</p>
<ul data-start="2088" data-end="2176">
<li data-start="2088" data-end="2114">
<p data-start="2090" data-end="2114">tách luôn <code data-start="2100" data-end="2108">Header</code> chuẩn</p>
</li>
<li data-start="2115" data-end="2139">
<p data-start="2117" data-end="2139">hoặc làm dropdown user</p>
</li>
<li data-start="2140" data-end="2176">
<p data-start="2142" data-end="2176">hoặc nối badge với giỏ hàng thật</p>
</li>
</ul>
