3-4e08-a723-4f72e8c64696" data-testid="conversation-turn-148" data-scroll-anchor="false" data-turn="assistant"><h6 class="sr-only">ChatGPT đã nói:</h6><div class="text-base my-auto mx-auto [--thread-content-margin:--spacing(4)] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:--spacing(6)] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:--spacing(16)] px-(--thread-content-margin)"><div class="[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn" tabindex="-1"><div class="flex max-w-full flex-col grow"><div data-message-author-role="assistant" data-message-id="f74bdc86-73b3-4e08-a723-4f72e8c64696" dir="auto" class="min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1" data-message-model-slug="gpt-5-2"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden first:pt-[1px]"><div class="markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full wrap-break-word light markdown-new-styling"><p data-start="0" data-end="189">OK, mình hiểu ý bạn rồi 👍<br data-start="26" data-end="29">
👉 <strong data-start="32" data-end="78">Bạn MUỐN giữ <code data-start="47" data-end="56">App.jsx</code> gần như y chang vậy</strong>, không thêm logic phức tạp<br data-start="105" data-end="108">
👉 Nhưng hiện tại <strong data-start="126" data-end="143">không hiện gì</strong> là vì <strong data-start="150" data-end="179">2 lý do kỹ thuật bắt buộc</strong> dưới đây.</p>
<hr data-start="191" data-end="194">
<h2 data-start="196" data-end="236">❌ Vì sao code hiện tại KHÔNG hiện gì?</h2>
<h3 data-start="238" data-end="265">1️⃣ <code data-start="246" data-end="253">Popup</code> cần <code data-start="258" data-end="265">count</code></h3>
<p data-start="266" data-end="300">Trong <code data-start="272" data-end="283">Popup.jsx</code> của bạn có dòng:</p>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="302" data-end="340"><div class="contain-inline-size rounded-2xl corner-superellipse/1.1 relative bg-token-sidebar-surface-primary"><div class="flex items-center text-token-text-secondary px-4 py-2 text-xs font-sans justify-between h-9 bg-token-sidebar-surface-primary select-none rounded-t-2xl corner-t-superellipse/1.1">js</div><div class="sticky top-[calc(var(--sticky-padding-top)+9*var(--spacing))]"><div class="absolute end-0 bottom-0 flex h-9 items-center pe-2"><div class="bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary text-token-text-secondary flex items-center gap-4 rounded-sm px-2 font-sans text-xs"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none py-1" aria-label="Sao chép"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-j9921kii.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg>Sao chép mã</button></div></div></div><div class="overflow-y-auto p-4" dir="ltr"><code class="whitespace-pre! language-js"><span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">if</span></span><span> (count &lt;= </span><span><span class="hljs-number">0</span></span><span>) </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">return</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-literal">null</span></span><span>;
</span></span></code></div></div></pre>
<p data-start="342" data-end="381">👉 Nhưng trong <code data-start="357" data-end="366">App.jsx</code> bạn đang dùng:</p>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="383" data-end="403"><div class="contain-inline-size rounded-2xl corner-superellipse/1.1 relative bg-token-sidebar-surface-primary"><div class="flex items-center text-token-text-secondary px-4 py-2 text-xs font-sans justify-between h-9 bg-token-sidebar-surface-primary select-none rounded-t-2xl corner-t-superellipse/1.1">jsx</div><div class="sticky top-[calc(var(--sticky-padding-top)+9*var(--spacing))]"><div class="absolute end-0 bottom-0 flex h-9 items-center pe-2"><div class="bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary text-token-text-secondary flex items-center gap-4 rounded-sm px-2 font-sans text-xs"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none py-1" aria-label="Sao chép"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-j9921kii.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg>Sao chép mã</button></div></div></div><div class="overflow-y-auto p-4" dir="ltr"><code class="whitespace-pre! language-jsx"><span><span>&lt;</span><span><span class="hljs-title class_">Popup</span></span><span> /&gt;
</span></span></code></div></div></pre>
<p data-start="405" data-end="500">➡️ <code data-start="408" data-end="415">count</code> = <code data-start="418" data-end="429">undefined</code> → <code data-start="432" data-end="444">count &lt;= 0</code> = <code data-start="447" data-end="453">true</code><br data-start="453" data-end="456">
⛔ Popup <strong data-start="464" data-end="500">bị return null → không render gì</strong></p>
<hr data-start="502" data-end="505">
<h3 data-start="507" data-end="556">2️⃣ <code data-start="515" data-end="522">Popup</code> là <strong data-start="526" data-end="535">badge</strong>, nó KHÔNG tự có icon</h3>
<p data-start="557" data-end="641"><code data-start="557" data-end="564">Popup</code> chỉ là <strong data-start="572" data-end="597">vòng tròn đỏ số lượng</strong>,<br data-start="598" data-end="601">
❌ nó <strong data-start="606" data-end="641">không tự hiển thị icon giỏ hàng</strong></p>
<p data-start="643" data-end="707">👉 Nếu không có icon → bạn sẽ <strong data-start="673" data-end="707">không thấy gì để gắn popup lên</strong></p>
<hr data-start="709" data-end="712">
<h2 data-start="714" data-end="758">✅ Cách ĐÚNG nhưng vẫn GIỮ App.jsx RẤT GỌN</h2>
<p data-start="760" data-end="770">Bạn nói:</p>
<blockquote data-start="771" data-end="810">
<p data-start="773" data-end="810"><em data-start="773" data-end="810">“tôi chỉ muốn App.jsx code như này”</em></p>
</blockquote>
<p data-start="812" data-end="879">👉 OK, ta <strong data-start="822" data-end="852">chỉ thêm TỐI THIỂU 1 props</strong>, không thêm logic gì khác.</p>
<hr data-start="881" data-end="884">
<h2 data-start="886" data-end="915">✅ App.jsx (CHỈ SỬA 1 DÒNG)</h2>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="917" data-end="1138"><div class="contain-inline-size rounded-2xl corner-superellipse/1.1 relative bg-token-sidebar-surface-primary"><div class="flex items-center text-token-text-secondary px-4 py-2 text-xs font-sans justify-between h-9 bg-token-sidebar-surface-primary select-none rounded-t-2xl corner-t-superellipse/1.1">jsx</div><div class="sticky top-[calc(var(--sticky-padding-top)+9*var(--spacing))]"><div class="absolute end-0 bottom-0 flex h-9 items-center pe-2"><div class="bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary text-token-text-secondary flex items-center gap-4 rounded-sm px-2 font-sans text-xs"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none py-1" aria-label="Sao chép"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-j9921kii.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg>Sao chép mã</button></div></div></div><div class="overflow-y-auto p-4" dir="ltr"><code class="whitespace-pre! language-jsx"><span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">import</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-title class_">Popup</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">from</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-string">"./components/common/Popup"</span></span><span>;
</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">import</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-title class_">Rating</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">from</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-string">"./components/common/Rating"</span></span><span>;

</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">function</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-title function_">App</span></span><span>(</span><span><span class="hljs-params"></span></span><span>) {
  </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">return</span></span><span> (
    </span><span><span class="language-xml"><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;&gt;</span></span></span><span>
      </span><span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">Popup</span></span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-attr">count</span></span><span>=</span><span><span class="hljs-string">{1}</span></span><span> /&gt;
      </span><span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">Rating</span></span></span><span> /&gt;
    </span><span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;/&gt;</span></span><span>
  );
}

</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">export</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">default</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-title class_">App</span></span><span>;
</span></span></code></div></div></pre>
<p data-start="1140" data-end="1172">👉 <strong data-start="1143" data-end="1172">Popup sẽ hiện số <code data-start="1162" data-end="1165">1</code> ngay</strong></p>
<hr data-start="1174" data-end="1177">
<h2 data-start="1179" data-end="1235">⚠️ Nhưng vẫn chưa thấy icon (điều BẮT BUỘC phải hiểu)</h2>
<p data-start="1237" data-end="1279">Popup <strong data-start="1243" data-end="1270">không thể đứng một mình</strong>, nó cần:</p>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="1281" data-end="1356"><div class="contain-inline-size rounded-2xl corner-superellipse/1.1 relative bg-token-sidebar-surface-primary"><div class="flex items-center text-token-text-secondary px-4 py-2 text-xs font-sans justify-between h-9 bg-token-sidebar-surface-primary select-none rounded-t-2xl corner-t-superellipse/1.1">jsx</div><div class="sticky top-[calc(var(--sticky-padding-top)+9*var(--spacing))]"><div class="absolute end-0 bottom-0 flex h-9 items-center pe-2"><div class="bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary text-token-text-secondary flex items-center gap-4 rounded-sm px-2 font-sans text-xs"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none py-1" aria-label="Sao chép"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-j9921kii.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg>Sao chép mã</button></div></div></div><div class="overflow-y-auto p-4" dir="ltr"><code class="whitespace-pre! language-jsx"><span><span>&lt;div style={{ </span><span><span class="hljs-attr">position</span></span><span>: </span><span><span class="hljs-string">"relative"</span></span><span> }}&gt;
  </span><span><span class="hljs-variable constant_">ICON</span></span><span>
  &lt;</span><span><span class="hljs-title class_">Popup</span></span><span> /&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
</span></span></code></div></div></pre>
<p data-start="1358" data-end="1468">Nếu bạn <strong data-start="1366" data-end="1396">nhất quyết không muốn icon</strong>, thì Popup chỉ là:<br>
🔴 <strong data-start="1419" data-end="1448">một vòng tròn đỏ trôi nổi</strong>, nhìn rất khó thấy.</p>
<hr data-start="1470" data-end="1473">
<h2 data-start="1475" data-end="1527">✅ Nếu bạn MUỐN icon mà KHÔNG đổi cấu trúc App.jsx</h2>
<h3 data-start="1529" data-end="1552">👉 Cách chuẩn nhất:</h3>
<p data-start="1553" data-end="1590">👉 <strong data-start="1556" data-end="1590">Đưa icon vào trong <code data-start="1577" data-end="1588">Popup.jsx</code></strong></p>
<h3 data-start="1592" data-end="1622"><code data-start="1596" data-end="1607">Popup.jsx</code> (tự chứa icon)</h3>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="1624" data-end="2285"><div class="contain-inline-size rounded-2xl corner-superellipse/1.1 relative bg-token-sidebar-surface-primary"><div class="flex items-center text-token-text-secondary px-4 py-2 text-xs font-sans justify-between h-9 bg-token-sidebar-surface-primary select-none rounded-t-2xl corner-t-superellipse/1.1">jsx</div><div class="sticky top-[calc(var(--sticky-padding-top)+9*var(--spacing))]"><div class="absolute end-0 bottom-0 flex h-9 items-center pe-2"><div class="bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary text-token-text-secondary flex items-center gap-4 rounded-sm px-2 font-sans text-xs"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none py-1" aria-label="Sao chép"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-j9921kii.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg>Sao chép mã</button></div></div></div><div class="overflow-y-auto p-4" dir="ltr"><code class="whitespace-pre! language-jsx"><span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">import</span></span><span> cartIcon </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">from</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-string">"../../assets/icon/shopping-cart.png"</span></span><span>;

</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">const</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-title function_">Popup</span></span><span> = (</span><span><span class="hljs-params">{ count = <span class="hljs-number">1</span></span></span><span> }) =&gt; {
  </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">return</span></span><span> (
    </span><span><span class="language-xml"><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">div</span></span></span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-attr">style</span></span><span>=</span><span><span class="hljs-string">{{</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-attr">position:</span></span><span> "</span><span><span class="hljs-attr">relative</span></span><span>", </span><span><span class="hljs-attr">display:</span></span><span> "</span><span><span class="hljs-attr">inline-block</span></span><span>" }}&gt;
      </span><span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">img</span></span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-attr">src</span></span><span>=</span><span><span class="hljs-string">{cartIcon}</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-attr">width</span></span><span>=</span><span><span class="hljs-string">{40}</span></span><span> /&gt;

      {count &gt; 0 &amp;&amp; (
        </span><span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">span</span></span></span><span>
          </span><span><span class="hljs-attr">style</span></span><span>=</span><span><span class="hljs-string">{{</span></span><span>
            </span><span><span class="hljs-attr">position:</span></span><span> "</span><span><span class="hljs-attr">absolute</span></span><span>",
            </span><span><span class="hljs-attr">top:</span></span><span> "</span><span><span class="hljs-attr">-6px</span></span><span>",
            </span><span><span class="hljs-attr">right:</span></span><span> "</span><span><span class="hljs-attr">-6px</span></span><span>",
            </span><span><span class="hljs-attr">background:</span></span><span> "</span><span><span class="hljs-attr">red</span></span><span>",
            </span><span><span class="hljs-attr">color:</span></span><span> "</span><span><span class="hljs-attr">white</span></span><span>",
            </span><span><span class="hljs-attr">borderRadius:</span></span><span> "</span><span><span class="hljs-attr">50</span></span><span>%",
            </span><span><span class="hljs-attr">padding:</span></span><span> "</span><span><span class="hljs-attr">3px</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-attr">7px</span></span><span>",
            </span><span><span class="hljs-attr">fontSize:</span></span><span> "</span><span><span class="hljs-attr">12px</span></span><span>",
            </span><span><span class="hljs-attr">fontWeight:</span></span><span> "</span><span><span class="hljs-attr">bold</span></span><span>",
          }}
        &gt;
          {count}
        </span><span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;/<span class="hljs-name">span</span></span></span><span>&gt;
      )}
    </span><span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;/<span class="hljs-name">div</span></span></span><span>&gt;
  );
};

</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">export</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">default</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-title class_">Popup</span></span><span>;
</span></span></code></div></div></pre>
