nvert w-full wrap-break-word light markdown-new-styling"><p data-start="0" data-end="105">Ok hiểu vibe rồi 😄<br data-start="19" data-end="22">
Team đang chia việc mà bạn sợ làm mỗi <code data-start="60" data-end="70">Quantity</code> với <code data-start="75" data-end="81">Size</code> nhìn hơi ít đúng không.</p>
<p data-start="107" data-end="155">Vậy bạn làm thêm <code data-start="124" data-end="135">About.jsx</code> là hợp lý đó 👍 vì:</p>
<ul data-start="157" data-end="268">
<li data-start="157" data-end="198">
<p data-start="159" data-end="198">Trang About chỉ text + hình → làm nhanh</p>
</li>
<li data-start="199" data-end="232">
<p data-start="201" data-end="232">Nhưng vẫn tính là 1 page đầy đủ</p>
</li>
<li data-start="233" data-end="268">
<p data-start="235" data-end="268">Nhìn task “có trọng lượng” hơn 😎</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="270" data-end="273">
<h1 data-start="275" data-end="294">✅ Tạo <code data-start="283" data-end="294">About.jsx</code></h1>
<p data-start="296" data-end="320">📂 <code data-start="299" data-end="320">src/pages/About.jsx</code></p>
<p data-start="322" data-end="366">Ví dụ đơn giản nhưng nhìn vẫn chuyên nghiệp:</p>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="368" data-end="1157"><div class="contain-inline-size rounded-2xl corner-superellipse/1.1 relative bg-token-sidebar-surface-primary"><div class="flex items-center text-token-text-secondary px-4 py-2 text-xs font-sans justify-between h-9 bg-token-sidebar-surface-primary select-none rounded-t-2xl corner-t-superellipse/1.1">jsx</div><div class="sticky top-[calc(var(--sticky-padding-top)+9*var(--spacing))]"><div class="absolute end-0 bottom-0 flex h-9 items-center pe-2"><div class="bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary text-token-text-secondary flex items-center gap-4 rounded-sm px-2 font-sans text-xs"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none py-1" aria-label="Sao chép"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-j9921kii.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg>Sao chép mã</button></div></div></div><div class="overflow-y-auto p-4" dir="ltr"><code class="whitespace-pre! language-jsx"><span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">import</span></span><span> aboutImage </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">from</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-string">"../assets/about-shoes.jpg"</span></span><span>;

</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">function</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-title function_">About</span></span><span>(</span><span><span class="hljs-params"></span></span><span>) {
  </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">return</span></span><span> (
    </span><span><span class="language-xml"><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">div</span></span></span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-attr">style</span></span><span>=</span><span><span class="hljs-string">{{</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-attr">padding:</span></span><span> "</span><span><span class="hljs-attr">40px</span></span><span>" }}&gt;
      </span><span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">h2</span></span></span><span>&gt;Về Chúng Tôi</span><span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;/<span class="hljs-name">h2</span></span></span><span>&gt;

      </span><span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">img</span></span></span><span>
        </span><span><span class="hljs-attr">src</span></span><span>=</span><span><span class="hljs-string">{aboutImage}</span></span><span>
        </span><span><span class="hljs-attr">alt</span></span><span>=</span><span><span class="hljs-string">"about"</span></span><span>
        </span><span><span class="hljs-attr">style</span></span><span>=</span><span><span class="hljs-string">{{</span></span><span>
          </span><span><span class="hljs-attr">width:</span></span><span> "</span><span><span class="hljs-attr">100</span></span><span>%",
          </span><span><span class="hljs-attr">maxWidth:</span></span><span> "</span><span><span class="hljs-attr">600px</span></span><span>",
          </span><span><span class="hljs-attr">borderRadius:</span></span><span> "</span><span><span class="hljs-attr">10px</span></span><span>",
          </span><span><span class="hljs-attr">margin:</span></span><span> "</span><span><span class="hljs-attr">20px</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-attr">0</span></span><span>"
        }}
      /&gt;

      </span><span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">p</span></span></span><span>&gt;
        Chúng tôi là cửa hàng chuyên cung cấp các mẫu giày thời trang,
        thể thao và cao cấp với chất lượng đảm bảo.
      </span><span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;/<span class="hljs-name">p</span></span></span><span>&gt;

      </span><span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">p</span></span></span><span>&gt;
        Sứ mệnh của chúng tôi là mang đến sự thoải mái, phong cách
        và giá trị tốt nhất cho khách hàng.
      </span><span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;/<span class="hljs-name">p</span></span></span><span>&gt;

      </span><span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">p</span></span></span><span>&gt;
        Cam kết sản phẩm chính hãng – đổi trả trong 7 ngày – giao hàng toàn quốc.
      </span><span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;/<span class="hljs-name">p</span></span></span><span>&gt;
    </span><span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;/<span class="hljs-name">div</span></span></span><span>&gt;
  );
}

</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">export</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">default</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-title class_">About</span></span><span>;
</span></span></code></div></div></pre>
<hr data-start="1159" data-end="1162">
<h1 data-start="1164" data-end="1212">✅ Nếu dùng React Router thì thêm vào <code data-start="1203" data-end="1212">App.jsx</code></h1>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="1214" data-end="1484"><div class="contain-inline-size rounded-2xl corner-superellipse/1.1 relative bg-token-sidebar-surface-primary"><div class="flex items-center text-token-text-secondary px-4 py-2 text-xs font-sans justify-between h-9 bg-token-sidebar-surface-primary select-none rounded-t-2xl corner-t-superellipse/1.1">jsx</div><div class="sticky top-[calc(var(--sticky-padding-top)+9*var(--spacing))]"><div class="absolute end-0 bottom-0 flex h-9 items-center pe-2"><div class="bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary text-token-text-secondary flex items-center gap-4 rounded-sm px-2 font-sans text-xs"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none py-1" aria-label="Sao chép"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-j9921kii.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg>Sao chép mã</button></div></div></div><div class="overflow-y-auto p-4" dir="ltr"><code class="whitespace-pre! language-jsx"><span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">import</span></span><span> { </span><span><span class="hljs-title class_">BrowserRouter</span></span><span>, </span><span><span class="hljs-title class_">Routes</span></span><span>, </span><span><span class="hljs-title class_">Route</span></span><span> } </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">from</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-string">"react-router-dom"</span></span><span>;
</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">import</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-title class_">About</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">from</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-string">"./pages/About"</span></span><span>;

</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">function</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-title function_">App</span></span><span>(</span><span><span class="hljs-params"></span></span><span>) {
  </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">return</span></span><span> (
    </span><span><span class="language-xml"><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">BrowserRouter</span></span></span></span><span>&gt;
      </span><span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">Routes</span></span></span><span>&gt;
        </span><span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">Route</span></span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-attr">path</span></span><span>=</span><span><span class="hljs-string">"/about"</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-attr">element</span></span><span>=</span><span><span class="hljs-string">{</span></span><span>&lt;</span><span><span class="hljs-attr">About</span></span><span> /&gt;} /&gt;
      </span><span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;/<span class="hljs-name">Routes</span></span></span><span>&gt;
    </span><span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;/<span class="hljs-name">BrowserRouter</span></span></span><span>&gt;
  );
}
</span></span></code></div></div></pre>
<hr data-start="1486" data-end="1489">
