<hr data-start="1627" data-end="1630">
<h1 data-start="1632" data-end="1677">🧠 Hiểu sâu hơn chút (quan trọng cho đồ án)</h1>
<ul data-start="1679" data-end="1835">
<li data-start="1679" data-end="1717">
<p data-start="1681" data-end="1717">Size + Quantity = <strong data-start="1699" data-end="1717">logic bán hàng</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start="1718" data-end="1750">
